2026-10-08T23:53:25.666Z","repositoryId":1309799404,"sha":"9d026047ee4a2d9b9c51680299a5c761ff015189"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:53:25.666Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/2b7e8f76ff2648e3a5e02375168c02a615ed9e65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T13:53:11Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T13:53:11Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"message":"Merge feature/milestone-4-extension-points into main\n\nMilestone 4: Extension Points v0 (Header Actions), verified end to end\n(lint, unit tests for both projects, empty-shell gate, production\nbuilds, live-browser Playwright verification). See\ndocs/validation-reports/milestone-4.md.","tree":{"sha":"590fec8a426a24b49a0ed94ecbd0f2ae27af7093","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/trees/590fec8a426a24b49a0ed94ecbd0f2ae27af7093"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/commits/2b7e8f76ff2648e3a5e02375168c02a615ed9e65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/2b7e8f76ff2648e3a5e02375168c02a615ed9e65","node_id":"C_kwDOThHz7NoAKDJiN2U4Zjc2ZmYyNjQ4ZTNhNWUwMjM3NTE2OGMwMmE2MTVlZDllNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/e7f75ad51311d5a0cc4f0d3c8cf8e98440a42a5c","sha":"e7f75ad51311d5a0cc4f0d3c8cf8e98440a42a5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/e7f75ad51311d5a0cc4f0d3c8cf8e98440a42a5c"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/b374b6e832b8f3dfad19c4213b0165078e7f67dc","sha":"b374b6e832b8f3dfad19c4213b0165078e7f67dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/b374b6e832b8f3dfad19c4213b0165078e7f67dc"}],"sha":"2b7e8f76ff2648e3a5e02375168c02a615ed9e65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/2b7e8f76ff2648e3a5e02375168c02a615ed9e65"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/b374b6e832b8f3dfad19c4213b0165078e7f67dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T13:53:06Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T13:53:06Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"message":"Implement Milestone 4: Extension Points v0 (Header Actions)\n\nValidates ARCH-2026-03 §5''s registration-with-lifecycle mechanism — a\nfourth, structurally distinct Shell Public API communication shape\nalongside Toast (fire-and-forget), Theme (read-only live context), and\nDialog (request/response) from Milestones 2 and 3.\n\nArchitecture:\n- A generic ExtensionRegistry<T extends {id: string}> owns register/\n  dispose/deregisterAll/duplicate-detection once, with no Header-Action-\n  specific knowledge, so a future contribution type (Navigation, Toolbar\n  Actions, Keyboard Shortcuts, Search Providers, ...) is expected to\n  instantiate its own registry rather than requiring changes here.\n- ShellApiService.registerHeaderAction wraps that registry behind one\n  typed public method (matching the existing per-capability style, not\n  a generic registerAnything()), and deregisterAllContributions bulk-\n  removes everything one application owns.\n- Ownership is attributed entirely by the shell, not by the caller:\n  RemoteMountComponent overrides the SHELL_API DI token per mount with a\n  scoped wrapper closing over the manifest entry''s own id, constructed\n  before the mounted application''s code ever runs. An application can\n  neither impersonate another application''s id, obtain a disposer for a\n  contribution it doesn''t own, nor mutate one (no mutation API exists —\n  update requires dispose-then-re-register).\n- Disposal is idempotent by construction (a filtered array removal by\n  id, not a stateful flag), so calling a disposer after its owning\n  application has already been unmounted is safe and non-fatal.\n- HeaderActionsHostComponent is the third shell-exclusive-tier UI\n  component (after Toast, Dialog), rendering the live registry sorted\n  by priority; entitlement is captured at registration but enforcement\n  remains a stub, consistent with PlatformManifestService''s existing\n  \"always allow\" precedent.\n- hello-world-app registers a header action on init and can manually\n  unregister/re-register it, proving both teardown paths.\n\nVerified:\n- 58 unit tests (12 new): duplicate-id containment across owners,\n  idempotent/post-unload disposer safety, cross-owner isolation via\n  deregisterAllContributions, and a register → unregister → register →\n  unload → register consistency cycle.\n- Lint clean, empty-shell gate passes, both projects build.\n- Live-browser (Playwright) verification: header action renders in the\n  shell header on mount, invoking it triggers the app''s handler, manual\n  unregister/re-register both work in the running app, Toast and Dialog\n  regressions checked.\n\nSee docs/validation-reports/milestone-4.md for the full Architecture\nValidation Report, including the future-compatibility case for\nNavigation, Toolbar Actions, Quick Actions, Keyboard Shortcuts, Search\nProviders, and Command Palette reusing this mechanism without redesign.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"590fec8a426a24b49a0ed94ecbd0f2ae27af7093","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/trees/590fec8a426a24b49a0ed94ecbd0f2ae27af7093"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/commits/b374b6e832b8f3dfad19c4213b0165078e7f67dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/b374b6e832b8f3dfad19c4213b0165078e7f67dc","node_id":"C_kwDOThHz7NoAKGIzNzRiNmU4MzJiOGYzZGZhZDE5YzQyMTNiMDE2NTA3OGU3ZjY3ZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/e7f75ad51311d5a0cc4f0d3c8cf8e98440a42a5c","sha":"e7f75ad51311d5a0cc4f0d3c8cf8e98440a42a5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/e7f75ad51311d5a0cc4f0d3c8cf8e98440a42a5c"}],"sha":"b374b6e832b8f3dfad19c4213b0165078e7f67dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/b374b6e832b8f3dfad19c4213b0165078e7f67dc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/e7f75ad51311d5a0cc4f0d3c8cf8e98440a42a5c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T13:29:03Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T13:29:03Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"message":"Merge feature/milestone-3-dialogs into main\n\nMilestone 3: Shell Public API v0 (Dialogs), verified end to end (lint, unit\ntests for both projects, empty-shell gate, production builds, live-browser\nPlaywright verification). See docs/validation-reports/milestone-3.md.","tree":{"sha":"2ecededa2df90f91a0e8c7e124d6bea8ff690026","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/trees/2ecededa2df90f91a0e8c7e124d6bea8ff690026"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/commits/e7f75ad51311d5a0cc4f0d3c8cf8e98440a42a5c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/e7f75ad51311d5a0cc4f0d3c8cf8e98440a42a5c","node_id":"C_kwDOThHz7NoAKGU3Zjc1YWQ1MTMxMWQ1YTBjYzRmMGQzYzhjZjhlOTg0NDBhNDJhNWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/178d3d1082ca53d178680d8056b0513701e4bc17","sha":"178d3d1082ca53d178680d8056b0513701e4bc17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/178d3d1082ca53d178680d8056b0513701e4bc17"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/8bb7310962f83d0dc1f443eb2e1814adb05f419d","sha":"8bb7310962f83d0dc1f443eb2e1814adb05f419d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/8bb7310962f83d0dc1f443eb2e1814adb05f419d"}],"sha":"e7f75ad51311d5a0cc4f0d3c8cf8e98440a42a5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/e7f75ad51311d5a0cc4f0d3c8cf8e98440a42a5c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/8bb7310962f83d0dc1f443eb2e1814adb05f419d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T13:28:57Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T13:28:57Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"message":"Implement Milestone 3: Shell Public API v0 (Dialogs)\n\nAdds the third and final base Shell Public API communication shape from\nARCH-2026-03 §3/§4 -- request/response -- completing what Milestone 2 started\nwith Toast (fire-and-forget) and Theme (read-only live context).\n\n- DialogRequest<TResult>/DialogAction<TResult> and openDialog() added to\n  @platform/shell-api-contracts. A dialog''s content is a plain-data shape\n  (title, message, a fixed list of label/value actions) rather than an\n  arbitrary template/portal -- proving the request/response pattern is this\n  milestone''s scope, not a generic content-injection mechanism (ARCH-2026-03\n  §5 Principle 1: registration, not injection).\n- ShellApiService gains the ''dialog'' capability: openDialog() returns a\n  Promise settled by resolveDialog() (user picked an action), dismissDialog()\n  (Escape/backdrop, unless the request is marked non-dismissible), or\n  cancelDialog() (the requesting application is unmounted -- a dialog must\n  never outlive its caller, so this ignores dismissible and always resolves\n  undefined). RemoteMountComponent.ngOnDestroy now calls cancelDialog().\n- New shell-exclusive DialogHostComponent (second tier-3 component after\n  ToastHostComponent) owns the modal chrome: backdrop, initial focus,\n  Tab-cycling focus trap, and Escape/backdrop dismissal. Single-dialog-only\n  is a deliberate, named scope boundary -- stacking is not built here.\n- hello-world-app calls openDialog() and displays the resolved value, with\n  zero dialog-chrome code of its own (grep-confirmed against\n  ShellApiService/DialogHostComponent).\n\n34 unit tests passing across both projects (resolve/dismiss/cancel/\nnot-registered fault paths), lint clean, empty-shell gate passes, both\nproduction builds succeed. Live-verified in a real headless-Chromium session:\ndialog opens, focus trap cycles through both actions and wraps, clicking an\naction resolves the awaited Promise with that action''s value, Escape and\nbackdrop-click both resolve to undefined, and the existing Toast capability\nshows no regression.\n\nSee docs/validation-reports/milestone-3.md for the full Architecture\nValidation Report, including why Extension Points (§5) is the explicit\ncandidate for the next milestone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ecededa2df90f91a0e8c7e124d6bea8ff690026","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/trees/2ecededa2df90f91a0e8c7e124d6bea8ff690026"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/commits/8bb7310962f83d0dc1f443eb2e1814adb05f419d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/8bb7310962f83d0dc1f443eb2e1814adb05f419d","node_id":"C_kwDOThHz7NoAKDhiYjczMTA5NjJmODNkMGRjMWY0NDNlYjJlMTgxNGFkYjA1ZjQxOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/178d3d1082ca53d178680d8056b0513701e4bc17","sha":"178d3d1082ca53d178680d8056b0513701e4bc17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/178d3d1082ca53d178680d8056b0513701e4bc17"}],"sha":"8bb7310962f83d0dc1f443eb2e1814adb05f419d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/8bb7310962f83d0dc1f443eb2e1814adb05f419d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/178d3d1082ca53d178680d8056b0513701e4bc17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:40:32Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:40:32Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"message":"Merge feature/milestone-2-shell-public-api-v0 into main\n\nMilestone 2: Shell Public API v0 (Toast + Theme), verified end to end\n(lint, unit tests for both projects, empty-shell gate, production builds,\nlive-browser Playwright verification). See docs/validation-reports/milestone-2.md.","tree":{"sha":"d2ff19729eaf4807096eba8314b1aeb992a0b1e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/trees/d2ff19729eaf4807096eba8314b1aeb992a0b1e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/commits/178d3d1082ca53d178680d8056b0513701e4bc17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/178d3d1082ca53d178680d8056b0513701e4bc17","node_id":"C_kwDOThHz7NoAKDE3OGQzZDEwODJjYTUzZDE3ODY4MGQ4MDU2YjA1MTM3MDFlNGJjMTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/6ea7e1a173944bec75aaae2f67894cd72dbf354e","sha":"6ea7e1a173944bec75aaae2f67894cd72dbf354e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/6ea7e1a173944bec75aaae2f67894cd72dbf354e"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/e506b27c5487d20625832d0a752bd72c37fb8405","sha":"e506b27c5487d20625832d0a752bd72c37fb8405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/e506b27c5487d20625832d0a752bd72c37fb8405"}],"sha":"178d3d1082ca53d178680d8056b0513701e4bc17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/178d3d1082ca53d178680d8056b0513701e4bc17"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/e506b27c5487d20625832d0a752bd72c37fb8405/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:39:35Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:39:35Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"message":"Implement Milestone 2: Shell Public API v0 (Toast + Theme)\n\nAdds the smallest possible slice of the Shell Public API (ARCH-2026-03 §3/§4)\nto validate both base communication patterns:\n\n- Toast (application -> shell, Service API): hello-world-app injects SHELL_API\n  and calls showToast(); the shell owns rendering via a new shell-exclusive\n  toast host (ShellApiService, ToastHostComponent). No toast markup exists in\n  the application.\n- Theme (shell -> application, live context): ShellApiService exposes\n  theme$ as a read-only Observable, driven only by the shell''s own header\n  toggle; hello-world-app consumes it reactively and never writes.\n\nNew @platform/shell-api-contracts package (mirrors @platform/manifest-schema''s\npattern) exposes only ToastRequest, Theme, the ShellPublicApi interface, and\nthe SHELL_API injection token -- applications depend on this, never on the\nshell''s concrete implementation, so the reference application can be removed\nwithout any change to the Shell Public API.\n\nShellApiService backs both capabilities with a private capability registry,\nso a call against an unregistered capability fails contained and diagnosable\ninstead of throwing -- verified with dedicated fault-path unit tests.\n\nLive-verified in a real browser: toast fires and auto-dismisses; app-rendered\ntheme updates reactively when the shell toggles it, with no reload/remount.\n\nFixes a build-breaking issue surfaced by this milestone: a workspace package\nthat imports @angular/core (shell-api-contracts'' InjectionToken) must be\nincluded in each project''s tsconfig.app.json program for Native Federation''s\nshared-package bundling to succeed, unlike a pure-TypeScript package like\nmanifest-schema, which only produces a type-checking warning. Fixed via\nexplicit include + rootDir in both tsconfig.app.json files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d2ff19729eaf4807096eba8314b1aeb992a0b1e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/trees/d2ff19729eaf4807096eba8314b1aeb992a0b1e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/commits/e506b27c5487d20625832d0a752bd72c37fb8405","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/e506b27c5487d20625832d0a752bd72c37fb8405","node_id":"C_kwDOThHz7NoAKGU1MDZiMjdjNTQ4N2QyMDYyNTgzMmQwYTc1MmJkNzJjMzdmYjg0MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/6ea7e1a173944bec75aaae2f67894cd72dbf354e","sha":"6ea7e1a173944bec75aaae2f67894cd72dbf354e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/6ea7e1a173944bec75aaae2f67894cd72dbf354e"}],"sha":"e506b27c5487d20625832d0a752bd72c37fb8405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/e506b27c5487d20625832d0a752bd72c37fb8405"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/6ea7e1a173944bec75aaae2f67894cd72dbf354e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:12:56Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:12:56Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"message":"Merge feature/milestone-1-walking-skeleton into main\n\nMilestone 1 (walking skeleton): shell + hello-world-app composed via\nNative Federation, manifest-driven lifecycle, ESLint boundary\nenforcement, CI empty-shell gate, and live-verified resilience.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"198d7f5de5ad03724c84328ef61651e4e0569a8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/trees/198d7f5de5ad03724c84328ef61651e4e0569a8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/commits/6ea7e1a173944bec75aaae2f67894cd72dbf354e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/6ea7e1a173944bec75aaae2f67894cd72dbf354e","node_id":"C_kwDOThHz7NoAKDZlYTdlMWExNzM5NDRiZWM3NWFhYWUyZjY3ODk0Y2Q3MmRiZjM1NGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/a5028d8f1aca741d0c8ca3ad5204ed8c91010b65","sha":"a5028d8f1aca741d0c8ca3ad5204ed8c91010b65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/a5028d8f1aca741d0c8ca3ad5204ed8c91010b65"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/1a817a3a379da30a83f45ee6d73e40967858d73d","sha":"1a817a3a379da30a83f45ee6d73e40967858d73d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/1a817a3a379da30a83f45ee6d73e40967858d73d"}],"sha":"6ea7e1a173944bec75aaae2f67894cd72dbf354e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/6ea7e1a173944bec75aaae2f67894cd72dbf354e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/1a817a3a379da30a83f45ee6d73e40967858d73d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:12:23Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:12:23Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"message":"Implement Milestone 1: shell + hello-world-app walking skeleton\n\nRestructures the workspace into two isolated Angular projects (shell,\nhello-world-app) per ADR-001, wires Native Federation between them, and\nimplements the full application lifecycle (Discovery through Unmount)\ndriven by a platform manifest validated against @platform/manifest-schema.\n\nIncludes an ESLint-enforced shell/application import boundary, a CI\npipeline with the permanent empty-shell gate, live-verified resilience\nagainst unreachable/incompatible/non-conforming remotes, an add/remove\nrunbook, and the Milestone 1 Architecture Validation Report.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"198d7f5de5ad03724c84328ef61651e4e0569a8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/trees/198d7f5de5ad03724c84328ef61651e4e0569a8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/commits/1a817a3a379da30a83f45ee6d73e40967858d73d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/1a817a3a379da30a83f45ee6d73e40967858d73d","node_id":"C_kwDOThHz7NoAKDFhODE3YTNhMzc5ZGEzMGE4M2Y0NWVlNmQ3M2U0MDk2Nzg1OGQ3M2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commit/a5028d8f1aca741d0c8ca3ad5204ed8c91010b65","sha":"a5028d8f1aca741d0c8ca3ad5204ed8c91010b65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/a5028d8f1aca741d0c8ca3ad5204ed8c91010b65"}],"sha":"1a817a3a379da30a83f45ee6d73e40967858d73d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/1a817a3a379da30a83f45ee6d73e40967858d73d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/commits/a5028d8f1aca741d0c8ca3ad5204ed8c91010b65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T10:13:20Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T10:13:20Z","email":"kunal@Admins-Mac-mini.local","name":"Kunal"},"message":"Add CLAUDE.md with ratified architecture rules; update README\n\nCLAUDE.md now encodes the 10 ratified ARCH-2026-06 decisions (plus\naddenda) as binding rules for future work in this repo, and\ninstructs keeping README.md current as new work lands. README.md\nnow describes the project and links the architecture decision docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9c8edc522dc9fcfd1fdeb95a0abb232eb2c5d68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/trees/c9c8edc522dc9fcfd1fdeb95a0abb232eb2c5d68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/letusDeliver/multi-app-architecture-system/git/commits/a5028d8f1aca741d0c8ca3ad5204ed8c91010b65","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com