Veselin Iordanov"},"authoredDate":"2026-07-23T11:32:09Z","committedDate":"2026-07-23T11:32:09Z","committer":{"account":null,"email":"vesco@jobs.bg","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:53:30.374Z","repositoryId":1309869314,"sha":"7f4f1ee3975c56c44e2246fd5259ac08e6d732a5"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T23:53:30.374Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/c15611de9692c4e41e68ec2dbf9b7b3fbea6611f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T20:59:22Z","email":"vesco@jobs.bg","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T20:59:22Z","email":"vesco@jobs.bg","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"message":"feat(security): bind user claims to gateway assertion (CRIT-3.2)\n\nWire claims.Server() so a direct mTLS caller cannot forge x-md-global-*\nclaims; default mode \"warn\". Bump go-tangra-common to v1.20.0.","tree":{"sha":"a1f66edf28d5d49aeaf5e872f5343d6d208df661","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/git/trees/a1f66edf28d5d49aeaf5e872f5343d6d208df661"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/git/commits/c15611de9692c4e41e68ec2dbf9b7b3fbea6611f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commit/c15611de9692c4e41e68ec2dbf9b7b3fbea6611f","node_id":"C_kwDOThMFAtoAKGMxNTYxMWRlOTY5MmM0ZTQxZTY4ZWMyZGJmOWI3YjNmYmVhNjYxMWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commit/617dfa04f75d084b3614cfb0f1bd305c083b86ef","sha":"617dfa04f75d084b3614cfb0f1bd305c083b86ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/617dfa04f75d084b3614cfb0f1bd305c083b86ef"}],"sha":"c15611de9692c4e41e68ec2dbf9b7b3fbea6611f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/c15611de9692c4e41e68ec2dbf9b7b3fbea6611f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/617dfa04f75d084b3614cfb0f1bd305c083b86ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T23:55:17Z","email":"vesco@jobs.bg","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T23:55:17Z","email":"vesco@jobs.bg","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"message":"feat(frontend): rework sessions, dhcp & artifacts pages to Vben style\n\nThe sessions, DHCP and artifacts pages were still hand-rolled HTML tables\nwith raw Tailwind, which clashed with the ant-design/Vben styling of the\nrest of the shell. Rebuilt them to match:\n\n- Sessions: ant-design Table with state Tags; the timeline is now a proper\n  Modal containing an ant Timeline colour-coded by event outcome, plus the\n  evidence bundle - replacing the bespoke popup.\n- DHCP: Card-based layout with a status Badge and confirmed enable/disable,\n  an InputNumber lease-TTL, a subnet editor, an ant Alert + Table for rogue\n  DHCP servers, and an ant Table of active leases.\n- Artifacts: ant Table with kind/protocol Tags and Modal.confirm delete, plus\n  the boot-path transfer log as a second table.\n\nAll destructive actions use Modal.confirm and notification toasts. Adds the\nsession.noEvents and dhcp.noSubnets empty-state strings.","tree":{"sha":"838273836e0ef8f27da5a4df6987ef3910c10189","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/git/trees/838273836e0ef8f27da5a4df6987ef3910c10189"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/git/commits/617dfa04f75d084b3614cfb0f1bd305c083b86ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commit/617dfa04f75d084b3614cfb0f1bd305c083b86ef","node_id":"C_kwDOThMFAtoAKDYxN2RmYTA0Zjc1ZDA4NGIzNjE0Y2ZiMGYxYmQzMDVjMDgzYjg2ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commit/1ae2a81faffc80580de5014607a0b46b765e54fc","sha":"1ae2a81faffc80580de5014607a0b46b765e54fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/1ae2a81faffc80580de5014607a0b46b765e54fc"}],"sha":"617dfa04f75d084b3614cfb0f1bd305c083b86ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/617dfa04f75d084b3614cfb0f1bd305c083b86ef"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/1ae2a81faffc80580de5014607a0b46b765e54fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T23:23:27Z","email":"vesco@jobs.bg","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T23:23:27Z","email":"vesco@jobs.bg","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"message":"feat(frontend): make unknown boots a permanent tab\n\nPreviously the unknown-boots panel only rendered when boots existed, so with\nan empty upstream it was invisible and undiscoverable. Match the netbootd UI:\nsplit the Machines page into a Tabs layout with an always-present\n''Unknown Boots'' tab carrying a live count badge and an empty state, so an\noperator can always find it (and see at a glance when a rogue MAC appears).","tree":{"sha":"74686367d01726292e08f24d1bdbe0af320fac2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/git/trees/74686367d01726292e08f24d1bdbe0af320fac2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/git/commits/1ae2a81faffc80580de5014607a0b46b765e54fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commit/1ae2a81faffc80580de5014607a0b46b765e54fc","node_id":"C_kwDOThMFAtoAKDFhZTJhODFmYWZmYzgwNTgwZGU1MDE0NjA3YTBiNDZiNzY1ZTU0ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commit/a9f25a3a35fd18e25aab32273c40d5e5e6c5c99f","sha":"a9f25a3a35fd18e25aab32273c40d5e5e6c5c99f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/a9f25a3a35fd18e25aab32273c40d5e5e6c5c99f"}],"sha":"1ae2a81faffc80580de5014607a0b46b765e54fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/1ae2a81faffc80580de5014607a0b46b765e54fc"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/a9f25a3a35fd18e25aab32273c40d5e5e6c5c99f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T23:14:14Z","email":"vesco@jobs.bg","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T23:14:14Z","email":"vesco@jobs.bg","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"message":"feat(frontend): rework machine & profile drawers, first-class unknown boots\n\nAligns the module UI with the universe (netbootd) frontend concepts and the\nTangra shell idiom used by go-tangra-warden, replacing the hand-rolled div\ndrawers and window.confirm/prompt dialogs.\n\nMachine drawer:\n- Rebuilt on useVbenDrawer + ant-design-vue Form with inline validation\n  (MAC, hostname, IPv4, CIDR) so mistakes surface before a 422 round-trip.\n- Network is now a mode selector - Inherit from profile / Production network\n  (the friendly 2-NIC install form) / Advanced netplan JSON - mirroring\n  universe''s MachineDialog instead of a single raw textarea.\n- A dedicated register-unknown mode reuses the same drawer, pre-seeded with\n  the MAC, so promoting an unknown boot is a real form rather than a prompt.\n\nProfile drawer:\n- Rebuilt on useVbenDrawer + ant-design-vue Form, sectioned into Identity /\n  OS & Locale / Access & Packages / Advanced with a password field that is\n  write-only and a clear-password toggle. Line-oriented lists (packages,\n  SSH keys, late commands) are edited one-per-line.\n\nMachine & profile pages:\n- ant-design-vue Table with state/kind Tags, Modal.confirm for destructive\n  actions (provision, delete, cancel) and notification toasts, replacing\n  window.confirm / window.prompt.\n- Unknown boots promoted to a first-class amber-bordered panel with a count\n  and a per-row Register action that opens the drawer in register-unknown\n  mode; hidden when there are none.\n\nAdds the supporting i18n keys (validation, network modes, sections, hints).\nFrontend builds clean (vite + module federation).","tree":{"sha":"20a9af22b094a5636fc97a59cbe55a0b71478ff3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/git/trees/20a9af22b094a5636fc97a59cbe55a0b71478ff3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/git/commits/a9f25a3a35fd18e25aab32273c40d5e5e6c5c99f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commit/a9f25a3a35fd18e25aab32273c40d5e5e6c5c99f","node_id":"C_kwDOThMFAtoAKGE5ZjI1YTNhMzVmZDE4ZTI1YWFiMzIyNzNjNDBkNWU1ZTZjNWM5OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commit/30f48a8edc8095f61699332a9129c0d10fbc49d1","sha":"30f48a8edc8095f61699332a9129c0d10fbc49d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/30f48a8edc8095f61699332a9129c0d10fbc49d1"}],"sha":"a9f25a3a35fd18e25aab32273c40d5e5e6c5c99f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/a9f25a3a35fd18e25aab32273c40d5e5e6c5c99f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/30f48a8edc8095f61699332a9129c0d10fbc49d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T22:22:11Z","email":"vesco@jobs.bg","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T22:22:11Z","email":"vesco@jobs.bg","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"message":"ci: build and push the Docker image to GHCR\n\nThe initial workflow ran tests, buf lint and the frontend build but never\nproduced a container image. Add the docker-build job (GHCR login, metadata\ntags, buildx with GHA cache) that the sibling modules use, triggered on\npushes to a branch or a v* tag, plus the GHCR retention cleanup and the tag\ntriggers that drive semver image tags.","tree":{"sha":"db6281aa930dc1561cc91a05b32ede78f176b20e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/git/trees/db6281aa930dc1561cc91a05b32ede78f176b20e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/git/commits/30f48a8edc8095f61699332a9129c0d10fbc49d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commit/30f48a8edc8095f61699332a9129c0d10fbc49d1","node_id":"C_kwDOThMFAtoAKDMwZjQ4YThlZGM4MDk1ZjYxNjk5MzMyYTkxMjljMGQxMGZiYzQ5ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commit/7f4f1ee3975c56c44e2246fd5259ac08e6d732a5","sha":"7f4f1ee3975c56c44e2246fd5259ac08e6d732a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/7f4f1ee3975c56c44e2246fd5259ac08e6d732a5"}],"sha":"30f48a8edc8095f61699332a9129c0d10fbc49d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/30f48a8edc8095f61699332a9129c0d10fbc49d1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/7f4f1ee3975c56c44e2246fd5259ac08e6d732a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:32:09Z","email":"vesco@jobs.bg","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-23T11:32:09Z","email":"vesco@jobs.bg","name":"Veselin Iordanov"},"message":"feat: add go-tangra-netboot module\n\nTangra control-plane module that federates a remote netbootd (universe)\ninstance into the platform''s gRPC mesh and Vben admin UI.\n\nThe module is a stateless authorizing proxy: machines, profiles, DHCP\nconfiguration, sessions and boot artifacts all live on the netbootd host.\nnetbootd authenticates operators with an HTTP session cookie and exposes a\nsingle coarse operator identity, so this module owns the login handshake,\nthe cookie lifecycle, and all fine-grained authorization.\n\nArchitecture mirrors go-tangra-warden: Kratos v2 with Wire DI, protos\ncompiled by buf into gen/go, internal/{data,service,server} provider sets,\nmTLS via go-tangra-common''s cert bootstrap, audit and metrics middleware,\nand registration with the admin gateway carrying the OpenAPI document,\nproto descriptor and menu definitions.\n\nServices (netboot.service.v1):\n  NetbootMachineService   machines, provisioning, unknown boots\n  NetbootProfileService   autoinstall profiles, seed preview\n  NetbootDhcpService      DHCP scope, leases, foreign-server conflicts\n  NetbootSessionService   provisioning history and event timelines\n  NetbootArtifactService  kernels, initrds, boot-path transfer log\n  NetbootSystemService    health, build info, upstream check, stats\n\nSecurity:\n  - netbootd.Secret redacts through Stringer, GoStringer and Marshaler;\n    plaintext is reachable only via an explicit Reveal(), and the profile\n    password is injected into the outbound body by a single MarshalJSON.\n  - Fine-grained RBAC fails closed; a request carrying no roles is denied\n    every permission. PreviewProfile requires profile.update rather than\n    .view because the rendered seed is the whole installation recipe;\n    DHCP management and artifact deletion are admin-only.\n  - Transport hardening: TLS 1.2 minimum, optional CA bundle replacing the\n    system roots, cross-host redirects refused so the session cookie cannot\n    leak, bounded timeout/retries/backoff, response size cap that rejects\n    rather than truncates, and single-flight re-authentication.\n  - Non-idempotent requests are never replayed. Upstream 5xx and transport\n    detail are logged but not relayed, since they can name internal hosts;\n    422 validation details are forwarded as they are safe and actionable.\n  - Artifact upload is deliberately not proxied: relaying multipart\n    kernel-sized streams would let any operator pin hundreds of megabytes\n    of this module''s memory.\n\nFrontend is a Vue 3 module-federation remote exposing ./module, embedded\ninto the binary via go:embed and served from /modules/netboot/.\n\nPorts: 10000 gRPC, 10001 HTTP, 10010 Prometheus.\n\nTests run against an in-process stub of the netbootd admin API that\nreproduces its response envelope and cookie auth, so the wire contract -\nprotojson snake_case, int64 encoded as strings, EmitUnpopulated nulls - is\nexercised rather than mocked. 84.6% statement coverage across internal/.","tree":{"sha":"45fcc1ee935d657ab4989c68e478516bfdfe063b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/git/trees/45fcc1ee935d657ab4989c68e478516bfdfe063b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/git/commits/7f4f1ee3975c56c44e2246fd5259ac08e6d732a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commit/7f4f1ee3975c56c44e2246fd5259ac08e6d732a5","node_id":"C_kwDOThMFAtoAKDdmNGYxZWUzOTc1YzU2YzQ0ZTIyNDZmZDUyNTlhYzA4ZTZkNzMyYTU","parents":[],"sha":"7f4f1ee3975c56c44e2246fd5259ac08e6d732a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits/7f4f1ee3975c56c44e2246fd5259ac08e6d732a5"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-tangra/go-tangra-netboot/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=c15611de9692c4e41e68ec2dbf9b7b3fbea6611f&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A19%3A13.838Z"}');
