OWU2YTgxMDg5ZTQzOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commit/81472a6409288535c2064640ba5498878fe11d7f","sha":"81472a6409288535c2064640ba5498878fe11d7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/81472a6409288535c2064640ba5498878fe11d7f"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commit/7a69baf2aa530df46f8905d485b096b3aae3019d","sha":"7a69baf2aa530df46f8905d485b096b3aae3019d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/7a69baf2aa530df46f8905d485b096b3aae3019d"}],"sha":"f7eb73fe7a1ec9d0c17cf72f189e6a81089e4392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/f7eb73fe7a1ec9d0c17cf72f189e6a81089e4392"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82049053?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas","id":82049053,"login":"dzajenckauskas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDQ5MDUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/7a69baf2aa530df46f8905d485b096b3aae3019d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T19:36:31Z","email":"d.zajenckauskas@gmail.com","name":"dzajenckauskas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T19:36:31Z","email":"d.zajenckauskas@gmail.com","name":"dzajenckauskas"},"message":"feat: extend batch support (multi-file + ZIP) to Resize, Convert, Rotate\n\nPartially resolves #32. Extends the queue/ZIP pattern proven in\nOptimizer.tsx to the three tools it fits cleanly: Resize, Convert, and\nRotate now accept multiple files, process each with per-file status\n(processing/done/error) and retry/remove, and offer bulk ZIP download\nalongside per-file download.\n\n- New apps/web/src/components/tools/shared/BatchImageToolShell.tsx:\n  generalizes Optimizer''s queue UI/logic behind a `process(image) =>\n  {blob, filename}` callback, so each tool supplies only its own\n  per-image logic and settings UI. Reprocessing on a settings change\n  is driven by `process`''s memoized identity (useCallback).\n- New packages/lib/src/batch.ts: a generic BatchItem/batchCounts model\n  for these three tools, kept separate from Optimizer''s own QueueItem\n  (which additionally tracks byte savings — a shape that doesn''t fit\n  resize/convert/rotate). Reuses queue.ts''s updateItem/removeItem,\n  generalized to `<T extends { id: string }>` (non-breaking; Optimizer\n  is untouched).\n- Resize''s batch mode recomputes each file''s target height from *its\n  own* aspect ratio at the chosen width when aspect is locked, so a\n  mixed-source batch isn''t stretched to one file''s shape — covered by\n  a dedicated e2e test (900×700 + 200×150 at width 100 → 100×78 and\n  100×75, not the same height).\n- ImageToolShell (still used by MetadataCleaner and FaviconGenerator,\n  both out of scope here) is untouched.\n\nScope decisions, per the issue''s own callout:\n- Crop is deferred, not implemented — cropping needs a per-image\n  region, so the literal \"same settings for every file\" pattern\n  doesn''t fit without its own product decision (the issue explicitly\n  flagged this rather than assuming a default).\n- Image editor is deferred — its multi-op undo-history model is a\n  different shape than a single process() callback, and batching it\n  is entangled with the preset work in #52 landing first.\n\nRewrote e2e/image-tools.spec.ts for the new batch UI (old single-image\ntestids like resize-source/resize-download no longer exist) and added\nbatch-specific coverage: mixed-aspect-ratio resize, per-file error\nisolation, and ZIP downloads for all three tools.\n\nVerified: 284/284 unit tests (11 new), typecheck/lint clean, format\nclean, production build succeeds, 114/114 e2e (8 new/rewritten specs).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2a157101ccc1d645ff9d64e317d5200fd84ff6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/f2a157101ccc1d645ff9d64e317d5200fd84ff6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/7a69baf2aa530df46f8905d485b096b3aae3019d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82049053?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas","id":82049053,"login":"dzajenckauskas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDQ5MDUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas","user_view_type":"public"},