zajenckauskas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDQ5MDUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/b5284afb2dd571b547b4710253325e611b307919/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T18:53:35Z","email":"d.zajenckauskas@gmail.com","name":"dzajenckauskas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T18:53:35Z","email":"d.zajenckauskas@gmail.com","name":"dzajenckauskas"},"message":"chore: upgrade to Next.js 16, clear npm audit advisories\n\nResolves the PostCSS/sharp advisories that were previously pulled in\ntransitively via Next 15 — npm audit fix --force now upgrades Next\nrather than downgrading it, contrary to the stale PROJECT-STATE note.\n\n- next 15.1.6 -> 16.3.2 across apps/web and packages/ui\n- next lint was removed in Next 16; migrated to a flat eslint.config.mjs\n  (eslint 9, eslint-config-next 16) and an `eslint .` lint script\n- bumped vitest 2 -> 4 and @vitejs/plugin-react 4 -> 6 (cleared a\n  separate esbuild/vite/vitest critical severity chain surfaced by the\n  audit fix)\n- added NODE_OPTIONS=--no-experimental-webstorage to the jsdom test\n  scripts: Node''s native localStorage global was shadowing jsdom''s\n  under vitest 4\n- eslint-config-next 16 bundles a much stricter eslint-plugin-react-hooks\n  that flags ~20 pre-existing (non-regression) patterns across 13 files;\n  set to warn rather than bundling an unrelated 13-file cleanup here\n- updated PROJECT-STATE.md and README.md accordingly\n\nVerified: npm audit clean, typecheck/lint/format clean, 261/261 unit\ntests, 110/110 e2e, production build succeeds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"820e342b9f653a8d3e82309a74bbaf5b15fc0eab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/820e342b9f653a8d3e82309a74bbaf5b15fc0eab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/b5284afb2dd571b547b4710253325e611b307919","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82049053?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas","id":82049053,"login":"dzajenckauskas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDQ5MDUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commit/b5284afb2dd571b547b4710253325e611b307919","node_id":"C_kwDOThO8otoAKGI1Mjg0YWZiMmRkNTcxYjU0N2I0NzEwMjUzMzI1ZTYxMWIzMDc5MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commit/f827ad7847fd00cea840ca058ee81ec86b75bec9","sha":"f827ad7847fd00cea840ca058ee81ec86b75bec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/f827ad7847fd00cea840ca058ee81ec86b