e meta descriptions that exceeded ~160 chars so they no\n  longer truncate mid-sentence in results.\n- Tools: trim the handful of tool descriptions that ran a few chars over 160.\n- Terms is intentionally left un-optimised — legal/utility pages are not\n  ranking targets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011ZQm51NrpuMR1dh7bvsnce","tree":{"sha":"bf00ae7a9955ac82c7a4249e18c393ae6b02e0ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/bf00ae7a9955ac82c7a4249e18c393ae6b02e0ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/3c9b25b56518053a16dfbfd8c9c12a657a946ffa","verification":{"payload":"tree bf00ae7a9955ac82c7a4249e18c393ae6b02e0ad\nparent 462db5d326cc914796e1316d52406b3c46d9f3b6\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786617618 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786617618 +0000\n\nStrengthen SEO copy for homepage, blog, FAQ and blog posts\n\n- Homepage: keyword-first title (\"Free Online Tools That Run in Your Browser ·\n  Toolkit\") and a category-rich, benefit-led description, decoupled from the\n  neutral SITE_DESCRIPTION (still used by the manifest).\n- Blog index and FAQ: keyword-led titles and fuller descriptions.\n- Blog posts: trim the meta descriptions that exceeded ~160 chars so they no\n  longer truncate mid-sentence in results.\n- Tools: trim the handful of tool descriptions that ran a few chars over 160.\n- Terms is intentionally left un-optimised — legal/utility pages are not\n  ranking targets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011ZQm51NrpuMR1dh7bvsnce\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNB+W0Gn\ndnNsMtuKXrABoTwKD3VyGpvbxiqcNBBsyA4ZO/DhWHVMTzZj9oMqDq2iX3PpoJXE8P2SzvDOfQEn\n2Aw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-13T10:40:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commit/3c9b25b56518053a16dfbfd8c9c12a657a946ffa","node_id":"C_kwDOThO8otoAKDNjOWIyNWI1NjUxODA1M2ExNmRmYmZkOGM5YzEyYTY1N2E5NDZmZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commit/462db5d326cc914796e1316d52406b3c46d9f3b6","sha":"462db5d326cc914796e1316d52406b3c46d9f3b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/462db5d326cc914796e1316d52406b3c46d9f3b6"}],"sha":"3c9b25b56518053a16dfbfd8c9c12a657a946ffa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/3c9b25b56518053a16dfbfd8c9c12a657a946ffa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/462db5d326cc914796e1316d52406b3c46d9f3b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T10:04:18Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T10:04:18Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Give tool pages search-optimized titles and descriptions\n\nThe title tag is the strongest on-page ranking signal, but tool pages reused\nthe short catalog name (e.g. \"Base64 · Toolkit\", \"Colors · Toolkit\"), which\noften missed the actual query and left most of the ~60-char budget unused.\n\nAdd per-tool seoTitle and seoDescription (a SEO_META map in content.ts,\nconsumed by toolMetadata) that target real searches with keyword-rich,\nCTR-focused copy — e.g. \"Base64 Encode & Decode – Free Online Tool · Toolkit\"\nand \"Color Converter – HEX, RGB & HSL, Free · Toolkit\", each with a ~150-char\nbenefit-led meta description. The search text is fully decoupled from the\nvisible page: cards, the H1 and the hero tagline still use the short, clean\nname and tagline, so UX is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011ZQm51NrpuMR1dh7bvsnce","tree":{"sha":"002da024a15483a7f6be55dae6f23a0165be88fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/002da024a15483a7f6be55dae6f23a0165be88fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/462db5d326cc914796e1316d52406b3c46d9f3b6","verification":{"payload":"tree 002da024a15483a7f6be55dae6f23a0165be88fe\nparent 9cefd542d559c129a9fc68fa2d277290d3d8641e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786615458 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786615458 +0000\n\nGive tool pages search-optimized titles and descriptions\n\nThe title tag is the strongest on-page ranking signal, but tool pages reused\nthe short catalog name (e.g. \"Base64 · Toolkit\", \"Colors · Toolkit\"), which\noften missed the actual query and left most of the ~60-char budget unused.\n\nAdd per-tool seoTitle and seoDescription (a SEO_META map in content.ts,\nconsumed by toolMetadata) that target real searches with keyword-rich,\nCTR-focused copy — e.g. \"Base64 Encode & Decode – Free Online Tool · Toolkit\"\nand \"Color Converter – HEX, RGB & HSL, Free · Toolkit\", each with a ~150-char\nbenefit-led meta description. The search text is fully decoupled from the\nvisible page: cards, the H1 and the hero tagline still use the short, clean\nname and tagline, so UX is unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011ZQm51NrpuMR1dh7bvsnce\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHg2R6zH\nFZWTW1UWw2CVqLAp1BjTuofuRHqz6LCy4cHXe9aUbGaEo+JWtH9rWhD0weLyvHLDy9r7YKM/y2al\n9gg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-13T10:04:24Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravat