e":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/9cefd542d559c129a9fc68fa2d277290d3d8641e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-13T09:50:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-13T09:50:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add SEO structured-data e2e coverage; adjust content tests\n\nAdd e2e/seo.spec.ts asserting the JSON-LD emitted by the new structured data:\nSoftwareApplication + BreadcrumbList (+ FAQPage) on a tool page, the FAQPage\non /faq, WebSite + Organization on the homepage, and that a tool without\nauthored FAQs omits the FAQPage block. Also checks the default og:image.\n\nNow that every live tool has authored content, two existing tests that used a\nbare tool (uuid) as the \"no content\" example are updated: the content unit\ntest uses a synthetic unauthored tool to keep testing the empty-fallback\ncontract, and the tools3 e2e test proves conditional rendering via a\npartially-authored tool instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011ZQm51NrpuMR1dh7bvsnce","tree":{"sha":"0c6bae0656ffd29590e7cb8d680b9cf574249f82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/0c6bae0656ffd29590e7cb8d680b9cf574249f82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/9cefd542d559c129a9fc68fa2d277290d3d8641e","verification":{"payload":"tree 0c6bae0656ffd29590e7cb8d680b9cf574249f82\nparent 0078a6b8d681d111ab3a8b573113c42bdcc96ee4\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786614643 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786614643 +0000\n\nAdd SEO structured-data e2e coverage; adjust content tests\n\nAdd e2e/seo.spec.ts asserting the JSON-LD emitted by the new structured data:\nSoftwareApplication + BreadcrumbList (+ FAQPage) on a tool page, the FAQPage\non /faq, WebSite + Organization on the homepage, and that a tool without\nauthored FAQs omits the FAQPage block. Also checks the default og:image.\n\nNow that every live tool has authored content, two existing tests that used a\nbare tool (uuid) as the \"no content\" example are updated: the content unit\ntest uses a synthetic unauthored tool to keep testing the empty-fallback\ncontract, and the tools3 e2e test proves conditional rendering via a\npartially-authored tool instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011ZQm51NrpuMR1dh7bvsnce\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNdFzeER\ntXuSB3/0Pezm1pNqpmv6Y/Rpzne4AmtahV8k1NW6RB0kNNYrDoGmwzEEX1hAKVZNIbHLBCk7R/yY\nzgg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-13T09:51:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commit/9cefd542d559c129a9