st-value pages\n(json, jwt, base64, hash, uuid, password, regex, contrast, calculator,\nmetadata-cleaner, encrypt). Previously only 10 of 50 tools had bespoke content\nand the rest rendered a single tagline line.\n\nThis fills the thin tool pages with genuinely useful copy, sharpens their meta\ndescriptions (the tagline), and feeds the new FAQPage structured data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011ZQm51NrpuMR1dh7bvsnce","tree":{"sha":"2f1f3a652b3c50cbb02fe4511dda1ea1288f2759","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/2f1f3a652b3c50cbb02fe4511dda1ea1288f2759"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/0078a6b8d681d111ab3a8b573113c42bdcc96ee4","verification":{"payload":"tree 2f1f3a652b3c50cbb02fe4511dda1ea1288f2759\nparent c690b4fd602521a268ff7d87e7d1f1558b85119b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786614106 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1786614106 +0000\n\nAuthor landing content for the 40 remaining live tools\n\nEvery live tool now has an authored tagline, a \"How it works\" walkthrough and\n\"Frequent questions\", with \"Why use\" highlights on the highest-value pages\n(json, jwt, base64, hash, uuid, password, regex, contrast, calculator,\nmetadata-cleaner, encrypt). Previously only 10 of 50 tools had bespoke content\nand the rest rendered a single tagline line.\n\nThis fills the thin tool pages with genuinely useful copy, sharpens their meta\ndescriptions (the tagline), and feeds the new FAQPage structured data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011ZQm51NrpuMR1dh7bvsnce\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQO0MfE2/\noXnDFkKxh+m0G6saAGIeBqZ9Ys9ZzIoW/DJ8ztg+UAcZycLUPCe+tdWf