se \"Toolkit\" as the display brand across titles, header, FAQ, Terms and the\nweb manifest (driven by SITE_NAME). Technical identifiers are intentionally left\nlowercase: the @toolkit/* package scope, the toolkit.zajenckauskas.lt domain,\nand the toolkit:* localStorage keys (renaming those would drop users'' saved\ntheme, board and settings state).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0b915aa0df32eeee492e9d09824722c72a2bd137","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/0b915aa0df32eeee492e9d09824722c72a2bd137"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/e75363700d006687eb65fd1d4ba1c0f811d571b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82049053?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas","id":82049053,"login":"dzajenckauskas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDQ5MDUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commit/e75363700d006687eb65fd1d4ba1c0f811d571b9","node_id":"C_kwDOThO8otoAKGU3NTM2MzcwMGQwMDY2ODdlYjY1ZmQxZDRiYTFjMGY4MTFkNTcxYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commit/45ffb9c478e684304d03da53cac1bab9ccf23e2e","sha":"45ffb9c478e684304d03da53cac1bab9ccf23e2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/45ffb9c478e684304d03da53cac1bab9ccf23e2e"}],"sha":"e75363700d006687eb65fd1d4ba1c0f811d571b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/e75363700d006687eb65fd1d4ba1c0f811d571b9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82049053?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas","id":82049053,"login":"dzajenckauskas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDQ5MDUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/45ffb9c478e684304d03da53cac1bab9ccf23e2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T13:42:32Z","email":"d.zajenckauskas@gmail.com","name":"dzajenckauskas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T13:42:32Z","email":"d.zajenckauskas@gmail.com","name":"dzajenckauskas"},"message":"feat(image-editor): unified /image-editor with operation tabs + side panel\n\nA single workspace that consolidates the image operations behind tabs\n(Compress & Convert, Resize, Crop, Rotate & Flip) with the active operation''s\noptions in a right-hand side panel, a live preview, an undo stack, and a\nper-format/quality download — mirroring the reference editor UX.\n\n- Composes the existing pure @toolkit/lib canvas helpers (renderResized /\n  renderCropped / renderTransformed) rather than duplicating logic; adds a small\n  renderCropped helper. Working pixels are kept losslessly as PNG between edits\n  so operations never compound JPEG artefacts; format + quality apply on export.\n- Interactive crop overlay reuses the crop.ts geometry (move/resize/aspect).\n- Registered as a live tool (flips the previously-planned image-editor entry);\n  catalog, search, sitemap and per-page SEO pick it up automatically.\n\nVerified: turbo typecheck/lint/build green; registry + lib tests pass; 84/84 e2e\n(7 new editor specs: load, resize, crop, rotate, download, undo).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1cde23318413c3c828d2ea94d15ef13bb79b029","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/b1cde23318413c3c828d2ea94d15ef13bb79b029"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/45ffb9c478e684304d03da53cac1bab9ccf23e2e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82049053?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas","id":82049053,"login":"dzajenckauskas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDQ5MDUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckaus