ments and reframe the research references across\n  ROADMAP / CHANGELOG / PROJECT-STATE / ADR-008 / image-tools-overview as\n  generic market/UX research (no specific products named).\n- Remove a stray tracked vitest cache file that predated the root .gitignore\n  (node_modules/.vite/...), so nothing under node_modules is tracked anymore.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34ebec65447215c0b9a23c00c5f0f316b81842cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/34ebec65447215c0b9a23c00c5f0f316b81842cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/d2538e16205e48dad79a9c92a95c30023cde9913","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82049053?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas","id":82049053,"login":"dzajenckauskas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDQ5MDUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commit/d2538e16205e48dad79a9c92a95c30023cde9913","node_id":"C_kwDOThO8otoAKGQyNTM4ZTE2MjA1ZTQ4ZGFkNzlhOWM5MmE5NWMzMDAyM2NkZTk5MTM","parents