space package, consumed via\ntranspilePackages. The import surface is unchanged for callers — all 53 call\nsites now import from ''@toolkit/ui'' instead of ''@/components/ui'' / ''@/theme''.\n\n- packages/ui: theme (typed tokens), EmotionRegistry, GlobalStyles, and the\n  Button/Card/Heading/Page/Stack/Text/VisuallyHidden primitives, behind one\n  barrel. Files moved with `git mv` to preserve history.\n- Emotion Theme augmentation lives in both the package (for its own typecheck)\n  and the app (apps/web/src/emotion.d.ts) so neither depends on cross-package\n  ambient .d.ts pickup.\n- Single root Prettier config (.prettierrc.json) so apps and packages share one\n  style; removed the app-local prettier config.\n\nVerified: turbo typecheck/lint/build green for @toolkit/ui and @toolkit/web;\nunit 256 pass (5 known Node-25 localStorage failures); 77/77 e2e.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e620272f24153f606f949fdc1f0e35c547ecb3a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/e620272f24153f606f949fdc1f0e35c547ecb3a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/d43aa3fe50c1ec59a6a584d2e4a5c79090364d0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82049053?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas","id":82049053,"login":"dzajenckauskas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDQ5MDUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commit/d43aa3fe50c1ec59a6a584d2e4a5c79090364d0c","node_id":"C_kwDOThO8otoAKGQ0M2FhM2ZlNTBjMWVjNTlhNmE1ODRkMmU0YTVjNzkwOTAzNjRkMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commit/5e8f2df3a6fe4b96cdb85f11e375e902d3882f3f","sha":"5e8f2df3a6fe4b96cdb85f11e375e902d3882f3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/5e8f2df3a6fe4b96cdb85f11e375e902d3882f3f"}],"sha":"d43aa3fe50c1ec59a6a584d2e4a5c79090364d0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/d43aa3fe50c1ec59a6a584d2e4a5c79090364d0c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82049053?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas","id":82049053,"login":"dzajenckauskas","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDQ5MDUz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/5e8f2df3a6fe4b96cdb85f11e375e902d3882f3f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T11:34:31Z","email":"d.zajenckauskas@gmail.com","name":"dzajenckauskas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T11:34:31Z","email":"d.zajenckauskas@gmail.com","name":"dzajenckauskas"},"message":"build(repo): adopt Turborepo + npm workspaces (ADR-009)\n\nConvert the single-app repo into a Turborepo monorepo without moving app code\nyet (that follows in focused increments):\n\n- Root package.json with npm workspaces (apps/*, packages/*) and Turbo-driven\n  scripts (build/lint/typecheck/test/test:e2e run through `turbo run`).\n- turbo.json task graph with sensible caching/outputs.\n- packages/typescript-config (@toolkit/typescript-config): shared base / Next.js\n  / react-library tsconfigs; apps/web now extends the Next.js preset.\n- Single hoisted lockfile at the root; apps/web/package-lock.json removed.\n- CI installs/builds once from the root via Turbo; cache key is the root\n  lockfile. deploy.sh already primed to detect this layout.\n- Root .gitignore (node_modules, .turbo, build output) and .prettierignore;\n  repo-wide Prettier now also covers workflow YAML (normalized here).\n\nVerified: turbo typecheck/lint/build all green; unit 256 pass (the 5 failures\nare the pre-existing Node-25 localStorage env issue, green on CI''s Node 22).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"140621d6ef5bfb88387a7f3cf6c70b97aac31fc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/140621d6ef5bfb88387a7f3cf6c70b97aac31fc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/5e8f2df3a6fe4b96cdb85f11e375e902d3882f3f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82049053?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/events{/priva