users/dzajenckauskas/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/ee00d788252d468d5ec3080248df7972e83a892e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T17:03:41Z","email":"d.zajenckauskas@gmail.com","name":"dzajenckauskas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T17:03:41Z","email":"d.zajenckauskas@gmail.com","name":"dzajenckauskas"},"message":"fix(nav): portal mobile drawer out of the header; add global search\n\nThe drawer is position:fixed but the header sets backdrop-filter, which\nmakes the header a containing block for fixed descendants — so the drawer\nwas clipped to the ~50px header (only its top strip showed, no overlay or\nlinks). Portal both the drawer and the new search dialog to <body>.\n\nAlso redesign the drawer to list individual tools grouped by category\n(free-tooling.com style) with a theme toggle + \"Send feedback\" footer, and\nadd a header search button + ⌘K that opens a global command palette on any\nroute. The duplicate ⌘K binding moves from the catalog to the header.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"95cc1464d3789fba1b705d949cef748551df9fa0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/95cc1464d3789fba1b705d949cef748551df9fa0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/ee00d788252d468d5ec3080248df7972e83a892e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/82049053?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dzajenckauskas/event