 Theme: manual light/dark toggle persisted in localStorage, applied as\n  data-theme on the root (beats prefers-color-scheme), with a no-flash init\n  script in the layout. New surface-2/overlay/shadow tokens.\n- Home: browse-by-category chip row (filter) + #cat anchors, wider layout.\n- Global CSS styles every native control (select with custom chevron,\n  color/range/checkbox/file inputs, focus rings) consistently in both themes.\n- Rename product to \"toolkit\"; update metadata title.\n\nRewrote nav e2e for the new header (brand link, theme persistence, drawer,\ncategory browse). Suite green: 261 unit + 72 e2e. CHANGELOG + PROJECT-STATE\nupdated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014bMKcKKjj2QaT5nTMGPRuG","tree":{"sha":"89dd10b51a0bd78170d08742f563d180131c7c54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/89dd10b51a0bd78170d08742f563d180131c7c54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/f25816da7dd900c1130644ee6fca4fc18b8b328b","verification":{"payload":"tree 89dd10b51a0bd78170d08742f563d180131c7c54\nparent 29453f9b755b6f0cdc5ba1524595f95948463b14\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784898850 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784898850 +0000\n\nRebrand to \"toolkit\" with logo, theme toggle, and responsive nav\n\nMajor UI/UX pass on the hub shell.\n\n- Logo: recreate the hand-drawn glasses doodle as inline SVG (traced from\n  the source strokes) + \"toolkit\" wordmark; themes via currentColor.\n- Header: sticky, responsive, blurred; logo (→ home), quick links, theme\n  toggle, and a hamburger opening a category drawer (MobileMenu).\n- Theme: manual light/dark toggle persisted in localStorage, applied as\n  data-theme on the root (beats prefers-color-scheme), with a no-flash init\n  script in the layout. New surface-2/overlay/shadow tokens.\n- Home: browse-by-category chip row (filter) + #cat anchors, wider layout.\n- G