ude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/fb9b6bece7f7a2dca3414795ec543bb5227080e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T11:49:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T11:49:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add QR code and Markdown tools (Tier 2)\n\nFirst tools that use a third-party library. Each has a thin lib wrapper,\nunit tests, a component, a route, registry flip + keywords, and e2e.\n\n- QR code generator (/qr): encode text/URL to a QR PNG (qrcode@1.5.4).\n- Markdown editor (/markdown): live preview via markdown-it@14.3.0,\n  configured html:false so user input can''t inject markup (XSS-safe).\n\nA YAML<->JSON converter was intentionally skipped: the only js-yaml version\navailable here resolved to an anomalous 5.2.2 (real latest is 4.x) with a\ncritical advisory, so the package was removed rather than shipped.\n\nCHANGELOG updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014bMKcKKjj2QaT5nTMGPRuG","tree":{"sha":"8ec536ae20e664224a8732b4daea74f8ee183774","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/8ec536ae20e664224a8732b4daea74f8ee183774"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/fb9b6bece7f7a2dca3414795ec543bb5227080e5","verification":{"payload":"tree 8ec536ae20e664224a8732b4daea74f8ee183774\nparent 1c97d28e9aab71c419189878fab182cb