as/toolkit/commits/450e13db753e7a856dfba00e265be94fe2574a9f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T08:54:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T08:54:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add crypto tools: AES encrypt, TOTP/2FA, HMAC (Tier 1 batch 2)\n\nShip three zero-dependency security tools built on Web Crypto, each with a\npure lib, unit tests (RFC/known vectors), a component, a route, registry +\nkeyword entries, and e2e coverage.\n\n- Text encrypt/decrypt (/encrypt): password-based AES-256-GCM, PBKDF2 key,\n  random salt/IV; wrong-password detection.\n- TOTP / 2FA generator (/totp): RFC 6238 codes from a base32 secret with a\n  live countdown; verified against the RFC vectors.\n- HMAC generator (/hmac): keyed HMAC over SHA-1/256/384/512.\n\nAdds a small webcrypto helper to satisfy the ArrayBuffer-backed BufferSource\ntypings. CHANGELOG updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014bMKcKKjj2QaT5nTMGPRuG","tree":{"sha":"1a71ee7163f94b8e5f6a55a3f37de4bee592d11c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/1a71ee7163f94b8e5f6a55a3f37de4bee592d11c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/450e13db753e7a856dfba00e265be94fe2574a9f","verification":{"payload":"tree 1a71ee7163f94b8e5f6a55a3f37de4bee592d11c\nparent d9c44ea0c25cfbc23fcfece712f4b617ccd3da1d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784883247 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784883247 +0000\n\nAdd crypto tools: AES encrypt, TOTP/2FA, HMAC (Tier 1 batch 2)\n\nShip three zero-dependency security tools built on Web Crypto, each with a\npure lib, unit tests (RFC/known vectors), a component, a route, registry +\nkeyword entries, and e2e coverage.\n\n- Text encrypt/decrypt (/encrypt): password-based AES-256-GCM, PBKDF2 key,\n  random salt/IV; wrong-password detection.\n- TOTP / 2FA generator (/totp): RFC 6238 codes from a base32 secret with a\n  live countdown; verified against the RFC vectors.\n- HMAC generator (/hmac): keyed HMAC over SHA-1/256/384/512.\n\nAdds a small webcrypto helper to satisfy the ArrayBuffer-backed BufferSource\ntypings. CHANGELOG updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014bMKcKKjj2QaT5nTMGPRuG\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEny9FYJ\nFz2OzkyBfQNau92eXfZzD01agd1ul6h7dbomIndok0fYNKwoJl131jYT5QHH6M+IetGh/0o+PVs6\nVA4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-24T08:54:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commit/450e13db753e7a856dfba00e265be94fe2574a9f","node_id":"C_kwDOThO8otoAKDQ1MGUxM2RiNzUzZTdhODU2ZGZiYTAwZTI2NWJlOTRmZTI1NzRhOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commit/d9c44ea0c25cf