ry.\n\nUnit tests for keyword search; e2e for keyword matching and keyboard\nnavigation. CHANGELOG updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014bMKcKKjj2QaT5nTMGPRuG","tree":{"sha":"97d71ed05e03ce0816aae52955c74b350ada08a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/97d71ed05e03ce0816aae52955c74b350ada08a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/85b4733044095e79bfc2bfd05161dec001bb7f34","verification":{"payload":"tree 97d71ed05e03ce0816aae52955c74b350ada08a2\nparent e111fd599ba83aad913ff3d736696906ef3c2567\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784880188 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784880188 +0000\n\nTurn catalog search into a keyboard-driven command palette\n\nRework the home-page tool search into a DevToys-style command palette, per\nthe free-tooling reference the user shared.\n\n- registry: add TOOL_KEYWORDS (action-style synonyms) and search over them\n  so \"encode\" finds Base64, \"minify\" finds JSON, \"pomodoro\" finds the timer.\n- ToolCatalog: when searching, render a flat results list with a category\n  icon, name, description and right-aligned category tag; support ArrowUp/\n  Down + Enter to navigate and a global Cmd/Ctrl-K to focus. Empty query\n  still shows the grouped browse cards.\n- CategoryIcon: small dependency-free line icon per category.\n\nUnit tests for keyword search; e2e for keyword matching and keyboard\nnavigation. CHANGELOG updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014bMKcKKjj2QaT5nTMGPRuG\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHNoL/Ma\njGUe6C6gIuXUUmUEYwxfR3k9YhpRJvG2n+sR0wHLJQugzs6TzU+S991U8njiHlpsP2+htRlZX97R\nnAU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE--