d":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/commits/e111fd599ba83aad913ff3d736696906ef3c2567/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-24T07:55:22Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T07:55:22Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add Checksum verifier, Metadata cleaner, and Favicon generator\n\nShip three more client-side tools under the hub model (ADR-008), reusing\nexisting infrastructure (hash lib, image shell/canvas, zip).\n\n- Checksum verifier (/checksum): hash a file (SHA) in-browser and compare\n  it against an expected checksum. Adds hashBytes + checksumsMatch.\n- Metadata cleaner (/metadata-cleaner): strip EXIF/GPS by re-encoding\n  through a canvas; reuses ImageToolShell.\n- Favicon generator (/favicon): render square PNG icons at multiple sizes\n  and package them as a ZIP; reuses ImageToolShell + fflate.\n\nUnit tests for the new hash helpers; e2e for all three tools. CHANGELOG\nupdated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014bMKcKKjj2QaT5nTMGPRuG","tree":{"sha":"5af3ea07efc6d87e5a4c34b6a8ccbdda94d9828a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/5af3ea07efc6d87e5a4c34b6a8ccbdda94d9828a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/e111fd599ba83aad913ff3d736696906ef3c2567","verification":{"payload":"tree 5af3ea07efc6d87e5a4c3