:50:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-24T07:50:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add Resize, Convert, and Rotate/Flip image tools\n\nShip three Canvas-based image tools under the hub model (ADR-008),\nsharing a reusable drop/paste/preview shell and pure geometry helpers.\n\n- src/lib/image.ts: format helpers, aspect-ratio math, rotate/flip\n  geometry (unit-tested) plus browser canvas rendering; broader image\n  validation accepting JPG/PNG/WebP/GIF/BMP.\n- ImageToolShell: shared file loading (picker/drop/paste), preview,\n  reset and download for the image tools.\n- Resize (/resize): exact dimensions with aspect lock and output format.\n- Convert (/convert): JPG/PNG/WebP with a quality control for lossy.\n- Rotate & flip (/rotate): 90° rotation and H/V flips.\n\nUnit tests for the pure helpers; e2e for all three tools. CHANGELOG\nupdated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014bMKcKKjj2QaT5nTMGPRuG","tree":{"sha":"f15dd8412d298e7e39dbe80193e7fa7636a4a6d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/f15dd8412d298e7e39dbe80193e7fa7636a4a6d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/223f09d9eefee6b6b574ec524c8bf5c84d0651e7","verification":{"payload":"tree f15dd8412d298e7e39dbe80193e7fa7636a4a6d1\nparent 1db35ac348448ea1478f15f4f90879d085923151\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784879440 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784879440 +0000\n\nAdd Resize, Convert, and Rotate/Flip image tools\n\nShip three Canvas-based image tools under the hub model (ADR-008),\nsharing a reusable drop/paste/preview shell and pure geometry helpers.\n\n- src/lib/image.ts: format helpers, aspect-ratio math, rotate/flip\n  geometry (unit-tested) plus browser canvas rendering; broader image\n  validation accepting JPG/PNG/WebP/GIF/BMP.\n- ImageToolShell