stry status to live.\n\n- Base64 (/base64): UTF-8-safe encode/decode with invalid-input handling.\n- Password generator (/password): CSPRNG passwords, rejection-sampled to\n  avoid modulo bias, adjustable length and character sets.\n- Lorem Ipsum (/lorem-ipsum): up to 50 paragraphs, classic opening.\n- JSON formatter (/json): format / minify / validate with friendly errors.\n\nCHANGELOG updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014bMKcKKjj2QaT5nTMGPRuG","tree":{"sha":"f6b41f5eea12a80412633761dd062ef669710c76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/trees/f6b41f5eea12a80412633761dd062ef669710c76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dzajenckauskas/toolkit/git/commits/4ddbc8ccd3976003e2725e43ec2d65c12cdbe37e","verification":{"payload":"tree f6b41f5eea12a80412633761dd062ef669710c76\nparent 921632aea5f3a8a0b5fc34a5942d9c1f82377be7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784878423 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1784878423 +0000\n\nAdd Base64, Password, Lorem Ipsum, and JSON tools\n\nShip four more client-side tools under the hub model (ADR-008), each with\na pure lib, unit tests, a component, a route, and e2e coverage; flip their\nregistry status to live.\n\n- Base64 (/base64): UTF-8-safe encode/decode with invalid-input handling.\n- Password generator (/password): CSPRNG passwords, rejection-sampled to\n  avoid modulo bias, adjustable length and character sets.\n- Lorem Ipsum (/lorem-ipsum): up to 50 paragraphs, classic opening.\n- JSON formatter (/json): format / minify / validate with friendly errors.\n\nCHANGELOG updated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014bMKcKKjj2QaT5nTMGPRuG\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5A