d `CropPrediction` schema to model crop-specific predictive analytics, including price trends, confidence intervals, and analyzed data points.\n- Created `AnalyticsState` schema to structure analytics-related state tracking, including historical prices, weather data, event data, predictions, insights, and errors.\n- Enabled `arbitrary_types_allowed` configuration in the `ConfigDict` for schema flexibility.\n\nThese updates establish a foundational structure for managing and validating agent analytics data related to crop predictions and farm insights.","tree":{"sha":"eaa5587cf42f3f716b894951052c20a85dd0a02e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/trees/eaa5587cf42f3f716b894951052c20a85dd0a02e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/commits/b8f211f47c887a5a4e259367337e4d01c431717a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VamshiS123/Sprout/commit/b8f211f47c887