.py` file within the `agents` module.\n- Updated `__all__` to explicitly expose the imported agents for improved accessibility and modular usage.\n- Simplifies agent imports across the project by centralizing their definitions within the module initialization file.","tree":{"sha":"68d5913d04f71219c1ee60dc0e45946a4989a7ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/trees/68d5913d04f71219c1ee60dc0e45946a4989a7ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/commits/dd18fa09dc1979b6c734718ad1df56e2538691fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VamshiS123/Sprout/commit/dd18fa09dc1979b6c734718ad1df56e2538691fc","node_id":"C_kwDOThZHUdoAKGRkMThmYTA5ZGMxOTc5YjZjNzM0NzE4YWQxZGY1NmUyNTM4NjkxZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VamshiS123/Sprout/commit/af73f9031923cd94c99a45ff4eff83c7319a9878","sha":"af73f9031923cd94c99a45ff4eff83c7319a9878","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/commits/af73f9031923cd94c99a45ff4eff83c7319a9878"}],"sha":"dd18fa09dc1979b6c734718ad1df56e2538691fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/commits/dd18fa09dc1979b6c734718ad1df56e2538691fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/commits/af73f9031923cd94c99a45ff4eff83c7319a9878/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T23:59:20Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T23:59:20Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"message":"feat(agents): refactor discovery agent for competitor analysis and SEO support\n\n- Refactored `discovery.py` to focus on competitor analysis, replacing `FarmLead` logic with `CompetitorFarm`.\n- Updated workflow nodes:\n  - `search_usda_node` now identifies local competitors instead of raw leads.\n  - `enrich_leads_node`, `audit_leads_node`, and `save_leads_node` replaced with `enrich_competitors_node`, `audit_competitors_node`, and `market_gap_node` respectively.\n  - Added `generate_seo_node` for localized SEO keyword generation.\n- Extended reporting capabilities with `market_gap_report` and `seo_report`.\n- Simplified state transitions and improved error handling in the discovery workflow.\n- Enhanced logic to exclude specified farm names from competitor results and added geolocation support for market gap analysis.\n\nThese updates improve the agent''s functionality for competitor benchmarking and reporting, providing insights into local competition and SEO opportunities.","tree":{"sha":"bb4dfe9e0ffb8b2693d6ca1ec493cc1717a2fe13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/trees/bb4dfe9e0ffb8b2693d6ca1ec493cc1717a2fe13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/commits/af73f9031923cd94c99a45ff4eff83c7319a9878","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VamshiS123/Sprout/commit/af73f9031923cd94c99a45ff4eff83c7319a9878","node_id":"C_kwDOThZHUdoAKGFmNzNmOTAzMTkyM2NkOTRjOTlhNDVmZjRlZmY4M2M3MzE5YTk4Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VamshiS123/Sprout/commit/28e9ec35f0855901fad7e12e34f8be35ec625143","sha":"28e9ec35f0855901fad7e12e34f8be35ec625143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/commits/28e9ec35f0855901fad7e12e34f8be35ec625143"}],"sha":"af73f9031923cd94c99a45ff4eff83c7319a9878","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/commits/af73f9031923cd94c99a45ff4eff83c7319a9878"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/commits/28e9ec35f0855901fad7e12e34f8be35ec625143/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T23:59:11Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T23:59:11Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"message":"feat(agents): implement SDR agent for restaurant lead generation\n\n- Added a new SDR agent to automate restaurant lead generation and outreach.\n- Implemented stateful functions for workflow nodes including:\n  - `fetch_farm_context_node`: Retrieves farm details and inventory for keyword matching.\n  - `search_restaurants_node`: Leverages Google Places API to find restaurants near a specified location.\n  - `scrape_and_match_node`: Matches restaurants to farm inventory using website scraping and review analysis.\n  - `draft_emails_node`: Drafts outreach emails using LLMs and saves them to the database for human approval.\n- Constructed the SDR graph using `StateGraph` with defined entry and exit points, ensuring seamless node transitions.\n- Improved error handling across nodes to ensure robust workflows.\n- Streamlined email drafting via `ChatOpenAI` with personalized B2B messages and keyword-based recommendations.\n\nThis addition provides a scalable and automated framework for outreach, improving efficiency in connecting farms with local restaurants.","tree":{"sha":"7762d0439fc550488f099ee1dfa12b852dd11194","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/trees/7762d0439fc550488f099ee1dfa12b852dd11194"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/commits/28e9ec35f0855901fad7e12e34f8be35ec625143","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/recei