mits/9022d6d3053e3e2458060d5e2c30c1db3c78c201/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T23:58:59Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T23:58:59Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"message":"feat(schemas): refactor agent discovery schemas for competitor benchmarking\n\n- Renamed `FarmLead` to `CompetitorFarm` and updated its purpose to focus on local competitor benchmarking.\n- Extended `DiscoverySearchCriteria` with new fields: `farm_name` and `farm_offerings`.\n- Replaced `raw_leads`, `enriched_leads`, and `audited_leads` in `DiscoveryState` with `raw_competitors`, `enriched_competitors`, and `audited_competitors`.\n- Added `market_gap_report` and `seo_report` to `DiscoveryState` for enhanced reporting capabilities.\n- Enabled `arbitrary_types_allowed` in the `ConfigDict` for extended schema flexibility.\n\nThese updates improve the structure and functionality of agent discovery workflows by providing a comprehensive framework for competitor analysis and reporting.","tree":{"sha":"e671b6cd029eb576429c10137473526254743257","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/trees/e671b6cd029eb576429c10137473526254743257"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/commits/9022d6d3053e3e2458060d5e2c30c1db3c78c201","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https:/