ers/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/commits/2ab94c03b0079b240a4d4cb9bf144238697ceec0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T23:58:46Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T23:58:46Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"message":"feat(schemas): add SDR schemas for state tracking and search criteria\n\n- Introduced `SDRSearchCriteria` schema to define parameters for geospatial searches, including farm ID, location coordinates, and search radius.\n- Added `RestaurantLead` schema to structure information about restaurant leads, including contact details, keywords, and metadata for reviews and matches.\n- Created `SDRState` schema to track the state of restaurant search and matching processes, including errors, raw leads, and matched results.\n- Enabled `arbitrary_types_allowed` configuration in `SDRState` to facilitate type flexibility.\n\nThese additions provide a foundational structure for SDR workflows, enabling effective state management and data validation.","tree":{"sha":"07df1ad046e4aef82e61aa1fb19608e1111e30c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/trees/07df1ad046e4aef82e61aa1fb19608e1111e30c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/commits/2ab94c03b0079b240a4d4cb9bf144238697ceec0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-