R"},"message":"feat(tools): refactor LinkedIn Finder to use SerpApi for Google Search\n\n- Updated LinkedIn Finder to use SerpApi for Google Search, replacing the previous SERP API provider.\n- Switched from POST to GET requests for SerpApi, aligning with its specifications.\n- Standardized API key environment variable to `SERPAPI_API_KEY` and updated error messages for accuracy.\n- Removed outdated references to SERPER endpoints and replaced dynamic URL construction with `SERPAPI_BASE_URL`.\n- Ensured the tool is fully async and compliant with architecture rules.\n\nThis refactor improves compatibility, simplifies integration, and ensures adherence to the project''s standard for external APIs.","tree":{"sha":"0a676c29d9f56f2675432c54303791f9f5cd6a78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/trees/0a676c29d9f56f2675432c54303791f9f5cd6a78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/commits/0e7bf48565d9e77e1117bb842a871fd5d15aac88","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User",