":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/commits/df6f9699e85b8b26c469814d3ff685557c0f336d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T21:21:48Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T21:21:48Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"message":"feat(api): add endpoint for farm discovery with Discovery Agent\n\n- Introduced a new API endpoint `/discover` to enable farm discovery using the Discovery Agent.\n- Utilized LangGraph to automate the process of finding, enriching, and auditing farm leads.\n- Integrated multi-step functionality, including querying USDA databases, enriching with Google Places, auditing digital presence, and storing high-priority targets.\n- Implemented robust error handling and validation for input parameters (zip code and state).\n- Returns a summary of results, including total leads found, audited, and target leads.\n\nThis addition extends the API capabilities for autonomous lead generation and digital outreach strategies.","tree":{"sha":"bd257445f5a9babea3c723ec4de86cab9d6a0e97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/trees/bd257445f5a9babea3c723ec4de86cab9d6a0e97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/commits/df6f9699e85b8b26c469814d3ff685557c0f336d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","