rikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/commits/a1db2f940c28f44e3c188691eff8e77cbf944ea9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T21:21:36Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T21:21:36Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"message":"feat(agents): add Discovery Agent workflow for automated lead identification\n\n- Implemented the `Discovery Agent` workflow using LangGraph to facilitate automated discovery and enrichment of farm leads.\n- Introduced integrated nodes for querying USDA APIs, enriching lead data with Google Places, and auditing websites'' digital health via AI-backed visual analysis.\n- Added functionality to save processed leads with poor digital health scores (<50) to a PostgreSQL database.\n- Constructed a graph-based structure with modular, async nodes: `search_usda`, `enrich_leads`, `audit_leads`, and `save_leads`.\n- Ensured extensibility by configuring a reusable workflow for lead discovery and targeting.\n\nThis update lays the foundation for automating outreach by identifying and improving digital visibility for underperforming farms.","tree":{"sha":"68a84e3d0717caafa037c602dc84e43cd07650b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/trees/68a84e3d0717caafa037c602dc84e43cd07650b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/commits/a1db2f940c28f44e3c188691eff8e77cbf944ea9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/