subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/commits/93ebff26e98b7475a8c13886a62c1a782727b064/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T20:59:08Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T20:59:08Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"message":"feat(tests): add comprehensive unit tests for new tools and APIs\n\n- Introduced unit tests for all newly implemented tools in `backend/tests/tools/`, including:\n  * Competitor analysis (`test_competitor_analysis.py`)\n  * Domain availability checker (`test_domain_availability.py`)\n  * Decision-maker email finder (`test_email_finder.py`)\n  * Local food events search (`test_events.py`)\n  * Google Places API integrations (`test_google_places_api.py`)\n  * LinkedIn profile search (`test_linkedin_finder.py`)\n  * Market news retrieval (`test_market_news.py`)\n  * Restaurant review analysis (`test_review_analyzer.py`)\n  * Local SEO keywords fetcher (`test_seo_tools.py`)\n  * Social media content scraper (`test_social_media.py`)\n  * USDA API integrations (`test_usda_api.py`)\n  * Weather data and forecasts (`test_weather.py`)\n  * Web scraping utilities (`test_web_scraper.py`)\n- Ensured usage of `pytest` fixtures, `respx` for mocking HTTP interactions, and dependency injection for consistent test isolation.\n- Validated schema-based responses for individual tools with robust assertions for all edge cases.\n- Improved test coverage for async functions and error handling paths.\n\nThis commit ensures all tools are well-tested and adhere to the project''s architectural standards.","tree":{"sha":"909c6a19c5012fdc5760c177eb3f1468c5a0a050","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/trees/909c6a19c5012fdc5760c177eb3f1468c5a0a050"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/commits/93ebff26