null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VamshiS123/Sprout/commit/24f39a2beddd901c7620a929b2ef4ddbad721419","node_id":"C_kwDOThZHUdoAKDI0ZjM5YTJiZWRkZDkwMWM3NjIwYTkyOWIyZWY0ZGRiYWQ3MjE0MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VamshiS123/Sprout/commit/ccb843fc1846674a080a7eb8cb65eb1ecc6e60e5","sha":"ccb843fc1846674a080a7eb8cb65eb1ecc6e60e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/commits/ccb843fc1846674a080a7eb8cb65eb1ecc6e60e5"}],"sha":"24f39a2beddd901c7620a929b2ef4ddbad721419","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/commits/24f39a2beddd901c7620a929b2ef4ddbad721419"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/commits/ccb843fc1846674a080a7eb8cb65eb1ecc6e60e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T18:53:08Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T18:53:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #4 from Harikeshav-R/crud\n\nThis PR implements the foundational database layer and REST API endpoints required for Sprout''s multi-agent workflows (Phases 2-5). It introduces robust SQLModel configurations with strict validations and modular CRUD services, laying the groundwork for the React frontend and LangGraph agents.\n\n## Core Changes\n\n### 1. Database Schema & Validation (`src/models/`)\nAdded new database models to support the core features, complete with data integrity constraints:\n*   **Inventory Tracking (`inventory.py`)**: `FarmInventory` to track a farm''s current stock. Validated `crop_name`/`unit` (min length 1) and `quantity` (non-negative). Added unique constraint on `(farm_id, crop_name)`.\n*   **Predictive Analytics (`pricing.py`)**: `CommodityPricing` to track historical prices. Validated strings (min length 1) and `price` (positive). Added unique constraint on `(crop_name, county, date)`.\n*   **Voice-to-CRM Logs (`transaction.py`)**: `Transaction` to log sales. Validated strings (min length 1) and numbers (`quantity`/`transaction_amount` > 0).\n*   **SDR Matchmaking (`outreach.py`)**: `OutreachEmail` to track restaurant matchmaking and outreach status (`Drafted`, `Sent`, `Opened`, etc.). Validated strings (min length 1) and `match_score` (between 0 and 100).\n*   **Alembic Configuration**: Exported all schemas via `models/__init__.py` and ensured discovery in `alembic/env.py`. Generated migrations covering all constraints and fixed an ENUM drop sequence bug in the downgrade functions.\n\n### 2. Isolated CRUD Services (`src/crud/`)\nRefactored and implemented dedicated CRUD handlers (Create, Read, Update, Delete) to cleanly separate database operations from API routing logic for all models:\n*   `crud/farm.py`\n*   `crud/inventory.py`\n*   `crud/pricing.py`\n*   `crud/transaction.py`\n*   `crud/outreach.py`\n\n### 3. API Endpoints (`src/api/v1/endpoints/`)\nImplemented RESTful FastAPI endpoints wrapping the new CRUD services:\n*   `GET`, `POST`, `PUT`, `DELETE` operations where applicable across the new resources.\n*   Added specific endpoints like `PUT /api/v1/outreach/{id}/status` to support the SDR \"Approve & Send\" workflow.\n*   Added `FarmInventoryUpdate` schema to prevent `farm_id` and `crop_name` mutation on inventory updates.\n*   Added `IntegrityError` handling for unique constraint violations in pricing and inventory.\n*   Added robust `farm_id` validation via foreign-key lookup during POST requests to prevent DB constraint exceptions.\n*   Wired all new routers (`/farms`, `/inventory`, `/pricing`, `/transactions`, `/outreach`) into the main API router.\n\n## Testing & Verification\n*   [x] Schemas successfully mapped to PostgreSQL tables via Alembic migrations.\n*   [x] All data integrity constraints (`ge`, `gt`, `min_length`, `UniqueConstraint`) validated on the Python side and at the database level.\n*   [x] Endpoints tested locally against the database running in Docker.","tree":{"sha":"7336097764dc59f4fdbbf1161d24054a17304f7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/trees/7336097764dc59f4fdbbf1161d24054a17304f7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/git/commits/ccb843fc1846674a080a7eb8cb65eb1ecc6e60e5","verification":{"payload":"tree 7336097764dc59f4fdbbf1161d24054a17304f7e\nparent 7d5e011552bf15398e5d7853646aaf5fd55a885d\nparent dcdfe16ba67751b1a28be4f844d0ed2b5ca1fd0d\nauthor Harikeshav R <r.harikeshav@gmail.com> 1771699988 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771699988 -0500\n\nMerge pull request #4 from Harikeshav-R/crud\n\nThis PR implements the foundational database layer and REST API endpoints required for Sprout''s multi-agent workflows (Phases 2-5). It introduces robust SQLModel configurations with strict validations and modular CRUD services, laying the groundwork for the React frontend and LangGraph agents.\n\n## Core Changes\n\n### 1. Database Schema & Validation (`src/models/`)\nAdded new database models to support the core features, complete with data integrity constraints:\n*   **Inventory Tracking (`inventory.py`)**: `FarmInventory` to track a farm''s current stock. Validated `crop_name`/`unit` (min length 1) and `quantity` (non-negative). Added unique constraint on `(farm_id, crop_name)`.\n*   **Predictive Analytics (`pricing.py`)**: `CommodityPricing` to track historical prices. Validated strings (min length 1) and `price` (positive). Added unique constraint on `(crop_name, county, date)`.\n*   **Voice-to-CRM Logs (`transaction.py`)**: `Transaction` to log sales. Validated strings (min length 1) and numbers (`quantity`/`transaction_amount` > 0).\n*   **SDR Matchmaking (`outreach.py`)**: `OutreachEmail` to track restaurant matchmaking and outreach status (`Drafted`, `Sent`, `Opened`, etc.). Validated strings (min length 1) and `match_score` (between 0 and 100).\n*   **Alembic Configuration**: Exported all schemas via `models/__init__.py` and ensured discovery in `alembic/env.py`. Generated migrations covering all constraints and fixed an ENUM drop sequence bug in the downgrade functions.\n\n### 2. Isolated CRUD Services (`src/crud/`)\nRefactored and implemented dedicated CRUD handlers (Create, Read, Update, Delete) to cleanly separate database operations from API routing logic for all models:\n*   `crud/farm.py`\n*   `crud/inventory.py`\n*   `crud/pricing.py`\n*   `crud/transaction.py`\n*   `crud/outreach.py`\n\n### 3. API Endpoints (`src/api/v1/endpoints/`)\nImplemented RESTful FastAPI endpoints wrapping the new CRUD services:\n*   `GET`, `POST`, `PUT`, `DELETE` operations where applicable across the new resources.\n*   Added specific endpoints like `PUT /api/v1/outreach/{id}/status` to support the SDR \"Approve & Send\" workflow.\n*   Added `FarmInventoryUpdate` schema to prevent `farm_id` and `crop_name` mutation on inventory updates.\n*   Added `IntegrityError` handling for unique constraint violations in pricing and inventory.\n*   Added robust `farm_id` validation via foreign-key lookup during POST requests to prevent DB constraint exceptions.\n*   Wired all new routers (`/farms`, `/inventory`, `/pricing`, `/transactions`, `/outreach`) into the main API router.\n\n## Testing & Verification\n*   [x] Schemas successfully mapped to PostgreSQL tables via Alembic migrations.\n*   [x] All data integrity constraints (`ge`, `gt`, `min_length`, `UniqueConstraint`) validated on the Python side and at the database level.\n*   [x] Endpoints tested locally against the database running in Docker.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpmf8UCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAS1cQAFI4QorXNBpL3uIg1lk9icqR\nhWAvt4Ck18R7mrGJcidKwsJeGPT4bQOnYUmMwG6nVfkJ8ZXCZCFdyuMJKE8jyqgC\nwSb7OxbsepUAVaHaGsKfdUtEE9rkBymVGajfdZXBTiqPJUQLhDjRv0+mw2CowxS2\n0ugNgkNULCBneJ/Ep4lmduja+RgGH+4dvcz6NEYU+LKsY0IA+mO5uBKKYY5Ao3ht\n89zVXfXhYhVUFKEmiapCIgs9105O9nxHHltKswlEAPWWxUfCTZfO8mTBTMN/jrt3\nzuNFo25YriaJd/47inuLyoYpSxT5UEm2uzhMz5b/hJlNEhGWu/AKLYuTBS52QGnk\naQ3P0jBhbdnYIC8zx5HdoKELzcBAvPyj5cmc5EEKlJxW9nEL0ixm81Oy8d7NOrx2\ni69lrOklAF/k2KoZeQzQIGbPFKKxAqg0ty7p8YzxykY6lRUHOaijHZNmqD/KwcTp\n3gmiZ4yTKZ6O8HHyejNYAYqKglv+VTes/Kk20UhRaHuZ30eLDMRO2FJ0UshGc92J\n7VFB7Ok7fdnwVqsTTqPr7ZqyaiouOky42K9eMEjcDV/kHBQJihDzZ/M9CE58dQih\nh8Ar5biOyWGVYqQfD2BOHTmgp89SmkjvcJrJU+w14aVNpbN3qbJzxW5lqKdwzqbX\n3L6FpNjWHXTSoL7EbnQz\n=5Rta\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-23T15:20:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/VamshiS123/Sprout/commit/ccb843fc1846674a080a7eb8cb65eb1ecc6e60e5","node_id":"C_kwDOThZHUdoAKGNjYjg0M2ZjMTg0NjY3NGEwODBhN2ViOGNiNjVlYjFlY2M2ZTYwZTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/VamshiS123/Sprout/commit/7d5e011552bf15398e5d7853646aaf5fd55a885d","sha":"7d5e011552bf15398e5d7853646aaf5fd55a885d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/VamshiS123/Sprout/commits/7d5e011552bf15398e5d7853646aaf5fd55a885d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/VamshiS123/Sprout/commit/dcdfe16ba67751b1a28be4f844d0ed2b5ca1fd0d","sha":"dcdfe16ba67751b1a28be4f844d0ed2b5ca1fd0d","url":"https:/