e":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djievalencias","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/ce65790788b873d846dd867163a33fd916173fce/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T08:42:27Z","email":"djievalenciasantoso@gmail.com","name":"Djie Valencia Santoso"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T08:42:27Z","email":"djievalenciasantoso@gmail.com","name":"Djie Valencia Santoso"},"message":"feat(gitea-runner): SG + IAM + t3.large EC2 + registration-secret container\n\nTerraform half of the Gitea Actions runner: egress-only SG (runners poll,\nnothing connects in), instance-iam with SSM core only (registration token is\nfetched controller-side), t3.large box in staging-private tagged\nService=gitea-runner (swept by shared-deploy), and the bootstrap-layer\ngroup5-procal-gitea-sm secret container (act_runner_reg_token +\nbitbucket_mirror_token, operator-managed value).\n\nNo SG test added: egress-only, mirrors the untested bitbucket_runner SG.\nNetwork module tests 7/7, shared+bootstrap validate clean.","tree":{"sha":"9339242425a0f17c757e30c97060fec5f9d3b88c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/trees/9339242425a0f17c757e30c97060fec5f9d3b88c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/commits/ce65790788b873d846dd867163a33fd916173fce","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/88537796?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djievalencias/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djievalencias/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djievalencias/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djievalencias/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias","id":88537796,"login":"djievalencias","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg4NTM3Nzk2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djievalencias/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djievalencias/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djievalencias/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djievalencias/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/djievalencias/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/djievalencias","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/ce65790788b873d846dd867163a33fd916173fce","node_id":"C_kwDOTh2l1toAKGNlNjU3OTA3ODhiODczZDg0NmRkODY3MTYzYTMzZmQ5MTYxNzNmY2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/85e85d7dca3e99be40abe33ea0c27bbcf9db4bba","sha":"85e85d7dca3e99be40abe33ea0c27bbcf9db4bba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/85e85d7dca3e99be40abe33ea0c27bbcf9db4bba"}],"sha":"ce65790788b873d846dd867163a33fd916173fce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/ce65790788b873d846dd867163a33fd916173fce"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/85e85d7dca3e99be40abe33ea0c27bbcf9db4bba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T09:51:34Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T09:51:34Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"message":"fix(service-asg): pin ASG launch_template to latest_version\n\nThe ASG referenced its launch template with version = \"$Latest\", a static\nstring. When a re-bake+apply minted a new LT version, the ASG resource''s own\nattributes never changed, so Terraform saw no diff and the instance_refresh\nblock never fired — a re-bake silently rolled nothing (only the AMI the next\nchurned instance happened to boot). Pin to aws_launch_template.this.latest_version\nso a new LT version changes the ASG attribute, Terraform diffs the ASG, and the\nRolling instance_refresh replaces the fleet during apply. App-only deploys don''t\ntouch the LT, so they still never roll. Retargeted the module test''s version\nassertion at the instance_refresh strategy (latest_version is computed/unknown\nunder command = plan). Verified: plan-prod shows both ASGs $Latest -> numeric.","tree":{"sha":"7c724f8226ef0c05d61ddb14c20a98d1ca4f6a8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/trees/7c724f8226ef0c05d61ddb14c20a98d1ca4f6a8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/commits/85e85d7dca3e99be40abe33ea0c27bbcf9db4bba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/85e85d7dca3e99be40abe33ea0c27bbcf9db4bba","node_id":"C_kwDOTh2l1toAKDg1ZTg1ZDdkY2EzZTk5YmU0MGFiZTMzZWEwYzI3YmJjZjlkYjRiYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/f7cdb0ecccd4d123cdd23a4957274f1713beced5","sha":"f7cdb0ecccd4d123cdd23a4957274f1713beced5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/f7cdb0ecccd4d123cdd23a4957274f1713beced5"}],"sha":"85e85d7dca3e99be40abe33ea0c27bbcf9db4bba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/85e85d7dca3e99be40abe33ea0c27bbcf9db4bba"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/f7cdb0ecccd4d123cdd23a4957274f1713beced5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T09:36:05Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T09:36:38Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"message":"fix(alloy): River raw-string for journal-unit regex\n\nregex_escape renders each unit as e.g. maps\\.service; inside a River\ndouble-quoted string \\. is an invalid escape sequence, so alloy fails\nto load the config (\"unknown escape sequence\") and crash-loops. Use a\nbacktick raw-string so the backslashes pass through to the regex engine.\nVerified with alloy fmt on the full 11-unit rendered line.","tree":{"sha":"0c4c063605cd6a10c7f8e967a0eaa41bc580f4fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/trees/0c4c063605cd6a10c7f8e967a0eaa41bc580f4fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/commits/f7cdb0ecccd4d123cdd23a4957274f1713beced5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/f7cdb0ecccd4d123cdd23a4957274f1713beced5","node_id":"C_kwDOTh2l1toAKGY3Y2RiMGVjY2NkNGQxMjNjZGQyM2E0OTU3Mjc0ZjE3MTNiZWNlZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/96f2fa87968d44f3996a0b76b8338e608a81c673","sha":"96f2fa87968d44f3996a0b76b8338e608a81c673","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/96f2fa87968d44f3996a0b76b8338e608a81c673"}],"sha":"f7cdb0ecccd4d123cdd23a4957274f1713beced5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/f7cdb0ecccd4d123cdd23a4957274f1713beced5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/96f2fa87968d44f3996a0b76b8338e608a81c673/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T07:57:14Z","email":"spangestu26@dev1.idserve.net","name":"Sherly Phangestu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T07:57:14Z","email":"spangestu26@dev1.idserve.net","name":"Sherly Phangestu"},"message":"Merged in fix/grafana (pull request #25)\n\nfix(ansible): Fix error in Loki/Mimir/Tempo","tree":{"sha":"7aaeec023028b8b0dc26a0bad55a10bdd35e47a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/trees/7aaeec023028b8b0dc26a0bad55a10bdd35e47a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/commits/96f2fa87968d44f3996a0b76b8338e608a81c673","verification":{"pay