djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/51d43c0b7274a3b18eb26fb29fd2906be44b834e","sha":"51d43c0b7274a3b18eb26fb29fd2906be44b834e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/51d43c0b7274a3b18eb26fb29fd2906be44b834e"}],"sha":"c67bcd5e21d13e7f519f115a015b6a641852ced6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/c67bcd5e21d13e7f519f115a015b6a641852ced6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/51d43c0b7274a3b18eb26fb29fd2906be44b834e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T05:02:49Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T05:02:49Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"message":"pipeline(ci): move all procal-infra steps to the self-hosted Docker runner\n\nPhase 3 batch: pins runs-on:[self.hosted,linux,procalvpc] on every step except\nmolecule — the whole pull-requests + branches.main + custom lanes (terraform\nfmt/validate/test/plan/apply, tflint, trivy, infracost, integration-tests, the\nansible deploy lanes, packer bake, prod-deploy) now run on our in-VPC runner\ninstead of burning Bitbucket cloud minutes. Canary (infra-oidc-smoke) already\nproved the path: a real step executed on runner 0f5ce688 (stepComplete in its\nlogs), OIDC + S3 state + containerized image all work.\n\nmolecule STAYS on cloud (runtime:cloud v3 + privileged DinD don''t port to\nself-hosted) — the one remaining cloud consumer. Reworded the two stale\n''runs on the cloud runner'' comments (staging-deploy, prod-deploy) and added a\nheader note. Trade-off documented: the single runner box is now a CI SPOF.","tree":{"sha":"d8ccd79ca8c157be07fdcdbda6575ab68fbe4226","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/trees/d8ccd79ca8c157be07fdcdbda6575ab68fbe4226"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/commits/51d43c0b7274a3b18eb26fb29fd2906be44b834e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/51d43c0b7274a3b18eb26fb29fd2906be44b834e","node_id":"C_kwDOTh2l1toAKDUxZDQzYzBiNzI3NGEzYjE4ZWIyNmZiMjlmZDI5MDZiZTQ0YjgzNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/f356b304aa55028c0aa7b9abd7514e9a83a742d0","sha":"f356b304aa55028c0aa7b9abd7514e9a83a742d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/f356b304aa55028c0aa7b9abd7514e9a83a742d0"}],"sha":"51d43c0b7274a3b18eb26fb29fd2906be44b834e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/51d43c0b7274a3b18eb26fb29fd2906be44b834e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/f356b304aa55028c0aa7b9abd7514e9a83a742d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T04:41:12Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T04:41:12Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"message":"pipeline(ci): canary — pin infra-oidc-smoke to the self-hosted Docker runner\n\nFirst step of the cloud->self-hosted migration. infra-oidc-smoke is a\nmanually-runnable custom lane, so it validates the Docker runner end-to-end\n(containerized step on the top-level terraform image + OIDC assume + S3-state\nreachability, all in-VPC) without needing a PR. Once this is green ON the\nrunner, the rest of procal-infra''s non-molecule steps follow. Docker labels:\nself.hosted linux procalvpc; molecule stays on cloud.","tree":{"sha":"d5db86d646e0b1408bbeeaab7b3440b34bf9897d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/trees/d5db86d646e0b1408bbeeaab7b3440b34bf9897d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/commits/f356b304aa55028c0aa7b9abd7514e9a83a742d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/f356b304aa55028c0aa7b9abd7514e9a83a742d0","node_id":"C_kwDOTh2l1toAKGYzNTZiMzA0YWE1NTAyOGMwYWE3YjlhYmQ3NTE0ZTlhODNhNzQyZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/1f873f025460f324cd1952b12817bdf9d3140797","sha":"1f873f025460f324cd1952b12817bdf9d3140797","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/1f873f025460f324cd1952b12817bdf9d3140797"}],"sha":"f356b304aa55028c0aa7b9abd7514e9a83a742d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/f356b304aa55028c0aa7b9abd7514e9a83a742d0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/1f873f025460f324cd1952b12817bdf9d3140797/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T04:12:31Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T04:12:31Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"message":"feat(runner): t3.large + docker-runner launch (unit + self-revive wrapper)\n\nPhase 1b of the cloud->self-hosted migration. Resize the box to t3.large (8GB):\nit now carries the shell runners (Sonar) AND per-repo idle docker-runner\ncontainers + containerized steps; 4GB couldn''t hold that beside a JS/TS scan.\n\nDocker-runner launch, templated against the real UI registration command shape:\na bitbucket-docker-runner@ systemd template unit (runs as root — docker socket\nowner; Requires docker.service) whose wrapper renders the  from\nthe bootstrap secret key ''<repo>-docker'' and runs it FOREGROUND for systemd:\nstrips -it (no TTY), adds --rm, and docker-rm -f''s the stale --name container\nfirst so Restart=always can''t wedge on a name collision. Same self-revive-from-\nSecrets-Manager pattern as the shell runners; no secret ever enters git.","tree":{"sha":"2aa9524d510b86abe141118deac4228552733c61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/trees/2aa9524d510b86abe141118deac4228552733c61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/commits/1f873f025460f324cd1952b12817bdf9d3140797","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/1f873f025460f324cd1952b12817bdf9d3140797","node_id":"C_kwDOTh2l1toAKDFmODczZjAyNTQ2MGYzMjRjZDE5NTJiMTI4MTdiZGY5ZDMxNDA3OTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/11037a746a718ca5346aeb8e093b8437cdc9f092","sha":"11037a746a718ca5346aeb8e093b8437cdc9f092","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/11037a746a718ca5346aeb8e093b8437cdc9f092"}],"sha":"1f873f025460f324cd1952b12817bdf9d3140797","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/1f873f025460f324cd1952b12817bdf9d3140797"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/11037a746a718ca5346aeb8e093b8437cdc9f092/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T03:58:51Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T03:58:51Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"message":"feat(runner): install Docker Engine + scaffold linux.docker runner config\n\nPhase 1 of moving CI off Bitbucket cloud minutes onto the in-VPC box. Docker\nrunners (unlike the shell runners) honor image:, so terraform/build/deploy\nsteps port over with just a runs-on line. This commit is the safe, additive\nfoundation: install Docker Engine (does NOT touch the shell runners or the\nSonar path) + defaults for the docker-runner repos (procal-infra/dora/maps/\nboots) and their bootstrap-secret <repo>-docker keys. The docker-runner launch\nunit + wrapper are intentionally deferred to a follow-up templated against a\nreal UI registration (the docker run flag/--name/--rm/-it normalization is not\nworth guessing). Shell runners stay for Sonar until Phase 4; molecule stays on\ncloud.","tree":{"sha":"acfe6193feb392fd59ba580ffca6628518ee27c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/trees/acfe6193feb392fd59ba580ffca6628518ee27c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/commits/11037a746a718ca5346aeb8e093b8437cdc9f092","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/11037a746a718ca5346aeb8e093b8437cdc9f092","node_id":"C_kwDOTh2l1toAKDExMDM3YTc0NmE3MThjYTUzNDZhZWI4ZTA5M2I4NDM3Y2RjOWYwOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/39951f62c2baea2fb7bd86f43612c1e50ad5e805","sha":"39951f62c2baea2fb7bd86f43612c1e50ad5e805","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/39951f62c2baea2fb7bd86f43612c1e50ad5e805"}],"sha":"11037a746a718ca5346aeb8e093b8437cdc9f092","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/11037a746a718ca5346aeb8e093b8437cdc9f092"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/39951f62c2baea2fb7bd86f43612c1e50ad5e805/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-08T02:59:13Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-08T02:59:13Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"message":"pipeline: deploy-playbook lane — run ONE ansible playbook, not the whole sweep\n\nshared-deploy runs sonarqube + bitbucket-runner + openvpn + site playbooks in\none shot; when only one fails (or you only changed one) re-running the whole\nsweep is wasteful. This lane takes PLAYBOOK (allowed-values: the standalone\nplaybooks; bake.yml excluded — it''s packer-only) + an optional LIMIT and runs\njust that one over SSM, same OIDC/regional-STS/roles-path boilerplate as\nshared-deploy. site.yml is refused without a LIMIT since its first play is\nhosts: all.","tree":{"sha":"584088d95a0490a03908c8c7d0f83a4606c8e06d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/trees/584088d95a0490a03908c8c7d0f83a4606c8e06d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/commits/39951f62c2baea2fb7bd86f43612c1e50ad5e805","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/39951f62c2baea2fb7bd86f43612c1e50ad5e805","node_id":"C_kwDOTh2l1toAKDM5OTUxZjYyYzJiYWVhMmZiN2JkODZmNDM2MTJjMWU1MGFkNWU4MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/15f0669e015c8a4bda7093f19c67932675ec6202","sha":"15f0669e015c8a4bda7093f19c67932675ec6202","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/15f0669e015c8a4bda7093f19c67932675ec6202"}],"sha":"39951f62c2baea2fb7bd86f43612c1e50ad5e805","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/39951f62c2baea2fb7bd86f43612c1e50ad5e805"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/15f0669e015c8a4bda7093f19c67932675ec6202/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T08:42:48Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T08:42:48Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"message":"fix(runner): t3.medium (4GB) — t3.small OOM-thrashed on SonarQube JS/TS scans\n\nOne box hosts all three repo runners (boots/dora/maps); a single maps sonar\nscan (the JS/TS analyzer forks an embedded Node sized to available RAM) stacked\non the Next.js build blew past 2GB with no swap — load avg hit ~65 and the\nscanner crawled for 30+ min at OOM risk. 4GB clears a single scan; noted to\nrevisit t3.large if concurrent multi-repo scans thrash.","tree":{"sha":"3ad2243af5debe19f75a9da1b145bff4bee34d67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/trees/3ad2243af5debe19f75a9da1b145bff4bee34d67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/commits/15f0669e015c8a4bda7093f19c67932675ec6202","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/15f0669e015c8a4bda7093f19c67932675ec6202","node_id":"C_kwDOTh2l1toAKDE1ZjA2NjllMDE1YzhhNGJkYTcwOTNmMTljNjc5MzI2NzVlYzYyMDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/e0dc318c380e9a6c0fb2f3614a3c6d9c2bbdf152","sha":"e0dc318c380e9a6c0fb2f3614a3c6d9c2bbdf152","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/e0dc318c380e9a6c0fb2f3614a3c6d9c2bbdf152"}],"sha":"15f0669e015c8a4bda7093f19c67932675ec6202","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/15f0669e015c8a4bda7093f19c67932675ec6202"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/e0dc318c380e9a6c0fb2f3614a3c6d9c2bbdf152/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T07:55:35Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T07:55:39Z","email":"dedrickirl2","name":"Dedrick"},"message":"fix(sonarqube): bind 0.0.0.0 + open :9000 to the runner — scanner can''t do the self-signed 443\n\nmaps-learner-5''s sonar step died: sonar-scanner (Java) timed out on\nhttp://...:9000. Two stacked gaps: (1) the sonarqube SG only admitted the\nrunner on 443, not 9000; (2) even with 9000 open, SonarQube binds\n127.0.0.1:9000 (behind nginx) so the runner hitting the box''s private IP found\nnothing listening. The 443 nginx vhost is self-signed and the Java scanner\nwon''t accept it (curl -k does, the scanner doesn''t), so the runner needs a\ndirect plain-HTTP path. Fixes: add runner_to_sonarqube_direct (9000 from the\nrunner SG only — still private); bind sonar.web.host=0.0.0.0 (nginx still\nfronts 443 for VPN humans); and wire a gated Restart-sonarqube handler +\nnotify on the properties render (there was NONE — a config change never\nbounced the service). Labels were a red herring: all three app repos already\nuse [self.hosted, linux, procalvpc] identically.","tree":{"sha":"72d818623441206cf4f2a31cf1f21eff2754d775","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/trees/72d818623441206cf4f2a31cf1f21eff2754d775"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/commits/e0dc318c380e9a6c0fb2f3614a3c6d9c2bbdf152","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/e0dc318c380e9a6c0fb2f3614a3c6d9c2bbdf152","node_id":"C_kwDOTh2l1toAKGUwZGMzMThjMzgwZTlhNmMwZmIyZjM2MTRhM2M2ZDljMmJiZGYxNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/djievalencias/procal-infra/commit/1ccdede18bd002ba6991fa98b4821a5ae31a695a","sha":"1ccdede18bd002ba6991fa98b4821a5ae31a695a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/1ccdede18bd002ba6991fa98b4821a5ae31a695a"}],"sha":"e0dc318c380e9a6c0fb2f3614a3c6d9c2bbdf152","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/e0dc318c380e9a6c0fb2f3614a3c6d9c2bbdf152"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/commits/1ccdede18bd002ba6991fa98b4821a5ae31a695a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T06:55:31Z","email":"spangestu26@dev1.idserve.net","name":"Sherly Phangestu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T06:55:31Z","email":"spangestu26@dev1.idserve.net","name":"Sherly Phangestu"},"message":"Merged in feat/sherly/atlantis (pull request #22)\n\nfeat(terraform, ansible, ci): Hand atlantis provisioning to ansible","tree":{"sha":"a495c2f673b1e3d371a6d1e252ec727a1f7db3f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/trees/a495c2f673b1e3d371a6d1e252ec727a1f7db3f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/djievalencias/procal-infra/git/commi