/users/Khuslen122/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khuslen122/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khuslen122/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Khuslen122","id":180429884,"login":"Khuslen122","node_id":"U_kgDOCsEkPA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khuslen122/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khuslen122/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khuslen122/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khuslen122/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khuslen122/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Khuslen122","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice-v3-clean/commits/41a55c8d862f7d5af83682fbd81e0dfb29f04e6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T14:43:44Z","email":"huslens1027@gmail.com","name":"Khuslen122"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T14:43:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: enhance relation activity logging and notifications\n\n* feat: add properties section to customer add form (#8110)\n\n* feat: enhance relation activity logging and notifications\n\n- Introduced RelationEntity and RelationEntityPair types for better structure.\n- Refactored generateRelationActivityLogs to handle added and removed relations more efficiently.\n- Implemented notifyOwner and notifyRelationOwners functions to notify relevant plugins about relation changes.\n- Added sourcePlugin field to ActivityLogInput and TActivityLog for better tracking of activity sources.\n- Updated frontline_api plugin to subscribe to relation events and handle form submissions related to conversations.\n- Removed deprecated ticketLogConversationForm mutation and related logic from deals and tickets modules.\n- Added new FormSubmissionActivityRow component to display form submission activities in the UI.\n- Enhanced ActivityLogs component to include relation activities and improved rendering logic for activity rows.\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in 1e1bdaf according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/8449\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Bat-Erdene <batka.officials@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Wlkr7575 <tuguldurch737@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: deepsource-autofix[bot] <62050782+deepsource-autofix[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"25e07f6f1f7173b6b857598aa3be860e47271445","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice-v3-clean/git/trees/25e07f6f1f7173b6b857598aa3be860e47271445"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice-v3-clean/git/commits/41a55c8d862f7d5af83682fbd81e0dfb29f04e6d","verification":{"payload":"tree 25e07f6f1f7173b6b857598aa3be860e47271445\nparent d6517df300c52e16c96032f16cdc6cbb63f31212\nauthor Khuslen122 <huslens1027@gmail.com> 1783003424 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783003424 +0800\n\nfeat: enhance relation activity logging and notifications\n\n* feat: add properties section to customer add form (#8110)\n\n* feat: enhance relation activity logging and notifications\n\n- Introduced RelationEntity and RelationEntityPair types for better structure.\n- Refactored generateRelationActivityLogs to handle added and removed relations more efficiently.\n- Implemented notifyOwner and notifyRelationOwners functions to notify relevant plugins about relation changes.\n- Added sourcePlugin field to ActivityLogInput and TActivityLog for better tracking of activity sources.\n- Updated frontline_api plugin to subscribe to relation events and handle form submissions related to conversations.\n- Removed deprecated ticketLogConversationForm mutation and related logic from deals and tickets modules.\n- Added new FormSubmissionActivityRow component to display form submission activities in the UI.\n- Enhanced ActivityLogs component to include relation activities and improved rendering logic for activity rows.\n\n* style: format code with Prettier\n\nThis commit fixes the style issues introduced in 1e1bdaf according to the output\nfrom Prettier.\n\nDetails: https://github.com/erxes/erxes/pull/8449\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Bat-Erdene <batka.officials@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Wlkr7575 <tuguldurch737@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: deepsource-autofix[bot] <62050782+deepsource-autofix[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqRnkgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA57YQAKL2sGW1PT092m7P+wJWr5Ne\nxWn/e6JWPwn74SxiEXaLJXWsrDJnul135NMPvxqhph9uP39mM8vkVLroIADt4p7y\nXt19pD1Nr925bZqTO3O39Ayhc9DDCUzzwDxn89Ji1xy2JIT7eRs5unjqs81qwj8k\n6tcbJ7VnjaLL2Szy5PZNd7/AQWpnDNasRL3VFqEHaWegyTZVtLbc9uRDIfaWE+ti\nxZUwAlBb3XENNDnoAnRx9xFa9oIUHACHZFmLyAwVu+CdUXAzMj6am7rAZj46FV4h\nXvoWmiOgutjamn+j2gSzXG1U1Ywz+luj2HsutZXL0g9EqBWQLrsvWev8YRrz79DG\nj+BrS9WnrDFAMvmbBl7NjeNW2zoIYBt3kenY6d8K7jHWgZyqzYA0dRJMN+P5pVOo\nmeHwShrm6emIt9rWf3YBVz8589KlOi/va2FMGItRJGqwb8SPrX89nh5YjOMP+Z5B\nkIleghcrKdybDYrKr0fvzqXZKNQ6V9inGMEfsfX76HZ9EyqkuEFMAe0QcvNtMOVy\nVC1xhgiwRdJfomr2F2yisOIKDvMYP2aczTPXJ4VfBTwuvvedM30VSUaBl3/zp/QP\nNM4uSn1f7/Nc+ULiai5/argbzvnM15bz6qkCqkdN7Mzh5KVrWDYlmXeZKFCDzspd\n7XikiBCf5JvcBLBy7gDn\n=NZW1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-24T06:23:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrservice-v3-clean/commit/41a55c8d862f7d5af83682fbd81e0dfb29f04e6d","node_id":"C_kwDOTh_A4NoAKDQxYTU1YzhkODYyZjdkNWFmODM2ODJmYmQ4MWUwZGZiMjlmMDRlNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/okrbest/okrservice-v3-clean/commit/d6517df300c52e16c96032f16cdc6cbb63f31212","sha":"d6517df300c52e16c96032f16cdc6cbb63f31212","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice-v3-clean/commits/d6517df300c52e16c96032f16cdc6cbb63f31212"}],"sha":"41a55c8d862f7d5af83682fbd81e0dfb29f04e6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice-v3-clean/commits/41a55c8d862f7d5af83682fbd81e0dfb29f04e6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65982680?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Amartuvshins0404","id":65982680,"login":"Amartuvshins0404","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1OTgyNjgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amartuvshins0404","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice-v3-clean/commits/d6517df300c52e16c96032f16cdc6cbb63f31212/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-02T13:08:21Z","email":"65982680+Amartuvshins0404@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Amartuvshin Surenjav"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-02T13:08:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(automations): resolve dashed plugin names to underscore MF containers (#8523)\n\n* fix(automations): resolve dashed plugin names to underscore MF containers\n\nPlugin automation actions/triggers from a plugin whose name contains a dash\n(e.g. `erxes-agent`) render as \"Plugin <name> disabled\" in the builder, even\nwhen the plugin is installed and enabled.\n\nModule-federation container names can''t contain dashes, so core-api''s\nget-frontend-plugins registers such a plugin — and pluginsConfigState stores its\nCONFIG.name — in underscore form (`erxes_agent`), and the runtime remote is\n`erxes_agent_ui`. But the automation node type keeps the real dashed service\nname (the RPC routing prefix, which can''t change). The builder then used the raw\ndashed name for both the CONFIG.name match and `loadRemote(''${name}_ui'')`, so\nneither resolved.\n\nNormalize `-` -> `_` in the two automation call sites, mirroring core-api''s\n`remoteName()`. Idempotent for dashless names, so all existing plugins are\nunaffected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(automations): use replaceAll for dash normalization\n\nSonarCloud S7781 — prefer String#replaceAll() over a global-regex\nString#replace(). Behaviourally identical; lib es2021 supports it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e64f669d2658235d26f3d3cd0ea6f49e9e4f50c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice-v3-clean/git/trees/6e64f669d2658235d26f3d3cd0ea6f49e9e4f50c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/okrbest/okrservice-v3-clean/git/commits/d6517df300c52e16c96032f16cdc6cbb63f31212","verification":{"payload":"tree 6e64f669d2658235d26f3d3cd0ea6f49e9e4f50c\nparent 2a63f24436cfa9a71d24650e358edc82344b50cc\nauthor Amartuvshin Surenjav <65982680+Amartuvshins0404@users.noreply.github.com> 1782997701 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782997701 +0800\n\nfix(automations): resolve dashed plugin names to underscore MF containers (#8523)\n\n* fix(automations): resolve dashed plugin names to underscore MF containers\n\nPlugin automation actions/triggers from a plugin whose name contains a dash\n(e.g. `erxes-agent`) render as \"Plugin <name> disabled\" in the builder, even\nwhen the plugin is installed and enabled.\n\nModule-federation container names can''t contain dashes, so core-api''s\nget-frontend-plugins registers such a plugin — and pluginsConfigState stores its\nCONFIG.name — in underscore form (`erxes_agent`), and the runtime remote is\n`erxes_agent_ui`. But the automation node type keeps the real dashed service\nname (the RPC routing prefix, which can''t change). The builder then used the raw\ndashed name for both the CONFIG.name match and `loadRemote(''${name}_ui'')`, so\nneither resolved.\n\nNormalize `-` -> `_` in the two automation call sites, mirroring core-api''s\n`remoteName()`. Idempotent for dashless names, so all existing plugins are\nunaffected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor(automations): use replaceAll for dash normalization\n\nSonarCloud S7781 — prefer String#replaceAll() over a global-regex\nString#replace(). Behaviourally identical; lib es2021 supports it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE--