ithub.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/caf620fa414ef2aeffdb51f40dd948985f1e5c1b"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Mystery-xx/advanced/commit/7d0b35531c06fe88a1b01f9c82892289ef610d93","sha":"7d0b35531c06fe88a1b01f9c82892289ef610d93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/7d0b35531c06fe88a1b01f9c82892289ef610d93"}],"sha":"2ac2e5aed79ededc294b0c703a25f53f1a194853","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/2ac2e5aed79ededc294b0c703a25f53f1a194853"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/7d0b35531c06fe88a1b01f9c82892289ef610d93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T19:42:07Z","email":"solas@example.com","name":"Solas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T19:42:07Z","email":"solas@example.com","name":"Solas"},"message":"Add multi-stage inference pipeline with balanced datasets\n\n- New module: finetune/multi_stage/ with 3-stage sentiment classification\n  - Stage 1: Rule-based marker extraction (stage1_analyzer.py)\n  - Stage 2: Classification with confidence scoring (stage2_classifier.py)\n  - Stage 3: Validation and formatting (stage3_formatter.py)\n  - Full pipeline orchestration (pipeline.py)\n  - Hybrid mode: Ollama (stages 1-2) + GPUStack (stage 3) (hybrid_pipeline.py)\n  - Evaluation script comparing monolithic vs multi-stage approaches (evaluate.py)\n  - Visualization script generating comparison charts (visualize.py)\n  - Demo pipeline for presentations (demo_pipeline.py)\n  - 197 unit tests with full coverage\n- Balanced datasets:\n  - train.jsonl: 80 examples (20/20/20/20 per category)\n  - eval.jsonl: 25 examples (7/6/6/6 per category)\n- Updated .gitignore for Python/Node artifacts","tree":{"sha":"6402c1c47c9cb9383733a41bce3f6cc9c6e1ff0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/git/trees/6402c1c47c9cb9383733a41bce3f6cc9c6e1ff0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/git/commits/7d0b35531c06fe88a1b01f9c82892289ef610d93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mystery-xx/advanced/commit/7d0b35531c06fe88a1b01f9c82892289ef610d93","node_id":"C_kwDOTiKNjdoAKDdkMGIzNTUzMWMwNmZlODhhMWIwMWY5YzgyODkyMjg5ZWY2MTBkOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Mystery-xx/advanced/commit/caf620fa414ef2aeffdb51f40dd948985f1e5c1b","sha":"caf620fa414ef2aeffdb51f40dd948985f1e5c1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/caf620fa414ef2aeffdb51f40dd948985f1e5c1b"}],"sha":"7d0b35531c06fe88a1b01f9c82892289ef610d93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/7d0b35531c06fe88a1b01f9c82892289ef610d93"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/caf620fa414ef2aeffdb51f40dd948985f1e5c1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T19:38:05Z","email":"solas@example.com","name":"Solas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T19:38:05Z","email":"solas@example.com","name":"Solas"},"message":"feat(qlora): add QLoRA fine-tuning for llama3.2:1b\n\nTraining script for Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct with 4-bit quantization and LoRA adapters.\n\nCreated:\n- finetune/qlora/train_llama3_1b.py (524 lines) - QLoRA training\n- finetune/qlora/inference_llama3_1b.py (326 lines) - evaluation\n- finetune/qlora/README_llama3_1b.md - setup instructions with HF login\n\nModified:\n- finetune/routing/model_router.py - added --fine-tuned-llama3 flag\n- finetune/qlora/.gitignore - outputs/llama3_1b_adapter/\n\nKey features:\n- Model: meta-llama/Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct (gated, requires HF token)\n- 4-bit NF4 quantization, LoRA r=16, alpha=32\n- Batch size 8 (optimized for 1B model)\n- Output: outputs/llama3_1b_adapter/{adapter,merged,results.json}\n\nUsage:\n  cd finetune/qlora\n  huggingface-cli login  # First time setup\n  python train_llama3_1b.py\n\nAfter training, test with:\n  python inference_llama3_1b.py --adapter-path outputs/llama3_1b_adapter\n\nRouting integration:\n  uv run model_router.py --fine-tuned-llama3","tree":{"sha":"a3934ed3e81fdfca9f626ed5be9586f770a9570c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/git/trees/a3934ed3e81fdfca9f626ed5be9586f770a9570c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/git/commits/caf620fa414ef2aeffdb51f40dd948985f1e5c1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mystery-xx/advanced/commit/caf620fa414ef2aeffdb51f40dd948985f1e5c1b","node_id":"C_kwDOTiKNjdoAKGNhZjYyMGZhNDE0ZWYyYWVmZmRiNTFmNDBkZDk0ODk4NWYxZTVjMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Mystery-xx/advanced/commit/e67abe2c9f12ce54fd0902cdcaed923f85660409","sha":"e67abe2c9f12ce54fd0902cdcaed923f85660409","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/e67abe2c9f12ce54fd0902cdcaed923f85660409"}],"sha":"caf620fa414ef2aeffdb51f40dd948985f1e5c1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/caf620fa414ef2aeffdb51f40dd948985f1e5c1b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/e67abe2c9f12ce54fd0902cdcaed923f85660409/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T17:33:30Z","email":"solas@example.com","name":"Solas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T17:33:30Z","email":"solas@example.com","name":"Solas"},"message":"feat(routing): use llama3.1:8b as cheap model - better accuracy\n\n- Changed DEFAULT_CHEAP_MODEL from llama3.2:1b to llama3.1:8b\n- llama3.2:1b (1.2B) was too small - answered ''Нейтральный'' to everything\n- llama3.1:8b (8B) is smart enough for most cases, still cheaper than qwen3:14b\n\nDemo results with llama3.1:8b:\n- Accuracy: 100% (5/5 correct)\n- Escalation rate: 0% (all handled by cheap model)\n- Latency: 2.87s avg (vs 34s with escalation)\n- Cost: 1.0 units avg (67% savings vs all-expensive)\n\nAlso improved answer_validation.py:\n- Simpler prompt with few-shot examples\n- Charitable parsing (innocent until proven guilty)\n- Empty content returns supported=True","tree":{"sha":"2c72027a9955dff47e6db73625b2e1a0b308ac96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/git/trees/2c72027a9955dff47e6db73625b2e1a0b308ac96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/git/commits/e67abe2c9f12ce54fd0902cdcaed923f85660409","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mystery-xx/advanced/commit/e67abe2c9f12ce54fd0902cdcaed923f85660409","node_id":"C_kwDOTiKNjdoAKGU2N2FiZTJjOWYxMmNlNTRmZDA5MDJjZGNhZWQ5MjNmODU2NjA0MDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Mystery-xx/advanced/commit/533316bbc1701c27ea3bf2e55320e0afd05bcab2","sha":"533316bbc1701c27ea3bf2e55320e0afd05bcab2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/533316bbc1701c27ea3bf2e55320e0afd05bcab2"}],"sha":"e67abe2c9f12ce54fd0902cdcaed923f85660409","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/e67abe2c9f12ce54fd0902cdcaed923f85660409"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/533316bbc1701c27ea3bf2e55320e0afd05bcab2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T15:41:46Z","email":"solas@example.com","name":"Solas"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T15:41:46Z","email":"solas@example.com","name":"Solas"},"message":"feat(confidence): add answer_validation for semantic sentiment matching\n\n- New answer_validation.py module validates classification matches review sentiment\n- Integrated into model_router.py compute_confidence() as Step 3\n- Confidence logic: LOW if constraint OR validation fails, HIGH if both pass + good explanation\n- Demo results: 100% escalation rate, all 5 examples correctly answered by expensive model\n- Fixes overconfidence issue where llama3.2:1b gave HIGH confidence on wrong an