name":"Solas"},"message":"refactor(commands): Convert run-level1-tests and run-level2-journeys to task() wrappers\n\n- run-level1-tests.md: Removed direct execution, now delegates to test-runner subagent\n  - Added Delegation Pattern section with service/scope/action parameters\n  - Removed ''ВЫПОЛНЯЙ НАПРЯМУЮ'' prohibition\n  - Updated Usage examples for single/multiple services\n\n- run-level2-journeys.md: Removed direct execution, now delegates to ui-tester subagent\n  - Added Delegation Pattern section with feature/url parameters\n  - Removed ''ВЫПОЛНЯЙ НАПРЯМУЮ'' prohibition\n  - Preserved Prerequisites, Error Scenarios, Integration sections\n\nBoth commands now follow wrapper pattern: parse args → task(subagent) → forward result","tree":{"sha":"9059d46bf2f69091f50fb2c5ccdb961e0f6208a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/git/trees/9059d46bf2f69091f50fb2c5ccdb961e0f6208a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/git/commits/842d1cba86649e53b3674da96586ea5721cb33b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mystery-xx/advanced/commit/842d1cba86649e53b3674da96586ea5721cb33b6","node_id":"C_kwDOTiKNjdoAKDg0MmQxY2JhODY2NDllNTNiMzY3NGRhOTY1ODZlYTU3MjFjYjMzYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Mystery-xx/advanced/commit/f2a3c2e2cebc833fedb0f63af0e64e54a2399874","sha":"f2a3c2e2cebc833fedb0f63af0e64e54a2399874","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/f2a3c2e2cebc833fedb0f63af0e64e54a2399874"}],"sha":"842d1cba86649e53b3674da96586ea5721cb33b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/842d1cba86649e53b3674da96586ea5721cb33b6"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Mystery-xx/advanced/commits/f2a3c2e2cebc833fedb0f63af0e64e54a2399874/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T09:14:22Z","email":"solas@example.com","name":"Solas"},"comment_count"