odekid/yadah-microfinance-frontend/commits/7914cab240f3df613c6467ff1a14353714f8e4c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:01:04Z","email":"kwasibordesjacob@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Kwasi Bordes"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-10T12:01:04Z","email":"kwasibordesjacob@gmail.com","name":"Jacob Kwasi Bordes"},"message":"Merge branch ''main'' into v2\n\nResolves five conflicts between the customer-profile rework on v2 and the\nfeature work on main.\n\n- customer-form.tsx: v2''s layout stands (photo rail, ID scans paired below\n  next of kin, sticky footer, camera capture on every slot); main''s\n  field-labelled error toast replaces the old inline banner. The label map\n  drops the fields v2 removed.\n- lib/customers.ts: main''s required identification block and its mapped\n  UpdateCustomerInput, over v2''s shorter field list. The ID scans stay\n  optional, which is what v2 changed them to, so the mapped type gives them\n  the null that clears one.\n- lib/customer-form.ts: main''s general CLEARABLE/diffCustomer machinery,\n  narrowed to the fields that survive and extended to the ID scans, which\n  retires v2''s special case. Registration no longer insists on the scans.\n- customer-new.tsx: v2''s wording, the ID no longer being required.\n- hp-new.tsx: both sides, main''s NOT_ELIGIBLE reason list beside v2''s copy.\n\npackage-lock.json is resynced against the merged package.json.","tree":{"sha":"a6255fd80b17c4a82fa99d7ce397c2b3fa6fb6c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kwesi-codekid/yadah-microfinance-frontend/git/trees/a6255fd80b17c4a82fa99d7ce397c2b3fa6fb6c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kwesi-codekid/yadah-microfinance-frontend/git/commits/7914cab240f3df613c6467ff1a14353714f8e4c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107305649?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kwesi-codekid/events