sha":"deb19c2d067ae0d611bb36349134699b12c9cf2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/deb19c2d067ae0d611bb36349134699b12c9cf2f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/7021a08fa677718bbf401bc5cbd7b418107c02c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T21:15:32Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T21:15:32Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(gateway): self-diagnosing response when the dashboard build is missing\n\nA missing midas_code/dist previously produced Express''s bare \"Cannot GET /\",\nwhich says nothing about why. Now the gateway checks for dist/index.html\nspecifically (not just the directory) and, when absent, logs a loud MISSING\nBUILD line at boot and serves a 503 page naming the expected path, the build\ncommand that should have produced it, and where to look in Railway''s logs.\n\n/api/health gains distFound so the build can be confirmed remotely without\nreading logs. Health still returns 200 in this state, so the platform keeps\nthe service up and the diagnostic stays reachable.\n\nVerified both paths: build present -> 200 text/html, distFound true; build\nabsent -> 503 with the explanatory page, distFound false.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1","tree":{"sha":"2b1db5d958d90e35765dcf88a96e4c4a1746b751","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/2b1db5d958d90e35765dcf88a96e4c4a1746b751"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/7021a08fa677718bbf401bc5cbd7b418107c02c5","verification":{"payload":"tree 2b1db5d958d90e35765dcf88a96e4c4a1746b751\nparent b3fc6cbb287b0c6d5e240f9bf3622ae098dcf5ec\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785100532 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785100532 +0000\n\nfix(gateway): self-diagnosing response when the dashboard build is missing\n\nA missing midas_code/dist previously produced Express''s bare \"Cannot GET /\",\nwhich says nothing about why. Now the gateway checks for dist/index.html\nspecifically (not just the directory) and, when absent, logs a loud MISSING\nBUILD line at boot and serves a 503 page naming the expected path, the build\ncommand that should have produced it, and where to look in Railway''s logs.\n\n/api/health gains distFound so the build can be confirmed remotely without\nreading logs. Health still returns 200 in this state, so the platform keeps\nthe service up and the diagnostic stays reachable.\n\nVerified both paths: build present -> 200 text/html, distFound true; build\nabsent -> 503 with the explanatory page, distFound false.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfF