vents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/b3fc6cbb287b0c6d5e240f9bf3622ae098dcf5ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T20:59:12Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T20:59:12Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(deploy): actually switch the builder to RAILPACK\n\nThe previous commit claimed this change but shipped only the .nixpacksignore\ndeletion. Its `git add` listed a path already removed from disk; git add fails\natomically on a missing pathspec, and stderr was routed to /dev/null, so\nrailway.json was silently left unstaged. The remote kept \"builder\": \"NIXPACKS\".\n\nThis is the actual switch, plus --no-audit --no-fund to trim build noise.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1","tree":{"sha":"7226b1077c3c3962f17d42fd8beed680f2c4f4b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/7226b1077c3c3962f17d42fd8beed680f2c4f4b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/b3fc6cbb287b0c6d5e240f9bf3622ae098dcf5ec","verification":{"payload":"tree 7226b1077c3c3962f17d42fd8beed680f2c4f4b2\nparent 58c5692827b1412a80578a484609b80d6c0e2a9d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785099552 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785099552 +0000\n\nfix(deploy): actually switch the builder to RAILPACK\n\nThe previous commit claimed this change but shipped only the .nixpacksignore\ndeletion. Its `git add` listed a path already removed from disk; git add fails\natomically on a missing pathspec, and stderr was routed to /dev/null, so\nrailway.json was silently left unstaged. The remote kept \"builder\": \"NIXPACKS\".\n\nThis is the actual switch, plus --no-audit --no-fund to trim build noise.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQHlEjX4D\nGrfofclZJZlZjyWLOsD7giduVXhV0tEbwhbZ7mhPUYNERCmZa4q15/lv7K+b8qHyDlAuyVmspRrT\n7wI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-26T20:59:14Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commit/b3fc6cbb287b0c6d5e240f9bf3622ae098dcf5ec","node_id":"C_kwDOTiNWD9oAKGIzZmM2Y2JiMjg3YjBjNmQ1ZTI0MGY5YmYzNjIyYWUwOThkY2Y1ZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commit/58c5692827b1412a80578a484609b80d6c0e2a9d","sha":"58c5692827b1412a80578a484609b80d6c0e2a9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/58c5692827b1412a80578a484609b80d6c0e2a9d"}],"sha":"b3fc6cbb287b0c6d5e240f9bf3622ae098dcf5ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/b3fc6cbb287b0c6d5e240f9bf3622ae098dcf5ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/58c5692827b1412a80578a484609b80d6c0e2a9d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T20:58:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T20:58:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(deploy): switch builder NIXPACKS -> RAILPACK\n\nRailway deprecated Nixpacks. Railpack is the current default and detects Node\ncleanly here: package.json + package-lock.json are the only dependency\nmanifests at root. The ten stray .py files do not trigger a Python provider\nbecause none of its markers exist (no requirements.txt, pyproject.toml, or\nPipfile) — the Python tools are local-only.\n\nDropped .nixpacksignore: Railpack does not read it, so keeping it would just\nbe misleading dead config.\n\nVerified in a clean room — node_modules and dist wiped, then the exact build\ncommand Railway runs: 49s to a full build (19 bundles), then npm start boots\non 0.0.0.0:$PORT, health 200, dashboard 200, API 401 without a key, and the\nTradingView webhook accepts a post.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1","tree":{"sha":"8b2552c89271a3740543fa19be0526a40cacb214","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/8b2552c89271a3740543fa19be0526a40cacb214"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/58c5692827b1412a80578a484609b80d6c0e2a9d","verification":{"payload":"tree 8b2552c89271a3740543fa19be0526a40cacb214\nparent 8981d582c6e99a578afe6f99af55fe5589122b31\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785099505 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785099505 +0000\n\nfix(deploy): switch builder NIXPACKS -> RAILPACK\n\nRailway deprecated Nixpacks. Railpack is the current default and detects Node\ncleanly here: package.json + package-lock.json are the only dependency\nmanifests at root. The ten stray .py files do not trigger a Python provider\nbecause none of its markers exist (no requirements.txt, pyproject.toml, or\nPipfile) — the Python tools are local-only.\n\nDropped .nixpacksignore: Railpack does not read it, so keeping it would just\nbe misleading dead config.\n\nVerified in a clean room — node_modules and dist wiped, then the exact build\ncommand Railway runs: 49s to a full build (19 bundles), then npm start boots\non 0.0.0.0:$PORT, health 200, dashboard 200, API 401 without a key, and the\nTradingView webhook accepts a post.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEYiBZmG\nEOWhQpy46YLG7gS426S/dBPZWtzBVeqzsTOVQkCNwX6S9d7Z4+4r3jG8E7n9yUJMOIlnsrqeLh7t\n4AY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-26T20:58:28Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commit/58c5692827b1412a80578a484609b80d6c0e2a9d","node_id":"C_kwDOTiNWD9oAKDU4YzU2OTI4MjdiMTQxMmE4MDU3OGE0ODQ2MDliODBkNmMwZTJhOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commit/8981d582c6e99a578afe6f99af55fe5589122b31","sha":"8981d582c6e99a578afe6f99af55fe5589122b31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/8981d582c6e99a578afe6f99af55fe5589122b31"}],"sha":"58c5692827b1412a80578a484609b80d6c0e2a9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/58c5692827b1412a80578a484609b80d6c0e2a9d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/8981d582c6e99a578afe6f99af55fe5589122b31/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T19:55:59Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T19:55:59Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"docs(deploy): TradingView webhook + Postgres setup steps\n\nCovers the parts that cannot be inferred from the code: the alert must use\n\"Any alert() function call\" with an EMPTY message box (alert() supplies the\nJSON), the webhook URL itself is the credential since TradingView cannot send\nheaders, and the JSONL fallback is wiped on every Railway redeploy so Postgres\nis required for anything worth keeping.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1","tree":{"sha":"f741ffe0ac094ef9698fc3d7e8555faae0ba4852","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/f741ffe0ac094ef9698fc3d7e8555faae0ba4852"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/8981d582c6e99a578afe6f99af55fe5589122b31","verification":{"payload":"tree f741ffe0ac094ef9698fc3d7e8555faae0ba4852\nparent 9ad92bc73bfbc82fa7ce86c3c815fe85da77abae\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785095759 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785095759 +0000\n\ndocs(deploy): TradingView webhook + Postgres setup steps\n\nCovers the parts that cannot be inferred from the code: the alert must use\n\"Any alert() function call\" with an EMPTY message box (alert() supplies the\nJSON), the webhook URL itself is the credential since TradingView cannot send\nheaders, and the JSONL fallback is wiped on every Railway redeploy so Postgres\nis required for anything worth keeping.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQA5y8yex\nW7rFYcx/y/PbsYBMiZtv6vChWUNScuvpgs45M9UQiRi0pXx5o38ZeBxp6uLRZ9OTXXH0mmbzMxj5\nFwU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-26T19:56:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commit/8981d582c6e99a578afe6f99af55fe5589122b31","node_id":"C_kwDOTiNWD9oAKDg5ODFkNTgyYzZlOTlhNTc4YWZlNmY5OWFmNTVmZTU1ODkxMjJiMzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commit/9ad92bc73bfbc82fa7ce86c3c815fe85da77abae","sha":"9ad92bc73bfbc82fa7ce86c3c815fe85da77abae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/9ad92bc73bfbc82fa7ce86c3c815fe85da77abae"}],"sha":"8981d582c6e99a578afe6f99af55fe5589122b31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/8981d582c6e99a578afe6f99af55fe5589122b31"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/9ad92bc73bfbc82fa7ce86c3c815fe85da77abae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T19:55:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T19:55:28Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(signals): TradingView webhook receiver + durable signal store\n\nGives the Railway deployment a job a laptop physically cannot do: TradingView\nwebhooks need a public URL, and a sleeping machine has none. Captures live\nregime flips and strategy signals so the 18-day CSV stops being the ceiling\non every backtest conclusion.\n\n- POST /api/webhook/tradingview/:token — TradingView cannot attach custom\n  headers, so the shared secret rides in the URL path (timing-safe compare)\n  and this route is exempted from the X-Vega-Key gate. Answers 200 fast;\n  TradingView disables an alert after repeated non-2xx replies.\n- Accepts every body shape TradingView emits: application/json (claimed by\n  the global express.json), a JSON string under text/plain, a body with no\n  content-type at all, and bare plain text. The first cut only handled the\n  string case, so JSON sent with a proper content-type silently degraded to\n  an unattributed ''alert'' row — caught by testing all four variants.\n- signal_store.js: Postgres when DATABASE_URL is set (Railway plugin, table\n  auto-created), JSONL otherwise. The JSONL path is explicitly ephemeral on\n  a container filesystem and says so at boot.\n- GET /api/signals (X-Vega-Key protected) with limit/symbol/event filters;\n  /api/health now reports signalStore + signalCount.\n- Pine filter gains an alert() emitting a JSON body — regime code and label\n  plus the ER/ADX/volRatio/ATR readings and which rule fired — so captured\n  signals carry the full diagnostic context, not just a notification.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1","tree":{"sha":"27117460797ebfd1b427dfb07ec96a96e4aaf0c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/27117460797ebfd1b427dfb07ec96a96e4aaf0c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/9ad92bc73bfbc82fa7ce86c3c815fe85da77abae","verification":{"payload":"tree 27117460797ebfd1b427dfb07ec96a96e4aaf0c4\nparent c70bca4daa5d0ab2e1141b9c4801ca8d7f15c303\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785095728 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1785095728 +0000\n\nfeat(signals): TradingView webhook receiver + durable signal store\n\nGives the Railway deployment a job a laptop physically cannot do: TradingView\nwebhooks need a public URL, and a sleeping machine has none. Captures live\nregime flips and strategy signals so the 18-day CSV stops being the ceiling\non every backtest conclusion.\n\n- POST /api/webhook/tradingview/:token — TradingView cannot attach custom\n  headers, so the shared secret rides in the URL path (timing-safe compare)\n  and this route is exempted from the X-Vega-Key gate. Answers 200 fast;\n  TradingView disables an alert after repeated non-2xx replies.\n- Accepts every body shape TradingView emits: application/json (claimed by\n  the global express.json), a JSON string under text/plain, a body with no\n  content-type at all, and bare plain text. The first cut only handled the\n  string case, so JSON sent with a proper content-type silently degraded to\n  an unattributed ''alert'' row — caught by testing all four variants.\n- signal_store.js: Postgres when DATABASE_URL is set (Railway plugin, table\n  auto-created), JSONL otherwise. The JSONL path is explicitly ephemeral on\n  a container filesystem and says so at boot.\n- GET /api/signals (X-Vega-Key protected) with limit/symbol/event filters;\n  /api/health now reports signalStore + signalCount.\n- Pine filter gains an alert() emitting a JSON body — regime code and label\n  plus the ER/ADX/volRatio/ATR readings and which rule fired — so captured\n  signals carry the full diagnostic context, not just a notification.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOnEAX5f\nkRjD0hlmt2lAKGTOouVZwiggjWE7FoXRsPhKwve6Fxi1hqySNFXaa0l84pWB1z6eVnaFEZw1j0qx\nWA0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-26T19:55:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commit/9ad92bc7