scriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/a72088367a34a496ae748641631e3dd107b2362e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T13:20:41Z","email":"kblue8319@gmail.com","name":"Hardthrone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T13:20:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"style(ui): seg buttons match Fluent voice, primary glow, spec card cleanup (#28)\n\n- Seg buttons drop the mono/tracking treatment for the Fluent button\n  voice: Segoe family, semibold 13px, normal case labels (Summary/JSON).\n- All blue (primary) Fluent buttons carry the brand glow at rest via a\n  vega-btn-glow class stamped by the shared Button wrapper and the\n  intake submit; hover deepens the bloom instead of dimming to the\n  subtle hover variant.\n- Canonical spec summary straightened: fact tiles equalized and sized\n  down from xl, properties rebuilt as a 3-column grid of bordered stat\n  cells (uppercase label over tabular mono value), footer badge aligned\n  inline with the regenerate action.\n- Vega-kill.ps1 updated for the current suite: Vega_Gateway_Server.js\n  fingerprint added (was only matching the old MIDAS_Gateway name),\n  legacy patterns kept for stale processes; em-dashes purged from both\n  kill and stop scripts so PowerShell 5.1 parses them without a BOM.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"718611ca4fb23203120a85be07e762101b0539b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/718611ca4fb23203120a85be07e762101b0539b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/a72088367a34a496ae748641631e3dd107b2362e","verification":{"payload":"tree 718611ca4fb23203120a85be07e762101b0539b2\nparent e82fa19356135