users/Hardthrone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hardthrone1","id":219598232,"login":"Hardthrone1","node_id":"U_kgDODRbNmA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/e82fa19356135d77cef555bf5857ea76d2b2e27e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T12:46:08Z","email":"kblue8319@gmail.com","name":"Hardthrone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T12:46:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"style(ui): unified brand treatment, pill glow, compact nav, HUD alignment (#27)\n\nFit-and-finish pass over the control surfaces:\n\n- Pills (diag, deploy, context, skill tags, all Fluent badges) get the\n  main panel''s glow recipe keyed to currentColor, so status pills glow\n  in their own semantic hue.\n- A subtler variant of the same glow lands on every hover target\n  (Fluent buttons/tabs, segs, copy/clear, HUD buttons, suggestions,\n  rail toggles, metric cards); elements with stronger bespoke hover\n  shadows are excluded so nothing fights.\n- Utility buttons unified to one brand language (color-mix on\n  colorBrandForeground1, 6-8px radii, mono uppercase): seg controls\n  (summary/json, Pine/Python, Skills/Curator/GEPA, swarm modes),\n  codegen/swarm COPY + CLEAR, replay HUD controls. The active seg drops\n  its !important overrides for a calmer scale + branded glow.\n- Portal nav rail: tabs compacted to 30px (roughly half), labels bumped\n  to 14px so density doesn''t cost readability.\n- Replay HUD is now a static footer under the chart instead of an\n  absolute overlay — the chart''s ResizeObserver shrinks the canvas, so\n  the HUD sits exactly at the chart''s bottom edge and the time axis is\n  no longer covered.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6e163e32de85fe3b7b16f0c79afb5f9e29ecaf94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/6e163e32de85fe3b7b16f0c79afb5f9e29ecaf94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/e82fa19356135d77cef555bf5857ea76d2b2e27e","verification":{"payload":"tree 6e163e32de85fe3b7b16f0c79afb5f9e29ecaf94\nparent ce81cce192b0f207a49a77ee7fa96297d99d48b5\nauthor Hardthrone1 <kblue8319@gmail.com> 1783860368 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783860368 -0500\n\nstyle(ui): unified brand treatment, pill glow, compact nav, HUD alignment (#27)\n\nFit-and-finish pass over the control surfaces:\n\n- Pills (diag, deploy, context, skill tags, all Fluent badges) get the\n  main panel''s glow recipe keyed to currentColor, so status pills glow\n  in their own semantic hue.\n- A subtler variant of the same glow lands on every hover target\n  (Fluent buttons/tabs, segs, copy/clear, HUD buttons, suggestions,\n  rail toggles, metric cards); elements with stronger bespoke hover\n  shadows are excluded so nothing fights.\n- Utility buttons unified to one brand language (color-mix on\n  colorBrandForeground1, 6-8px radii, mono uppercase): seg controls\n  (summary/json, Pine/Python, Skills/Curator/GEPA, swarm modes),\n  codegen/swarm COPY + CLEAR, replay HUD controls. The active seg drops\n  its !important overrides for a calmer scale + branded glow.\n- Portal nav rail: tabs compacted to 