8232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hardthrone1","id":219598232,"login":"Hardthrone1","node_id":"U_kgDODRbNmA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/891159e70c34fa0d24e9b78538588aff33392bca/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T09:59:17Z","email":"kblue8319@gmail.com","name":"Hardthrone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T09:59:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(swarm): Prism agent command cards + fix dead theme toggle (#24)\n\nThe swarm roster''s static tiles become interactive Prism glass command\ncards: clicking a card springs open a per-agent console whose commands\nexecute on that agent''s own gateway provider lane, with the response\nstreamed token-by-token behind a live terminal cursor. Executing cards\npulse a cyan ring, the avatar gains an orbiting ring + breathing glow,\nand the Execute button locks with bouncing dots. Prism layer tokens\n(--bg, --surface-1/2/3) are scoped to .vega-prism so the global Fluent\nremap and light theme are untouched; a light-glass variant keeps the\nsuite legible in light mode. Hover lift + a sliding \">_\" cue make the\nclick affordance explicit; reduced-motion disables all of it.\n\nAlso fixes a regression caught while driving the UI: the theme toggle\ncalled a detached startViewTransition reference, which throws \"Illegal\ninvocation\" and silently killed theme switching entirely.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bffebae1d0a87ff8edf4bf4b3a609429f0e56db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/1bffebae1d0a87ff8edf4bf4b3a609429f0e56db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/891159e70c34fa0d24e9b78538588aff33392bca","verification":{"payload":"tree 1bffebae1d0a87ff8edf4bf4b3a609429f0e56db\nparent 5f3890a2c21518abff56bcc5d40d0e2472ac23ff\nauthor Hardthrone1 <kblue8319@gmail.com> 1783850357 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783850357 -0500\n\nfeat(swarm): Prism agent command cards + fix dead theme toggle (#24)\n\nThe swarm roster''s static tiles become interactive Prism glass command\ncards: clicking a card springs open a per-agent console whose commands\nexecute on that agent''s own gateway provider lane, with the response\nstreamed token-by-token behind a live terminal cursor. Executing cards\npulse a cyan ring, the avatar gains an orbiting ring + breathing glow,\nand the Execute button locks with bouncing dots. Prism layer tokens\n(--bg, --surface-1/2/3) are scoped to .vega-prism so the global Fluent\nremap and light theme are untouched; a light-glass variant keeps the\nsuite legible in light mode. Hover lift + a sliding \">_\" cue make the\nclick affordance explicit; reduced-motion disables all of it.\n\nAlso fixes a regression caught while driving the UI: the theme toggle\ncalled a detached startViewTransition reference, which throws \"Illegal\ninvocation\" and silently killed theme switching entirely.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\n