n/moon button in the portal header now triggers a circular\nripple that expands from the cursor (light mode) or shrinks away (dark mode)\nvia the View Transitions API. flushSync forces React to flush the state\nupdate synchronously inside the transition snapshot boundary. Degrades\ngracefully on browsers without the API. Respects prefers-reduced-motion.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2c0dd860752d4d0740331fd54d1d5d4b4ab4626","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/f2c0dd860752d4d0740331fd54d1d5d4b4ab4626"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/5f3890a2c21518abff56bcc5d40d0e2472ac23ff","verification":{"payload":"tree f2c0dd860752d4d0740331fd54d1d5d4b4ab4626\nparent 45b78a6be0ac65e0f2469b5f68dca421aee8fc96\nauthor Hardthrone1 <kblue8319@gmail.com> 1783841987 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783841987 -0500\n\nfeat(theme): View Transitions ripple on theme toggle (#23)\n\nClicking the sun/moon button in the portal header now triggers a circular\nripple that expands from the cursor (light mode) or shrinks away (dark mode)\nvia the View Transitions API. flushSync forces React to flush the state\nupdate synchronously inside the transition snapshot boundary. Degrades\ngracefully on browsers without the API. Respects prefers-reduced-motion.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqU0TDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAmCsQAHfjfVPLEKWMAMFqbGPKb8VC\nJCpzdfBY6KwEPBAt9KAXjRLzwy/+z1wptvwI/i5OwI0o0KDG0y/3nIf/Ba+Jz4Or\nkHaYYNlbmzfUN4D8Z11KZFyTNC6cilneBgkfElL0+R2jZd+7yhu0zM+8eD9fDuiG\njcCBWCe3H0DEq2RT9DOYgMB7GdNr9+Z/0oemHozFPh9frQ2/Kl29aN6tUu0CVJPK\nsGfkg8NXiMoKpGBlzV1wK12A4U7DbZi24QIcjCdya06VZwbsoiiobhofvWPSe7Ny\nqJ1MHZ