472ac23ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/5f3890a2c21518abff56bcc5d40d0e2472ac23ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219598232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hardthrone1","id":219598232,"login":"Hardthrone1","node_id":"U_kgDODRbNmA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/45b78a6be0ac65e0f2469b5f68dca421aee8fc96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-12T05:04:15Z","email":"kblue8319@gmail.com","name":"Hardthrone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-12T05:04:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(agent-console): SwipeToConfirm on Orchestrator action cards (#22)\n\n* docs: add RECOVERY.md — disaster-recovery checklist + runbook\n\nDocuments what git already restores vs. the local-only files that must be\nbacked up off-machine (.env with the ~20 gateway keys, the market-data CSVs,\nand the browser-localStorage Vault). Includes the fresh-machine recovery\nrunbook and the Vault export/restore snippets, so recovery doesn''t depend on\nremembering any of it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\n* feat(ui): SwipeToConfirm — pointer-event swipe slider for high-stakes actions\n\nAdds a reusable SwipeToConfirm component (no drag libs, pointer events only)\nwith a 90% drag threshold, snap-back physics, and approve/deny variants.\nIntegrates \"Swipe to Deploy\" (cyan) and \"Swipe to Discard\" (red) into the\nSwarm pine output card to prevent accidental clicks on generated strategies.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\n* chore: update tsbuildinfo after SwipeToConfirm build\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\n* feat(agent-console): replace Accept/Reject buttons with SwipeToConfirm\n\nThe Orchestrator''s action cards (setPineCode, resetRun, etc.) now use\nSwipeToConfirm sliders instead of click buttons — 90% drag threshold\nprevents accidental state mutations from the live VEGA chat.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1739a4b380ce1678664c7079ce197351754080ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/1739a4b380ce1678664c7079ce197351754080ee"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/45b78a6be0ac65e0f2469b5f68dca421aee8fc96","verification":{"payload":"tree 1739a4b380ce1678664c7079ce197351754080ee\nparent c33883eaff89d193389aa336282ce6137a292b9f\nauthor Hardthrone1 <kblue8319@gmail.com> 1783832655 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783832655 -0500\n\nfeat(agent-console): SwipeToConfirm on Orchestrator action cards (#22)\n\n* docs: add RECOVERY.md — disaster-recovery checklist + runbook\n\nDocuments what git already restores vs. the local-only files that must be\nbacked up off-machine (.env with the ~20 gateway keys, the market-data CSVs,\nand the browser-localStorage Vault). Includes the fresh-machine recovery\nrunbook and the Vault export/restore snippets, so recovery doesn''t depend on\nremembering any of it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\n* feat(ui): SwipeToConfirm — pointer-event swipe slider for high-stakes actions\n\nAdds a reusable SwipeToConfirm component (no drag libs, pointer events only)\nwith a 90% drag threshold, snap-back physics, and approve/deny variants.\nIntegrates \"Swipe to Deploy\" (cyan) and \"Swipe to Discard\" (red) into the\nSwarm pine output card to prevent accidental clicks on generated strategies.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\n* chore: update tsbuildinfo after SwipeToConfirm build\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\n* feat(agent-console): replace Accept/Reject buttons with SwipeToConfirm\n\nThe Orchestrator''s action cards (setPineCode, resetRun, etc.) now use\nSwipeToConfirm sliders instead of click buttons — 90% drag threshold\nprevents accidental state mutations from the live VEGA chat.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUyBPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/wAQAIcs3EA6xndnxP/9QOfBeP+W\n5lBQP/AouRwCBHfx2NnqqzBdk6q8eQqHTyDqb1YA0ffefZXQBKLRtkHW8ZZLZDEn\n9+Ku45eYEVFI+Z3IWiU6XXHplvXo9pOPtRs22/EL0cJrlVJnbKellWLNVMsTqUJT\nJdV0bxotcDlOSGaDU+nn6AuW/tMTyB6/w2URPtk5npwH46Ztdk7c5tY8Bss7z6ng\n4NeAHoeBKWgnUthdsR1cTAf5kEicfi/AkvBUoCMCRy3