,"commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T11:57:25Z","email":"kblue8319@gmail.com","name":"Hardthrone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T11:57:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(dashboard): three UI polish fixes (Hermes pill, gateway meta, nav tooltip) (#19)\n\n1. Hermes blade — remove the redundant \"custom Hermes loop (...)\" header\n   pill; it duplicated the blade subtitle and crowded the section toggle.\n\n2. Swarm gateway meta — stop rendering \"v? · ?\" placeholders. The panel\n   read d.version / d.openrouter, which /api/health never returned. Build\n   the meta line from the fields the gateway actually sends (activeProvider,\n   circuitState) and drop any that are absent. Additively enrich the gateway\n   health response with version (GATEWAY_VERSION) + timestamp so a real\n   version shows; the banner now uses the same constant so they can''t drift.\n\n3. Sidebar tooltips — suppress the hover tooltip when the nav rail is\n   expanded (step + label already visible); only show it in the collapsed\n   icon-only rail.\n\nVerified end-to-end (tsc + vite build clean; Playwright drive with a mock\ngateway): pill gone, gateway line reads \"v1.4 · nvidia_intake · circuit\nclosed · <time>\" with no \"?\", tooltips 0 when expanded / 9 when collapsed,\nzero console errors.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"689c54b502a33f98b372438172291924a8bdca51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/689c54b502a33f98b372438172291924a8bdca51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/a1f4a25b2328dda5c53c619603df86243d431ad7","verification":{"payload":"tree 689c54b502a33f98b372438172291924a8bdca51\nparent 98de63669ff327e4d6468099b08797d08cabd14c\nauthor Hardthrone1 <kblue8319@gmail.com> 1783771045 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783771045 -0500\n\nfix(dashboard): three UI polish fixes (Hermes pill, gateway meta, nav tooltip) (#19)\n\n1. Hermes blade — remove the redundant \"custom Hermes loop (...)\" header\n   pill; it duplicated the blade subtitle and crowded the section toggle.\n\n2. Swarm gateway meta — stop rendering \"v? · ?\" placeholders. The panel\n   read d.version / d.openrouter, which /api/health never returned. Build\n   the meta line from the fields the gateway actually sends (activeProvider,\n   circuitState) and drop any that are absent. Additively enrich the gateway\n   health response with version (GATEWAY_VERSION) + timestamp so a real\n   version shows; the banner now uses the same constant so they can''t drift.\n\n3. Sidebar tooltips — suppress the hover tooltip when the nav rail is\n   expanded (step + label already visible); only show it in the collapsed\n   icon-only rail.\n\nVerified end-to-end (tsc + vite build clean; Playwright drive with a mock\ngateway): pill gone, gateway line reads \"v1.4 · nvidia_intake · circuit\nclosed · <time>\" with no \"?\", tooltips 0 when expanded / 9 when collapsed,\nzero console errors.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUi+lCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAA9UQAEQNjVeEmr22MTVevoKaTBuy\niIcUFnmZAXA6g+oX360HV3j4Zi0dy5FiDqoT5FxEmnAo4x9Vhat7geppLIg2K91K\nQhBjORQXpe4+CdUdYzVRjzm/CFGgjUvLpgMSJ/KVe+Z6pdcoySxkQF5hlh8Pp/eg\nglNG35KxEsnqSPrKVuDhXGdOUVthsyTpIUdRoEm9U9F+C/2k32Ct03omMSu2AmV+\nen3DPqVHvgnBbK4oeFevWmMO5NKD/kDoziQUw2eoUHQZTQAtWnX9bItsOeHVG5Fz\nb1mEfA48N4KNdDzbSZJU89bK3nhCG9/m4BHPJLGgdAvDkZ0/OLnTYvnxFxCiFfbg\nKHecKfz89aInNBrtiFguhePeQOeoYP4a8IGEtzHd2r3xcY+JqBlVygmDYC4kJ5y3\nxXVAY0dR1dt20h3k/eFgwM4/LwBavBzwRmX4daCPPLXuhz3evucNifJh3pq6Wk2c\n4HwQw5UiV10G8qip16l6CG3VEoT8pzKCCjCa06LkAhP1oLJJcdy9poAh3mBbStiF\nfmVVH3CmPzQ6fF0rAk1q4GzNPj0/C2e/BCwzrpaRRKZZ+4UJF5OzLApOYL+3iX6Q\ndY2kUa83