ub.com/users/Hardthrone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/fe85b46eaecf66e3999ea670e7dc89d010cc6a76/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-11T10:36:19Z","email":"kblue8319@gmail.com","name":"Hardthrone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-11T10:36:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(dashboard): Codegen + Hermes blades — surface codegen & runtime in UI (#16)\n\nThe dashboard stopped at 7 blades and had no representation of the\ncodegen/ package or the Hermes runtime (agent_loop + Curator + GEPA +\nskill_registry). Add two artifact-backed blades so the new backend is\nvisible and usable:\n\n- 03 · Codegen (AGT-CDG-001): one StrategySpec -> Pine v5 + Python payload\n  sharing a spec_hash (parity proof, cannot drift). MGC/MNQ toggle,\n  Pine|payload viewer, anti-cheat lint tiles + trap-check. Deterministic\n  counterpart to the LLM-driven Swarm blade; \"Use this build\" pushes the\n  Pine into the shared pipeline.\n- 09 · Hermes: runtime introspection — skill registry (8 skills), Curator\n  failure policy (TRANSIENT/PARAMETER/HARD + exponential backoff), GEPA\n  search space + seed population table (default individual highlighted).\n\nBoth load real data, not demo values: gen_runtime_artifacts.py emits\ncodegen_output.json + hermes_state.json from the actual codegen/ and\nhermes/ modules; sync-parity-data.mjs syncs them into public/data (same\npattern as the Backtest/Parity panels). GEPA is shown as its honest seed\npopulation (generation 0, no runs yet).\n\nBlades renumbered 01-09; Tab type + nav auto-render from blades.tsx.\nVerified end-to-end: tsc + vite build clean, Playwright drive of both\nblades passes with zero console errors.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f23e75c1da8c54472c06e55085e5ee2b16f71e8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/f23e75c1da8c54472c06e55085e5ee2b16f71e8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/fe85b46eaecf66e3999ea670e7dc89d010cc6a76","verification":{"payload":"tree f23e75c1da8c54472c06e55085e5ee2b16f71e8b\nparent 29b5fdcfc045e9b437c5b5cf0b22b8e9f56ceffd\nauthor Hardthrone1 <kblue8319@gmail.com> 1783766179 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783766179 -0500\n\nfeat(dashboard): Codegen + Hermes blades — surface codegen & runtime in UI (#16)\n\nThe dashboard stopped at 7 blades and had no representation of the\ncodegen/ package or the Hermes runtime (agent_loop + Curator + GEPA +\nskill_registry). Add two artifact-backed blades so the new backend is\nvisible and usable:\n\n- 03 · Codegen (AGT-CDG-001): one StrategySpec -> Pine v5 + Python payload\n  sharing a spec_hash (parity proof, cannot drift). MGC/MNQ toggle,\n  Pine|payload viewer, anti-cheat lint tiles + trap-check. Deterministic\n  counterpart to the LLM-driven Swarm blade; \"Use this build\" pushes the\n  Pine into the shared pipeline.\n- 09 · Hermes: runtime introspection — skill registry (8 skills), Curator\n  failure policy (TRANSIENT/PARAMETER/HARD + exponential backoff), GEPA\n  search space + seed population table (default individual highlighted).\n\nBoth load real data, not demo values: gen_runtime_artifacts.py emits\ncodegen_output.json + hermes_state.json from the actual codegen/ and\nhermes/ modules; sync-parity-data.mjs syncs them into public/data (same\npattern as the Backtest/Parity panels). GEPA is shown as its honest seed\npopulation (generation 0, no runs yet).\n\nBlades renumbered 01-09; Tab type + nav auto-render from blades.tsx.\nVerified end-to-end: tsc + vite build clean, Playwright drive of both\nblades passes with zero console errors.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APBjHWUcg9exofbWm48XK1\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqUhyjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJ6kQAHJdRV3hVXAD81ZavgVNmjlP\nOcwIfnjtjUoYJ31IXU5yBjWsfqCOkJpHHqn88zTc5eA7fLzspzt5BaWx9UFTJyBa\nbbqpwJiZ30JBmAymEXHWVt+N+ehSmYYWPrf1vOmPDF2uZS3pd0MITAecq2gJ23UU\n3Y+TpkVryJJrvq08eOo1kFHIagl5kG3LtGbTRzbG/rIi0XI2Hhf/GXi39LrqWNXQ\n+ciJeYMbix9YpANGRLLeRhqKr54qYcct+cBu0TJm5O5hjDjJSVhZsueH4CEc/P9z\nki0+XAlRDG7adw/k7JeyS0Ir0+ZCVamgmIyBQairItfB3yi17WvL1EQjUbHQHrvY\n9yL9CCjlyIRuRQ1qsssy6l9oiWsike2w/YtuEoaIElV4LzsVpMtlE6Sj9B75e+NI\npZ0CxJOCxFlsPKAKShznfTEShrlGTmHzerRCc7w95GG5aB+bwrFra9i+edVJoX8F\nfh2kz5guflZpnpNiEqqKvjO34eUzBJd7nYIgDlTOCH/F/eG9EBPogiiuse/vjcy8\nps/aQasDcpvyUHPrCFEJHGHJqd0zCNG/KNcz3qwt5AlDQfP5zWq11gFAx7wKFL4Y\ne2nV8H2Ssnvh4PfwQBi46pFWidUs9fM//UmvZcKScQ++Ci7qrpu3Uj7MSvqnddCB\n7wyeMxhNYjVy8I39nOOD\n=pH8o\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-24T11:01:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commit/fe85