Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(parity-engine): FirstRateData loader — first real market data through the pipeline (#6)\n\nAdds frd_loader.py to parse FirstRateData futures exports (timestamp in\nUS Eastern, start-of-bar convention, zero-volume bars omitted) into\nengine Bars with correct epoch-ms UTC conversion via zoneinfo.\n\nIncludes a CLI runner that executes the full parity + risk pipeline:\n    python -m parity_engine.frd_loader <frd_csv> <symbol>\n\nVerified against real GC and NQ samples (Jun 22 - Jul 7, 2026):\n  - GC 5m: 3,209 bars, 324 trades, session gating held (0 entries outside RTH)\n  - NQ 5m: 3,202 bars, 438 trades\n  - Risk engine correctly HALTed both runs at the 10% drawdown limit\n    and flagged consecutive-loss streaks\n\nSample CSVs are licensed FirstRateData content and are NOT committed.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RzBdcoGE7AH9tZrWxEsp3w\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"56c349a41719fd2e9f0e3ae0a1e886efe6665529","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/56c349a41719fd2e9f0e3ae0a1e886efe6665529"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/c66aa00bdde2a6744b68d8ce41758cea70811951","verification":{"payload":"tree 56c349a41719fd2e9f0e3ae0a1e886efe6665529\nparent c57a9a9a6693b2b000aad89c52d477922b59b028\nauthor Hardthrone1 <kblue8319@gmail.com> 1783565172 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783565172 -0500\n\nfeat(parity-engine): FirstRateData loader — first real market data through the pipeline (#6)\n\nAdds frd_loader.py to parse FirstRateData futures exports (timestamp in\nUS Eastern, start-of-bar convention, zero-volume bars omitted) into\nengine Bars with correct epoch-ms UTC conversion via zoneinfo.\n\nIncludes a CLI runner that executes the full parity + risk pipeline:\n    python -m parity_engine.frd_loader <frd_csv> <symbol>\n\nVerified against real 