os/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/dc02a03839a5fba2af5868e5518620f868e47cd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T01:17:26Z","email":"kblue8319@gmail.com","name":"Hardthrone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T01:17:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(risk-engine): add portfolio-level risk tracking and violation detection (#5)\n\nExtends parity engine with RiskEngine module that:\n  • Tracks drawdown limits (max %, daily/weekly loss in USD)\n  • Monitors per-trade risk (max loss %, consecutive losses)\n  • Enforces performance floors (win rate %, profit factor, expectancy)\n  • Computes risk metrics (Sharpe, drawdown, profit factor, expectancy)\n  • Reports violations with halt/warn severity levels\n\nIncludes:\n  - risk_engine.py: Core module with RiskEngine and RiskResult types\n  - risk_test.py: Unit tests for consecutive loss warnings and clean passes\n  - integration_demo.py: Three scenarios demonstrating safe/risky/scalable strategies\n\nAll tests pass. Scenario 1 (safe) shows profitable trade within limits.\nScenario 2 (risky) demonstrates consecutive loss detection. Scenario 3\n(scale) validates 1000-bar performance with positive expectancy.\n\nThis unblocks risk simulation in backtests alongside contract-correct parity.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RzBdcoGE7AH9tZrWxEsp3w\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33f27c77aed15aaaaef38eac4834cb99bbd67424","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/33f27c77aed15aaaaef38eac4834cb99bbd67424"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/dc02a03839a5fba2af5868e5518620f868e47cd3","verification":{"payload":"tree 33f27c77aed15aaaaef38eac4834cb99bbd67424\nparent 42d8821de305a48177484321644e0f1a8a82b2e1\nauthor Hardthrone1 <kblue8319@gmail.com> 1783559846 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783559846 -0500\n\nfeat(risk-engine): add portfolio-level risk tracking and violation detection (#5)\n\nExtends parity engine with RiskEngine module that:\n  • Tracks drawdown limits (max %, daily/weekly loss in USD)\n  • Monitors per-trade risk (max loss %, consecutive losses)\n  • Enforces performance floors (win rate %, profit factor, expectancy)\n  • Computes risk metrics (Sharpe, drawdown, profit factor, expectancy)\n  • Reports violations with halt/warn severity levels\n\nIncludes:\n  - risk_engine.py: Core module with RiskEngine and RiskResult types\n  - risk_test.py: Unit tests for consecutive loss warnings and clean passes\n  - integration_demo.py: Three scenarios demonstrating safe/risky/scalable strategies\n\nAll tests pass. Scenario 1 (safe) shows profitable trade within limits.\nScenario 2 (risky) demonstrates consecutive loss detection. Scenario 3\n(scale) validates 1000-bar performance with positive expectancy.\n\nThis unblocks risk simulation in backtests alongside contract-correct parity.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RzBdcoGE7AH9tZrWxEsp3w\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTvamCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEKcQAK7jnrWLXnLIuoHFXAf2jKm9\nzCWwna0X7ROHm4hqF7E1Wukn/Igo8Lb0k4mleBpsgCWF+KD0RxrQuoRfcLvHVixg\nq7eJaAs5Z/ibBqXlLr6AyQ01amdmxf9Qny7MRU/BAyqbFD1pd0N3aPi9OTLWGebJ\nUnq9ZI4Ef1NJlbQZOircVQPMlUSWNEDpx1u6K9xZ3TKjLVG7fUsrF6A239NE+heS\ncDhGAzCsanC0J+gyJ/+D7Yuboqw5hwuo9gBhTlwsG0BsgobJWtENYKyasGL2MpvX\nyWbqrrZyT3Tu8/dK5/0LYscOoCU4fpo/gxJo9l/9I6p8qsLV0C19fGtQTPihdo3N\n3e8Q8yymayfnXzYtbsQTePwmwzdriCn3ApO7U0RYr2gUZ4jg9MWwqn2wV5Jdo3qn\nR7m1orSCIn8hpct8JV1S0vdcvBy9S07NdRTnRFA8Juf0Ja6ym75P65X1Sj0aprWQ\nqcUNhwsk0zlmNCkBfcV9VsTewtzDl9KsuNgALG7cxWgeKOJFmPsOlJp6KSZqzLN4\ncyiEg5C7J2QP0zDwTr+ZyBqT9kvNYmQe+ocCNthEVm0WepqS/HnlfLyE1F+v6VZR\nNuQy4HhVuu32M7iCJ9Rt3PaTsqm2b+DQLX6IUZh5H8od5TFMC0PnWwcNYo90/hgW\nPMPC7FFkpWfZrUf6caF0\n=axIx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":tr