api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hardthrone1","id":219598232,"login":"Hardthrone1","node_id":"U_kgDODRbNmA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/42d8821de305a48177484321644e0f1a8a82b2e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T00:59:11Z","email":"kblue8319@gmail.com","name":"Hardthrone1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T00:59:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(parity-engine): contract-correct economics, gap-aware fills, session windowing (#4)\n\n- Scale gross PnL and unrealized equity by pointValue (MGC $10/pt, MNQ $2/pt);\n  previously PnL was raw price points, understating dollars 10-20x\n- Charge slippage once via adverse fill prices; Fill.slippage is now\n  reporting metadata with correct tick-value math (was double-counted and\n  overstated by 1/tickSize)\n- Stops that gap fill at the bar''s open, not the stop price; targets fill\n  as limit orders (exact price, no slippage), matching TradingView\n- Gate entries to the payload''s session window via zoneinfo (DST-aware,\n  overnight Globex windows supported); exits still process on every bar\n- Fix MNQ/NQ tick_value & point_value table in backtest_to_parity.py\n  (MNQ point value is $2.00, not $1.25; NQ tick value is $5, not $20)\n- Rewrite smoketest as an assertion suite proving all of the above\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RzBdcoGE7AH9tZrWxEsp3w\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7437bb7ab564a59e2c2cab380a062227aace505","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/a7437bb7ab564a59e2c2cab380a062227aace505"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/42d8821de305a48177484321644e0f1a8a82b2e1","verification":{"payload":"tree a7437bb7ab564a59e2c2cab380a062227aace505\nparent ef764ee0339480533f60bc392cae2842d711e331\nauthor Hardthrone1 <kblue8319@gmail.com> 1783558751 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783558751 -0500\n\nfix(parity-engine): contract-correct economics, gap-aware fills, session windowing (#4)\n\n- Scale gross PnL and unrealized equity by pointValue (MGC $10/pt, MNQ $2/pt);\n  previously PnL was raw price points, understating dollars 10-20x\n- Charge slippage once via adverse fill prices; Fill.slippage is now\n  reporting metadata with correct tick-value math (was double-counted and\n  overstated by 1/tickSize)\n- Stops that gap fill at the bar''s open, not the stop price; targets fill\n  as limit orders (exact price, no slippage), matching TradingView\n- Gate entries to the payload''s session window via zoneinfo (DST-aware,\n  overnight Globex windows supported); exits still process on every bar\n- Fix MNQ/NQ tick_value & point_value table in backtest_to_parity.py\n  (MNQ point value is $2.00, not $1.25; NQ tick value is $5, not $20)\n- Rewrite smoketest as an assertion suite proving all of the above\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RzBdcoGE7AH9tZrWxEsp3w\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTvJfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAFY4QAJqEW6k2KQ3ZNvm7zZjdCAZu\nLE39/OEjAlfWySWfrpgcH9vl/X7Mnc/LlmiKcfyjiqWJSEVhMkhFJA0QcoKvGIsf\nnS3NQ+MJmkmzYwFXn4IQQyKdXURVlG58uNrqDkRqM5QNuIrO6yH0R6XH0zqvWl4Z\n+0UEySVVrLavSF2F/kIV9H2Z8/CgsUJpomyvKx4vNcEv/f2FJIdCRmMStZi5VDwl\ns1sLUFdbXYNpoBOOJDTVxHE1