 with a \"Swarm › Step 04\"\n  breadcrumb trail sitting above the title.\n- Add a real, interactive expand toggle button that drives panel\n  fullscreen (requestFullscreen / exitFullscreen), reflecting live state.\n- De-duplicate the Gateway status: drop the status dot/label row from the\n  lower Gateway card and trust the header''s global indicator instead.\n- Add a reusable .panel-expand-btn style consistent with existing header\n  controls.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0171V1LePQgp6pU9z9aDzVri","tree":{"sha":"af8f559329ce9626e62b741cfecbfc97eaef41f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/af8f559329ce9626e62b741cfecbfc97eaef41f3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/ea215930d62d91e2329bd5a5a5f4f70d6b27edea","verification":{"payload":"tree af8f559329ce9626e62b741cfecbfc97eaef41f3\nparent 238c7a065c97d3aab443d0e3721367f093daac1b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783383495 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783383495 +0000\n\nfeat(swarm): unify header into single control bar\n\nFlatten the two heavy Swarm header sections into one streamlined control\nbar to reclaim vertical space for the orchestration controls.\n\n- Replace the redundant \"Swarm\" eyebrow with a \"Swarm › Step 04\"\n  breadcrumb trail sitting above the title.\n- Add a real, interactive expand toggle button that drives panel\n  fullscreen (requestFullscreen / exitFullscreen), reflecting live state.\n- De-duplicate the Gateway status: drop the status dot/label row from the\n  lower Gateway card and trust the header''s global indicator instead.\n- Add a reusable .panel-expand-btn style consistent with existing header\n  controls.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0171V1LePQgp6pU9z9aDzVri\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SI