u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commits/216b6eaadf03921706c274c49e1afa59d99873c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:00:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T12:00:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: premium glass + motion design pass on the Fluent portal shell\n\n- Motion suite on Fluent motion tokens (durations + curve tokens with\n  fallbacks): blade slide-in, breadcrumb/empty/loader fades, and a\n  .stagger-item utility driving staggered entries via --stagger-i\n  multipliers in nav items, timeline feed rows, and metric grids\n- Glassmorphism: theme-aware glass variables built with color-mix over\n  Fluent tokens (frosted tints in dark, frosted white in light) applied\n  with backdrop-filter blur(16px) + 1px translucent borders to the\n  header, nav rail, blades, context pane, cards, and slider tooltips;\n  brand-tinted radial mesh behind the shell for the glass to refract\n- 5-tier elevation aliases over Fluent shadow tokens (shadow2..shadow64);\n  cards and MetricCards lift translateY(-2px) to tier-4 on hover\n- New MetricCard component: glass tile with semantic status accent bar\n  + glow, Fluent type ramp, optional delta/hint; Backtest metrics now\n  render as staggered MetricCards mapped from semantic states\n- RangeSlider polish: brand-token track/thumb ring, animated inline\n  value badge (pill that scales while dragging), glass tooltips\n- Typography hierarchy mapped to Fluent tokens (subtitle1 panel titles,\n  caption1 hints/subs, tracked caption2 eyebrows); input hover/focus\n  states with brand focus ring\n- Fix stale panel step eyebrows (Diagnostics 05, Backtest 06, Vault 07)\n  to match the blade registry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RzBdcoGE7AH9tZrWxEsp3w","tree":{"sha":"c7d39da7f5c83e29469d6183c23c992ef35b0661","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/c7d39da7f5c83e29469d6183c23c992ef35b0661"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/216b6eaadf03921706c274c49e1afa59d99873c2","verification":{"payload":"tree c7d39da7f5c83e29469d6183c23c992ef35b0661\nparent 8f008009768f80ecfcdcb6f079cbe09bb1fb5c25\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783339234 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783339234 +0000\n\nfeat: premium glass + motion design pass on the Fluent portal shell\n\n- Motion suite on Fluent motion tokens (durations + curve tokens with\n  fallbacks): blade slide-in, breadcrumb/empty/loader fades, and a\n  .stagger-item utility driving staggered entries via --stagger-i\n  multipliers in nav items, timeline feed rows, and metric grids\n- Glassmorphism: theme-aware glass variables built with color-mix over\n  Fluent tokens (frosted tints in dark, frosted white in light) applied\n  with backdrop-filter blur(16px) + 1px translucent borders to the\n  header, nav rail, blades, context pane, cards, and slider tooltips;\n  brand-tinted radial mesh behind the shell for the glass to refract\n- 5-tier elevation aliases over Fluent shadow tokens (shadow2..shadow64);\n  cards and MetricCards lift translateY(-2px) to tier-4 on hover\n- New MetricCard component: glass tile with semantic status accent bar\n  + glow, Fluent type ramp, optional delta/hint; Backtest metrics now\n  render as staggered MetricCards mapped from semantic states\n- RangeSlider polish: brand-token track/thumb ring, animated inline\n  value badge (pill that scales while dragging), glass tooltips\n- Typography hierarchy mapped to Fluent tokens (subtitle1 panel titles,\n  caption1 hints/subs, tracked caption2 eyebrows); input hover/focus\n  states with brand focus ring\n- Fix stale panel step eyebrows (Diagnostics 05, Backtest 06, Vault 07)\n  to match the blade registry\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RzBdcoGE7AH9tZrWxEsp3w\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC/wpzU1\nalkObI/kUV9pbBiRTzimy2jAJrUgDuX5uBh598s3lYJviibXeorvgK2Keyo+XvhLCgickN1jJnrQ\nYw0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-24T11:01:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_adm