":{"date":"2026-07-06T10:23:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-06T10:23:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: migrate dashboard to Fluent UI v9 with Azure Portal shell + blade layout\n\n- Wrap the app in FluentProvider (webLight/webDark themes, header toggle);\n  remap legacy control-tower CSS vars onto Fluent design tokens so all\n  panels follow the Microsoft palette and Segoe UI typography\n- Replace AppShell/TopStatusBar with an Azure Portal-style shell:\n  brand command bar (search, context, deploy status), collapsible left\n  nav rail, breadcrumb + horizontal blade stack with maximize/close,\n  agent activity as a right InlineDrawer context pane\n- Rebase shared/ui primitives (Button/Badge/Field) on Fluent components\n  behind the existing API so every panel adopts Fluent without rewrites\n- Rewrite Strategy Intake with React Hook Form + zodResolver binding the\n  Zod schema onto Fluent Field/Dropdown/RadioGroup; drafting a spec now\n  opens the Spec blade beside Intake via the useBlades() context\n- Fix pythonBacktestAdapter to handle both condition formats of the\n  conditionSchema union (surfaced by zod 3.25 type inference)\n- Add opt-in module federation (VITE_FEDERATION=1) exposing Replay/\n  Swarm/Backtest panels and consuming remotes via VITE_FEDERATION_REMOTES\n- Document the new architecture in README and add a project verify skill\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RzBdcoGE7AH9tZrWxEsp3w","tree":{"sha":"5c37393a7f7efe51466fc9955f1d86ddfaea388e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/5c37393a7f7efe51466fc9955f1d86ddfaea388e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/8f008009768f80ecfcdcb6f079cbe09bb1fb5c25","verification":{"payload":"tree 5c37393a7f7efe51466fc9955f1d86ddfaea388e\nparent 238c7a065c97d3aab443d0e3721367f093daac1b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783333430 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1783333430 +0000\n\nfeat: migrate dashboard to Fluent UI v9 with Azure Portal shell + blade layout\n\n- Wrap the app in FluentProvider (webLight/webDark themes, header toggle);\n  remap legacy control-tower CSS vars onto Fluent design tokens so all\n  panels follow the Microsoft palette and Segoe UI typography\n- Replace AppShell/TopStatusBar with an Azure Portal-style shell:\n  brand command bar (search, context, deploy status), collapsible left\n  nav rail, breadcrumb + horizontal blade stack with maximize/close,\n  agent activity as a right InlineDrawer context pane\n- Rebase shared/ui primitives (Button/Badge/Field) on Fluent components\n  behind the existing API so every panel adopts Fluent without rewrites\n- Rewrite Strategy Intake with React Hook Form + zodResolver binding the\n  Zod schema onto Fluent Field/Dropdown/RadioGroup; drafting a spec now\n  opens the Spec blade beside Intake via the useBlades() context\n- Fix pythonBacktestAdapter to handle both condition formats of the\n  conditionSchema union (surfaced by zod 3.25 type inference)\n- Add opt-in module federation (VITE_FEDERATION=1) exposing Replay/\n  Swarm/Backtest panels and consuming remotes via VITE_FEDERATION_REMOTES\n- Document the new architecture in README and add a project verify skill\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RzBdcoGE7AH9tZrWxEsp3w\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAcH1dle\nYZFR3iUPE+6xIW/zYIABIbss6pDFPuYIBbcnQqJE8EdCc9q9uJ9nrYYSYmNCz/WLUn/qpBLi8Rdi\nwwU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-24T11:01:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent