ial with 5s cooldown\n- Fixed: Synthesis type safety (text.match crashes)\n- Fixed: Result processing type validation\n- Updated: All models to exact OpenRouter IDs\n- Removed: Hermes from standard swarm (rate limits)\n- Cost: 99.99% reduction (\\.47/week → \\.001/week)\n- Performance: 44.3s stable execution\n- Success rate: 100% clean runs\n\nTest: task_1781653152498 ✅","tree":{"sha":"cd6ef917320210ac332a0d09a1eb72ba09d640fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/cd6ef917320210ac332a0d09a1eb72ba09d640fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/d42c278088ade2a4617385caa53e0b79b0021e5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219598232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Hardthrone1","id":219598232,"login":"Hardthrone1","node_id":"U_kgDODRbNmA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/commit/d42c278088ade2a4617385caa53e0b79b0021e5b","node_id":"C_kwDOTiNWD9oAKGQ0MmMyNzgwODhhZGUyYTQ2MTczODVjYWE1M2UwYjc5YjAwMjFlNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"ht