rialize concurrent writes\n- Writes now execute strictly 1/3, 2/3, 3/3 with no interleaving\n- Verified: 3 concurrent analyses create 3 distinct vault files, zero conflicts\n- Log: [VAULT] Queued write x3 → [VAULT] Processing write 1/3, 2/3, 3/3\n\nIssue 2 (FIXED): HUD State Collisions\n- Replaced single window.lastResult with task-keyed window.midasResults[taskId]\n- Each task result now permanently addressable at its unique taskId key\n- window.lastResult preserved as backward-compatible alias (most recent task)\n- HUD behavior unchanged: displays newest completed task immediately\n\nTesting: Concurrent stress test with 3 simultaneous executeAnalysis() calls\n- All 3 analyses completed successfully\n- All 3 vault files created with distinct names\n- Vault writes serialized (zero conflicts, zero overwrites)\n- Task-keyed storage prevents HUD state collisions\n\nFiles Modified:\n- MIDAS_Orchestrator.js:\n  - Lines 72-73: Added vaultWriteQueue, vaultWriteSeq to constructor\n  - Lines 413-442: Replaced saveToVault() with queue wrapper + _processVaultWrite()\n  - Lines 238-245: Replaced window.lastResult with window.midasResults[taskId] + alias\n\nNo changes to vault-sync.js, index.html, routing, Graphify, agent selection, or architecture.\nProduction-ready for v1.5.0 freeze.","tree":{"sha":"e31f15abd913af34259901fdb00d0e263424c92c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/trees/e31f15abd913af34259901fdb00d0e263424c92c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Hardthrone1/Vega-Midas-Lite-Quant-Tower/git/commits/72ce08c5461247b14546ac05910f58e4024ba847","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/219598232?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Hardthrone1/f