b8c2027520ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NTARI-RAND/Janus/commits/b14f760071ee9da4f7c0c5d4a7c9b8c2027520ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/196215170?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetworkTheoryAppliedResearchInstitute/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetworkTheoryAppliedResearchInstitute/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetworkTheoryAppliedResearchInstitute/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetworkTheoryAppliedResearchInstitute/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NetworkTheoryAppliedResearchInstitute","id":196215170,"login":"NetworkTheoryAppliedResearchInstitute","node_id":"U_kgDOC7IBgg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetworkTheoryAppliedResearchInstitute/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetworkTheoryAppliedResearchInstitute/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetworkTheoryAppliedResearchInstitute/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetworkTheoryAppliedResearchInstitute/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetworkTheoryAppliedResearchInstitute/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NetworkTheoryAppliedResearchInstitute","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NTARI-RAND/Janus/commits/477bed56a4ae1d668cd06835df3ff47762c13a00/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-03T15:23:45Z","email":"info@ntari.org","name":"the Institute"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-03T15:23:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Publish the executable conformance suite; correct the specification license (#4)\n\nAdds jfa-conformance-suite.py, the suite the bylaws §1.4(a) name alongside\nthe official document. Standard library only. Run against the document in this\nrepository it reports RESULT: all executed checks PASS, exit 0.\n\nIt binds 3 of the 25 registered invariants at the document layer — section\norder, tier order, the twelve lines, anchor-to-registry binding, licensing,\nretired concepts staying retired, PII, preserved history, and the\nopen-questions deliverable. The other 22 are reported as delegated and unbound\nuntil a repo ships tests citing their IDs, rather than self-attested here.\n\nCorrects the licensing this repository asserted. The document''s own footer\nreads \"Software: AGPL-3.0 · Specification: CC BY-SA 4.0\", and the suite''s D5\ncheck enforces that both are stated — but the repository carried only\nLICENSE (AGPL-3.0) and a README claiming it covered the document. The\nspecification was therefore published under the wrong terms. LICENSE-SPEC now\ncarries the CC BY-SA 4.0 text for the specification, LICENSE continues to\ncover the software, and the README says which is which.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jodson Graves <info@ntari.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"844ca9ab0e2803e99d2691f5876362e6d72e8eac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NTARI-RAND/Janus/git/trees/844ca9ab0e2803e99d2691f5876362e6d72e8eac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/NTARI-RAND/Janus/git/commits/477bed56a4ae1d668cd06835df3ff47762c13a00","verification":{"payload":"tree 844ca9ab0e2803e99d2691f5876362e6d72e8eac\nparent f7264b42839a47725776f16a5b88b19ed37b2119\nauthor the Institute <info@ntari.org> 1788449025 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788449025 -0400\n\nPublish the executable conformance suite; correct the specification license (#4)\n\nAdds jfa-conformance-suite.py, the suite the bylaws §1.4(a) name alongside\nthe official document. Standard library only. Run against the document in this\nrepository it reports RESULT: all executed checks PASS, exit 0.\n\nIt binds 3 of the 25 registered invariants at the document layer — section\norder, tier order, the twelve lines, anchor-to-registry binding, licensing,\nretired concepts staying retired, PII, preserved history, and the\nopen-questions deliverable. The other 22 are reported as delegated and unbound\nuntil a repo ships tests citing their IDs, rather than self-attested here.\n\nCorrects the licensing this repository asserted. The document''s own footer\nreads \"Software: AGPL-3.0 · Specification: CC BY-SA 4.0\", and the suite''s D5\ncheck enforces that both are stated — but the repository carried only\nLICENSE (AGPL-3.0) and a README claiming it covered the document. The\nspecification was therefore published under the wrong terms. LICENSE-SPEC now\ncarries the CC BY-SA 4.0 text for the specification, LICENSE continues to\ncover the software, and the README says which is which.\n\nSigned-off-by: Jodson Graves <info@ntari.org>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmZEBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1IgQACZoSnzxEeaw2n+q8jzqNHeK\nJXjHUeBSh8H6TkHGH5B3t1pCLJag/zHTXMm6oN3KRWzIEUbd7MGVFIKVVU1NI2PD\nbL5jAOHPnZHuTMR8KjVgop5kRE5nayLKB1MbuMka7hpiZ9xlHTqFQXKytQDyMBky\nQ1fhZj3AHaaPrgCaYiEikpM2w5dtd57rNJfg/8BzFdaGI/uR2Q4BdPqpZWHVbREB\n3qQjUbgGvLnQBAMc4C5nKyaIgbibyGDaxFNz9o2QP8aqZ/bybnrRr6MVpiH3RBVe\nGxFEXp3t34zNVjzncks8NJKVlZ01J2toShg/yrUlf9GKyUF2F6+A8BziaKGB23UH\ntcSLoGUAi30hWalBI7CnA7LheyGvaTOd5MMQK5cvWcLj36HLAHjToLDUkevG6HFH\nzO4Y0FD39Lgo29CAu1C7HEUDUMIcfspaQBBhuWE3+OazmlMjKxI6F2KKcmcTud1S\nL0DsdIrAfKw9vBLAD6r5C6aqEKM/uY9FA7biC7B1/vVQ+ag45uIDGM9JI61F/BdM\nZ6YMJixCPmZg/54epupwEu6Q0RNdiN/jKDoB4Hc9QmbPaLpJNyLiISHsEoXMP4v5\nezV/A2iDvn5xE/ZDp8F0/4tfVzUnorQy0MNg3/ptfs7T0HS4epI/g9Vw3s3Dko7H\nvi2MeJA9Tl83dVvsiM+l\n=7Cql\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T15:23:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.g