starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/commits/4839d8f5520009169def09bdc2f45d6ac53894be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:57:22Z","email":"jyjeon@outlook.com","name":"jyje"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:57:22Z","email":"jyjeon@outlook.com","name":"jyje"},"message":"📄 docs(plan): record the D-009 Playwright MCP live QA pass\n\nFull 8-surface × 3-breakpoint structured QA pass (accessibility,\nkeyboard-only flow, console, network, responsive), written up in\ndocs/validation/playwright-mcp-v0.1.0.md. Update TASK.md''s Section 11\nlive QA matrix and related gate items to match, and append the D-009\nLOG.md entry with full defect detail.","tree":{"sha":"bcdf8c07b8e6e626671079ce1a282ce25dc2c6fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/git/trees/bcdf8c07b8e6e626671079ce1a282ce25dc2c6fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/git/commits/4839d8f5520009169def09bdc2f45d6ac53894be","verification":{"payload":"tree bcdf8c07b8e6e626671079ce1a282ce25dc2c6fd\nparent b5f6e4bfe810c0acb799cd99afcc3bbb91e473f4\nauthor jyje <jyjeon@outlook.com> 1784959042 +0900\ncommitter jyje <jyjeon@outlook.com> 1784959042 +0900\n\n📄 docs(plan): record the D-009 Playwright MCP live QA pass\n\nFull 8-surface × 3-breakpoint structured QA pass (accessibility,\nkeyboard-only flow, console, network, responsive), written up in\ndocs/validation/playwright-mcp-v0.1.0.md. Update TASK.md''s Section 11\nlive QA matrix and related gate items to match, and append the D-009\nLOG.md entry with full defect detail.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRgwnVW8EoufTgK+2vP7s6Ed1DaEgUCamRQQhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgk