owing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jyje","id":109659358,"login":"jyje","node_id":"U_kgDOBolE3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/commits/b5f6e4bfe810c0acb799cd99afcc3bbb91e473f4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:57:06Z","email":"jyjeon@outlook.com","name":"jyje"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:57:06Z","email":"jyjeon@outlook.com","name":"jyje"},"message":"🐛 bug(next): match Vue''s 900px responsive breakpoint for the composed layout\n\nNext Host/Standalone collapsed their two-column layout at Tailwind''s\ndefault 768px md: breakpoint while Vue collapsed at a custom 900px rule,\nso the two tracks disagreed on layout at 768×1024 — this project''s own\ntablet QA breakpoint. Switched both to min-[900px]: to match.","tree":{"sha":"d1f43f04a8b234b8c8317b143b4b2ada35da07fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/git/trees/d1f43f04a8b234b8c8317b143b4b2ada35da07fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/git/commits/b5f6e4bfe810c0acb799cd99afcc3bbb91e473f4","verification":{"payload":"tree d1f43f04a8b234b8c8317b143b4b2ada35da07fa\nparent 37355e564e2daeee55400a0942e91afc74aca1e1\nauthor jyje <jyjeon@outlook.com> 1784959026 +0900\ncommitter jyje <jyjeon@outlook.com> 1784959026 +0900\n\n🐛 bug(next): match Vue''s 900px responsive breakpoint for the composed layout\n\nNext Host/Standalone collapsed their two-column layout at Tailwind''s\ndefault 768px md: breakpoint while Vue collapsed at a custom 900px rule,\nso the two tracks disagreed on layout at 768×1024 — this project''s own\ntablet QA breakpoint. Switched both to min-[900px]: to match.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRgwnVW8EoufTgK+2vP7s6Ed1DaEgUCamRQMhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQz+7OhHdQ2hKKeQEA6vgjMqnFi3iEdHA9ns7U\nj5oa9xzPLghxURUp4IZiDfUBANI5ttvOzjZSXRDxMo+I0cJjwADJ8Q8Yq0kFUqDL\n9UoP\n=/VTr\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-25T05:58:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109659358?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jyje","id":109659358,"login":"jyje","node_id":"U_kgDOBolE3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jyje/pilot-module-federation/commit/b5f6e4bfe810c0acb799cd99afcc3bbb91e473f4","node_id":"C_kwDOTi8Mn9oAKGI1ZjZlNGJmZTgxMGMwYWNiNzk5Y2Q5OWFmY2MzYmJiOTFlNDczZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jyje/pilot-module-federation/commit/37355e564e2daeee55400a0942e91afc74aca1e1","sha":"37355e564e2daeee55400a0942e91afc74aca1e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/commits/37355e564e2daeee55400a0942e91afc74aca1e1"}],"sha":"b5f6e4bfe810c0acb799cd99afcc3bbb91e473f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/commits/b5f6e4bfe810c0acb799cd99afcc3bbb91e473f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109659358?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jyje","id":109659358,"login":"jyje","node_id":"U_kgDOBolE3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/commits/37355e564e2daeee55400a0942e91afc74aca1e1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:56:55Z","email":"jyjeon@outlook.com","name":"jyje"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:56:55Z","email":"jyjeon@outlook.com","name":"jyje"},"message":"🐛 bug(next-federation): fix Module Federation dropping the exposed component''s own CSS\n\nModule Federation carries JS across the origin boundary but not CSS.\nnext/host''s Tailwind build only scans its own source, so any utility\nclass next/remote''s FederatedMonitor used that wasn''t independently used\ninside next/host (here, gap-8) compiled to no rule at all. Added @source\ndirectives pointing at next/remote''s component source so next/host''s\nTailwind build pre-emptively includes them.","tree":{"sha":"c52b71e7f84e7a5ffa6b5566a670c835adac3a5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/git/trees/c52b71e7f84e7a5ffa6b5566a670c835adac3a5f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/git/commits/37355e564e2daeee55400a0942e91afc74aca1e1","verification":{"payload":"tree c52b71e7f84e7a5ffa6b5566a670c835adac3a5f\nparent f304384adcf680570bd5bcbb64c920f18518e394\nauthor jyje <jyjeon@outlook.com> 1784959015 +0900\ncommitter jyje <jyjeon@outlook.com> 1784959015 +0900\n\n🐛 bug(next-federation): fix Module Federation dropping the exposed component''s own CSS\n\nModule Federation carries JS across the origin boundary but not CSS.\nnext/host''s Tailwind build only scans its own source, so any utility\nclass next/remote''s FederatedMonitor used that wasn''t independently used\ninside next/host (here, gap-8) compiled to no rule at all. Added @source\ndirectives pointing at next/remote''s component source so next/host''s\nTailwind build pre-emptively includes them.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRgwnVW8EoufTgK+2vP7s6Ed1DaEgUCamRQJxsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQz+7OhHdQ2hL0WAEA8hVpES+Xwp9VFUoabwY3\n18ZK1vwN5jREeW45o3fMwy4A/iCqqKkcl05t36pY0CvUKNtQSWHARwMFCwQE0AsE\nIdEP\n=Mzvt\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-25T05:58:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109659358?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jyje","id":109659358,"login":"jyje","node_id":"U_kgDOBolE3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jyje/pilot-module-federation/commit/37355e564e2daeee55400a0942e91afc74aca1e1","node_id":"C_kwDOTi8Mn9oAKDM3MzU1ZTU2NGUyZGFlZWU1NTQwMGEwOTQyZTkxYWZjNzRhY2ExZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jyje/pilot-module-federation/commit/f304384adcf680570bd5bcbb64c920f18518e394","sha":"f304384adcf680570bd5bcbb64c920f18518e394","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/commits/f304384adcf680570bd5bcbb64c920f18518e394"}],"sha":"37355e564e2daeee55400a0942e91afc74aca1e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/commits/37355e564e2daeee55400a0942e91afc74aca1e1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109659358?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jyje","id":109659358,"login":"jyje","node_id":"U_kgDOBolE3g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/commits/f304384adcf680570bd5bcbb64c920f18518e394/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:56:46Z","email":"jyjeon@outlook.com","name":"jyje"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:56:46Z","email":"jyjeon@outlook.com","name":"jyje"},"message":"🐛 bug(vue-host): fix DataCloneError on every iframe context sync\n\nVue reactive Proxy objects cannot be cloned by postMessage''s structured-\nclone algorithm. IframePanel.vue was passing the reactive `context` prop\nstraight through; postContextToRemote now copies it into a plain object\nfirst. Found live via Playwright MCP — the existing unit test used a\nplain-object fixture, so it could not have caught this.","tree":{"sha":"52794e54343e9f81d073ced409d09e52ea868a22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/git/trees/52794e54343e9f81d073ced409d09e52ea868a22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/git/commits/f304384adcf680570bd5bcbb64c920f18518e394","verification":{"payload":"tree 52794e54343e9f81d073ced409d09e52ea868a22\nparent 82be3ecb7ded43689d6b357bfb118c6e884643cc\nauthor jyje <jyjeon@outlook.com> 1784959006 +0900\ncommitter jyje <jyjeon@outlook.com> 1784959006 +0900\n\n🐛 bug(vue-host): fix DataCloneError on every iframe context sync\n\nVue reactive Proxy objects cannot be cloned by postMessage''s structured-\nclone algorithm. IframePanel.vue was passing the reactive `context` prop\nstraight through; postContextToRemote now copies it into a plain object\nfirst. Found live via Playwright MCP — the existing unit test used a\nplain-object fixture, so it could not have caught this.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRgwnVW8EoufTgK+2vP7s6Ed1DaEgUCamRQHhsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQz+7OhHdQ2hIY8QEA39PCJSVgP6r5EJqbIh90\nnqi0zj82pfA7XZXEkSnYd2UA/RVCG5NjFJ8v/Tg+KK/RhP809qoxlsEbfE7cSEbr\nU08A\n=EMD9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-25T05:58:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/109659358?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/following{/other_user}","