d_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jyje","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/commits/61b94f2c8343fc25a8a7fade766a4504469fde15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T04:39:03Z","email":"jyjeon@outlook.com","name":"jyje"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T04:39:03Z","email":"jyjeon@outlook.com","name":"jyje"},"message":"🔧 chore(repo): stop tracking generated build output\n\nModule Federation DTS output (vue/host/@mf-types/) was committed by\naccident in the initial commit, and Next rewrites next-env.d.ts''s import\npath differently after `dev` vs `build`, causing constant untracked\nchurn. Ignore both, and scaffold the e2e/, docs/validation/, and\nartifacts/screenshots/readme/ directories the README already documents.","tree":{"sha":"7e5797d809f77ae311728bd217afe472930f0dfe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/git/trees/7e5797d809f77ae311728bd217afe472930f0dfe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jyje/pilot-module-federation/git/commits/61b94f2c8343fc25a8a7fade766a4504469fde15","verification":{"payload":"tree 7e5797d809f77ae311728bd217afe472930f0dfe\nparent 8a6c65fb63bd5ed994a260c25132f8fa50cff2d4\nauthor jyje <jyjeon@outlook.com> 1784954343 +0900\ncommitter jyje <jyjeon@outlook.com> 1784954343 +0900\n\n🔧 chore(repo): stop tracking generated build output\n\nModule Federation DTS output (vue/host/@mf-types/) was committed by\naccident in the initial commit, and Next rewrites next-env.d.ts''s import\npath differently after `dev` vs `build`, causing constant untracked\nchurn. Ignore both, and scaffold the e2e/, docs/validation/, and\nartifacts/screenshots/readme/ directories the README already documents.\n","reason"