19","node_id":"C_kwDOTjAOfNoAKGUxOGY3ZTFhMDdhZDcxYzU4ZGU0MDkyOTkxNjJmNDExNzM0MzE0MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nathan-thong/job-app-agent/commit/e046538860e56e7efe1db310859799cbf0a93f70","sha":"e046538860e56e7efe1db310859799cbf0a93f70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathan-thong/job-app-agent/commits/e046538860e56e7efe1db310859799cbf0a93f70"}],"sha":"e18f7e1a07ad71c58de409299162f41173431419","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathan-thong/job-app-agent/commits/e18f7e1a07ad71c58de409299162f41173431419"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224203174?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathan-thong","id":224203174,"login":"nathan-thong","node_id":"U_kgDODV0Rpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathan-thong/job-app-agent/commits/e046538860e56e7efe1db310859799cbf0a93f70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T20:07:30Z","email":"224203174+nathan-thong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nathan-thong"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T20:07:30Z","email":"224203174+nathan-thong@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nathan-thong"},"message":"Record the Extraction stage''s domain model and design decisions\n\nStep 3 grew past one commit''s worth of work during a design session, so the\nreasoning goes in before the code that depends on it.\n\nCONTEXT.md fixes the vocabulary the schemas and prompts will use. It also draws\nthe line the stage is built on. A Requirement carries evidence (the wording\ncopied out of the posting) and judgment (how necessary that wording is) in\nseparate fields, never mixed.\n\nADR-0001 says why spans are copied word for word. A paraphrase the model\ninvented reads the same as one it extracted, so copying is what makes\nhallucination checkable at all. It also says why that check is a plain function\nin the agent rather than a Pydantic validator. A response model answers whether\nthe data is well-formed, and that needs nothing but the data. Fidelity asks\nwhether the data matches a source, which needs both. A validator would have to\nread the posting out of an optional context, and it would quietly do nothing in\nthe fixture-driven tests where you''d assume it was working.\n\nADR-0002 covers what the check then forced. It made the mock fixture depend on\nits input, so mock mode needs a canonical sample posting for the fixture''s\nspans to come from. Skipping the check in mock mode was rejected because it\ngoes around the dropped_count guard that ADR-0001 exists to enforce.\n\nA wider architecture write-up was drafted and left out on purpose. Most of it\nwould be predictions rather than description until the code exists, and the\nprompt section can''t be written honestly before a live run. It gets written\nafter the stage is built.","tree":{"sha":"62ee0282823c5684411b53ca557aacfb3e11872d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathan-thong/job-app-agent/git/trees/62ee0282823c5684411b53ca557aacfb3e11872d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathan-thong/job-app-agent/git/commits/e046538860e56e7efe1db310859799cbf0a93f70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224203174?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nathan-thong","id":224203174,"login":"nathan-thong","node_id":"U_kgDODV0Rpg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nathan-thong/job-app-agent/commit/e046538860e56e7efe1db310859799cbf0a93f70","node_id":"C_kwDOTjAOfNoAKGUwNDY1Mzg4NjBlNTZlN2VmZTFkYjMxMDg1OTc5OWNiZjBhOTNmNzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nathan-thong/job-app-agent/commit/13274302cba833e62fa0ec1064dde46b1038ba4e","sha":"13274302cba833e62fa0ec1064dde46b1038ba4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathan-thong/job-app-agent/commits/13274302cba833e62fa0ec1064dde46b1038ba4e"}],"sha":"e046538860e56e7efe1db310859799cbf0a93f70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathan-thong/job-app-agent/commits/e046538860e56e7efe1db310859799cbf0a93f70"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/224203174?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nathan-thong/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_