ents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/3f61b7a1f3e26133cfd0be3210c9c2d25fa8cb6b","node_id":"C_kwDOTjCjItoAKDNmNjFiN2ExZjNlMjYxMzNjZmQwYmUzMjEwYzljMmQyNWZhOGNiNmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/4508db2ef969b9f93f6ae6e7d4cb49b6004e0306","sha":"4508db2ef969b9f93f6ae6e7d4cb49b6004e0306","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/4508db2ef969b9f93f6ae6e7d4cb49b6004e0306"}],"sha":"3f61b7a1f3e26133cfd0be3210c9c2d25fa8cb6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/3f61b7a1f3e26133cfd0be3210c9c2d25fa8cb6b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/4508db2ef969b9f93f6ae6e7d4cb49b6004e0306/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T16:04:32Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T16:04:32Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"message":"feat(dashboard): per-second gauge tick + new ranges + cleaner tach\n\nThree things in this pass:\n\n1. Per-second tick for cpu/mem/swap. The deployd now\n   runs a second background loop (_broadcast_fast_loop)\n   that does a cheap /proc-only snapshot every 1 s and\n   emits a state_fast WS message with just the system\n   slice. The slow 3 s loop still does the heavy stuff\n   (docker ps, icecast, du -sb, db counts). The\n   frontend exposes onFastSystem on DashboardClient and\n   the three TachCards now read from a separate\n   fastSystem state so they update at 1 Hz without\n   forcing the rest of the page to re-render.\n\n2. New ranges: 1m, 5m, 15m, 30m on top of the existing\n   1h, 6h, 24h, 7d, 30d. Default is now 1m. The\n   dashboard_history.RANGES dict in the deployd is\n   extended with the four sub-hour windows; the\n   broadcast_fast_loop also appends a 1-Hz history\n   sample so the 1m range has data to draw.\n\n3. TachCard redesign. The previous half-donut gauge\n   was leaving a 220px vertical band of empty space\n   above the number and the digits at 4.5 rem were\n   dominating the row. Replaced with a compact\n   horizontal layout: title, big number + unit on one\n   line, a coloured progress bar across the full\n   width, and a status label below. Same warn/mid/ok\n   colour rules, but the digits now read at 2.25 rem\n   so the three cards match the rest of the page.\n\n4. Glow unification. Moved the wide 5-stop text-shadow\n   off the .tach-num and onto .dseg itself, so every\n   DSEG14 number on the page gets the same wide\n   blurred bloom. Also added .dseg.warn and .dseg.mid\n   so any digit can switch to red or amber by adding\n   the class — no need to duplicate the shadow stack\n   on each component.\n\nBumps to 0.8.0 so the shell picks up the new ?v=\nquery for cache busting.","tree":{"sha":"caa46ac00e1a8e48fccc8b0b00c4a1bf04a66801","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/trees/caa46ac00e1a8e48fccc8b0b00c4a1bf04a66801"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/commits/4508db2ef969b9f93f6ae6e7d4cb49b6004e0306","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/4508db2ef969b9f93f6ae6e7d4cb49b6004e0306","node_id":"C_kwDOTjCjItoAKDQ1MDhkYjJlZjk2OWI5ZjkzZjZhZTZlN2Q0Y2I0OWI2MDA0ZTAzMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/eb2192da0e6646d60d194a6a7b47c3d40cc90333","sha":"eb2192da0e6646d60d194a6a7b47c3d40cc90333","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/eb2192da0e6646d60d194a6a7b47c3d40cc90333"}],"sha":"4508db2ef969b9f93f6ae6e7d4cb49b6004e0306","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/4508db2ef969b9f93f6ae6e7d4cb49b6004e0306"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/eb2192da0e6646d60d194a6a7b47c3d40cc90333/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T16:00:39Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T16:00:39Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"message":"feat(dashboard): make the disk panel informative\n\nThe disk card was a donut + two numbers. Replace\nit with a real panel:\n\n- disk donut now slices by top directory (4 colors\n  + ''other'' in slate-800) so you can see at a\n  glance that the chat DB or the deploy logs are\n  the ones eating /data.\n- a status pill next to the title: ok / warm / hot\n  / err, with the same thresholds the rest of the\n  page uses (70 / 85 %).\n- the inodes line, with its own bar and color rule\n  (75 / 90 %). The /data filesystem on a small\n  droplet is more likely to die of inode exhaustion\n  than byte exhaustion once attachments and chat\n  messages pile up.\n- a ''top dirs'' table: path, dseg-formatted size,\n  and a per-dir bar that scales against the disk\n  total. The bars use the same warn/mid/ok colors\n  the rest of the page uses.\n\nBackend (services/deployd/dashboard_state.py):\n  - _disk() now also reads statvfs and reports\n    inodes used/total/pct.\n  - new _top_dirs() helper runs a focused du -sb\n    against the 5 paths that actually grow on this\n    host: late-auth, late-chat-service, the\n    chat-bridge safety net, deploy logs and the\n    dashboard history.\n  - g_system() exposes top_dirs in the payload.\n\ndashboard-client.ts extends the system shape with\nthe inodes and top_dirs fields.\n\nBumps to 0.7.0 so the shell picks up the new ?v=\nquery for cache busting.","tree":{"sha":"d1995f5bbea7030c44bb7547d1520efdbd702e1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/trees/d1995f5bbea7030c44bb7547d1520efdbd702e1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/commits/eb2192da0e6646d60d194a6a7b47c3d40cc90333","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/eb2192da0e6646d60d194a6a7b47c3d40cc90333","node_id":"C_kwDOTjCjItoAKGViMjE5MmRhMGU2NjQ2ZDYwZDE5NGE2YTdiNDdjM2Q0MGNjOTAzMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/85c9d8a4ab0bacc31d625764c51abae19493952a","sha":"85c9d8a4ab0bacc31d625764c51abae19493952a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/85c9d8a4ab0bacc31d625764c51abae19493952a"}],"sha":"eb2192da0e6646d60d194a6a7b47c3d40cc90333","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/eb2192da0e6646d60d194a6a7b47c3d40cc90333"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/85c9d8a4ab0bacc31d625764c51abae19493952a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:58:08Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:58:08Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"message":"fix(dashboard): move uptime card above the system section\n\nThe uptime was sitting at the bottom of the system\nsection, below the overview chart and the\nload-avg/disk row. Pulled it out and placed it\ndirectly under the time range bar so it reads as\na top-of-page strip: time range -> uptime ->\nsystem gauges -> overview -> load/disk.","tree":{"sha":"e0460e82a2538a7425463230788f709142d1e4d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/trees/e0460e82a2538a7425463230788f709142d1e4d3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/commits/85c9d8a4ab0bacc31d625764c51abae19493952a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/85c9d8a4ab0bacc31d625764c51abae19493952a","node_id":"C_kwDOTjCjItoAKDg1YzlkOGE0YWIwYmFjYzMxZDYyNTc2NGM1MWFiYWUxOTQ5Mzk1MmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/1eb8aff6bf4da5c3d3b217ee21bd671f2260df3e","sha":"1eb8aff6bf4da5c3d3b217ee21bd671f2260df3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/1eb8aff6bf4da5c3d3b217ee21bd671f2260df3e"}],"sha":"85c9d8a4ab0bacc31d625764c51abae19493952a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/85c9d8a4ab0bacc31d625764c51abae19493952a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/1eb8aff6bf4da5c3d3b217ee21bd671f2260df3e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:56:23Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:56:23Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"message":"fix(dashboard): bigger tachometer digits with wider glow\n\nThe tachometer cards were rendering the number at\n2.25 rem, which read as a footnote. Bumped to\n4.5 rem and widened the arc to fill the same\nspace (innerRadius 62%, barSize 18). The text\nshadow is now a 5-stop stack (2px / 8px / 18px /\n36px / 72px) so the digits have a real VFD bloom\ninstead of the tight cyan halo they had before.\n\nAdded .warn and .modifiers on .tach-num so the\ndigit also turns red/amber when the value crosses\nthe warn / mid thresholds, matching the arc\ncolor below it.\n\nThe tach-wrap height goes from 130 to 220 px to\nmatch the larger digit.","tree":{"sha":"c78d73cd4f8ac83cb0c2342c1e27c67893df1947","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/trees/c78d73cd4f8ac83cb0c2342c1e27c67893df1947"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/commits/1eb8aff6bf4da5c3d3b217ee21bd671f2260df3e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/1eb8aff6bf4da5c3d3b217ee21bd671f2260df3e","node_id":"C_kwDOTjCjItoAKDFlYjhhZmY2YmY0ZGE1YzNkM2IyMTdlZTIxYmQ2NzFmMjI2MGRmM2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/c5fe86e643d1e98bb8c6352f8bf7b1a33cb6d6bf","sha":"c5fe86e643d1e98bb8c6352f8bf7b1a33cb6d6bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/c5fe86e643d1e98bb8c6352f8bf7b1a33cb6d6bf"}],"sha":"1eb8aff6bf4da5c3d3b217ee21bd671f2260df3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/1eb8aff6bf4da5c3d3b217ee21bd671f2260df3e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/c5fe86e643d1e98bb8c6352f8bf7b1a33cb6d6bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:53:12Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:53:12Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"message":"feat(dashboard): wide uptime card with d/h/m/s/ms\n\nThe uptime was a small card squeezed into the third\ncolumn of the system row. Replaced with a full-width\ncard centred in its own row, organised as a 5-column\ngrid (Days / Hrs / Min / Sec / MS), where the first\nrow is the digits in the DSEG cyan-glow face and the\nsecond row is the uppercase unit label.\n\nThe number is driven by a local rAF loop at ~30 fps\nthat anchors to the integer /proc/uptime from the\nWS payload and adds a wall-clock delta on top. So\nthe moment the dashboard connects, the millisecond\ncounter starts moving visibly without waiting for a\nfresh WS tick.\n\nThe system row below now has two columns instead\nof three: load avg on the left, disk donut on the\nright.\n\nBumps to 0.6.0 so the shell picks up the new ?v=\nquery for cache busting.","tree":{"sha":"440127dd481331f87d65b23c7123f059f81020da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/trees/440127dd481331f87d65b23c7123f059f81020da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/commits/c5fe86e643d1e98bb8c6352f8bf7b1a33cb6d6bf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/c5fe86e643d1e98bb8c6352f8bf7b1a33cb6d6bf","node_id":"C_kwDOTjCjItoAKGM1ZmU4NmU2NDNkMWU5OGJiOGM2MzUyZjhiZjdiMWEzM2NiNmQ2YmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/6bdd72f9ad22f3f847f840733f3d9bb20f2e7d5b","sha":"6bdd72f9ad22f3f847f840733f3d9bb20f2e7d5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/6bdd72f9ad22f3f847f840733f3d9bb20f2e7d5b"}],"sha":"c5fe86e643d1e98bb8c6352f8bf7b1a33cb6d6bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/c5fe86e643d1e98bb8c6352f8bf7b1a33cb6d6bf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/6bdd72f9ad22f3f847f840733f3d9bb20f2e7d5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:50:04Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:50:04Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"message":"feat(dashboard): cpu/mem/swap as tachometer gauges\n\nThe three metric cards at the top of the system\nsection were each rendering a small area chart,\nbut the overview chart one row below already shows\nthe same three series over the full time range.\nThe mini area chart was redundant.\n\nReplace GaugeCard with TachCard: a half-donut\nRadialBarChart that reads like an analog\ntachometer. The arc spans 180° to 0° (left to\nright), the live value is a colored bar inside a\nslate-800 track, and the DSEG number sits below\nthe curve like a needle. Color is cyan in the\nhealthy range, amber in the warm range, and rose\nin the hot range, matching the warn/mid thresholds\nthe previous cards used.\n\nBumps to 0.5.0 so the shell picks up the new ?v=\nquery for cache busting.","tree":{"sha":"0693aa0c3d9d6f64b573db91cafb6cb94d1525c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/trees/0693aa0c3d9d6f64b573db91cafb6cb94d1525c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/commits/6bdd72f9ad22f3f847f840733f3d9bb20f2e7d5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/6bdd72f9ad22f3f847f840733f3d9bb20f2e7d5b","node_id":"C_kwDOTjCjItoAKDZiZGQ3MmY5YWQyMmYzZjg0N2Y4NDA3MzNmM2Q5YmIyMGYyZTdkNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/5c2af97768cb9fa3d4aeb3e605c190480f603ed8","sha":"5c2af97768cb9fa3d4aeb3e605c190480f603ed8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/5c2af97768cb9fa3d4aeb3e605c190480f603ed8"}],"sha":"6bdd72f9ad22f3f847f840733f3d9bb20f2e7d5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/6bdd72f9ad22f3f847f840733f3d9bb20f2e7d5b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/5c2af97768cb9fa3d4aeb3e605c190480f603ed8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:43:24Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:43:24Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"message":"fix(dashboard): tooltip line-height so lines don''t overlap\n\nRecharts default-tooltip inherits a line-height\nthat collapses the rows when the italic DSEG face\nsits next to a system font. The label and the\nitem rows end up on the same baseline, so a value\nlike ''23%'' and the timestamp underneath looked\npainted on top of each other.\n\nForce line-height: 1.5 on the wrapper, on the\nlabel, and on each item row, plus 8px 12px padding\nand a 2px vertical padding on the items. Same\ntreatment on the inline tooltipStyle constant so\nthe gauges and the donut tooltips line up.","tree":{"sha":"3bf444c5a3d1ade3758e67cf77b2c0f01893e4cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/trees/3bf444c5a3d1ade3758e67cf77b2c0f01893e4cc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/commits/5c2af97768cb9fa3d4aeb3e605c190480f603ed8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/5c2af97768cb9fa3d4aeb3e605c190480f603ed8","node_id":"C_kwDOTjCjItoAKDVjMmFmOTc3NjhjYjlmYTNkNGFlYjNlNjA1YzE5MDQ4MGY2MDNlZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/c4736845c40eb44c52ab84ff062cc2bf1376b6a5","sha":"c4736845c40eb44c52ab84ff062cc2bf1376b6a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/c4736845c40eb44c52ab84ff062cc2bf1376b6a5"}],"sha":"5c2af97768cb9fa3d4aeb3e605c190480f603ed8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/5c2af97768cb9fa3d4aeb3e605c190480f603ed8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/c4736845c40eb44c52ab84ff062cc2bf1376b6a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:35:33Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:35:33Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"message":"feat(dashboard): organise page by category\n\nThe dashboard was a long flat list of cards. Hard\nto skim: where does the radio end and the storage\nbegin? Now the page is divided into six labelled\nchapters in this order:\n\n  system    cpu/mem/swap gauges, overview 4-series\n            chart, load avg + sparkline, disk\n            donut, uptime\n  services  avg latency line chart + per-service\n            sparkline table\n  radio     listeners area + top channels bar +\n            full icecast source list\n  storage   db size donut + record counts bar +\n            auth/chat stat cards\n  containers docker ps table\n  deploys   scatter timeline + ok/fail donut +\n            recent deploys log\n\nEach section has its own header: a small cyan-glow\nicon, a chapter-style uppercase title, and a faint\nsubtitle explaining what''s inside. The hairline\nunder the header matches the card borders, so the\nsection reads as labelled, not boxed.\n\nBumps to 0.4.0 so the shell picks up the new ?v=\nquery for cache busting.","tree":{"sha":"68de0550b875ad09c258b923d39ca29ae03cb523","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/trees/68de0550b875ad09c258b923d39ca29ae03cb523"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/commits/c4736845c40eb44c52ab84ff062cc2bf1376b6a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/c4736845c40eb44c52ab84ff062cc2bf1376b6a5","node_id":"C_kwDOTjCjItoAKGM0NzM2ODQ1YzQwZWI0NGM1MmFiODRmZjA2MmNjMmJmMTM3NmI2YTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/7384ee0867988dd1807c12a5159db60f761dc9de","sha":"7384ee0867988dd1807c12a5159db60f761dc9de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/7384ee0867988dd1807c12a5159db60f761dc9de"}],"sha":"c4736845c40eb44c52ab84ff062cc2bf1376b6a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/c4736845c40eb44c52ab84ff062cc2bf1376b6a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/7384ee0867988dd1807c12a5159db60f761dc9de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:17:04Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T15:17:04Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"message":"feat(dashboard): more recharts across the page\n\nThe dashboard was leaning on three area charts for\nthe three CPU/memory/swap gauges. The rest of the\npage was a wall of tables and DSEG numbers. Backend\nnow records three more history series (total\nlisteners, average service latency, load 1m), so\nthe same recharts vocabulary can replace more\nplain-text metrics with a chart that updates live.\n\nWhat is new:\n\n- overview chart: 4-series AreaChart that joins\n  CPU / memory / swap / load 1m onto a shared x\n  axis. Load is rescaled to /4 so it sits next to\n  the percentage metrics on one y axis. Drives the\n  selected time range, same cadence as the gauges.\n- load avg card: keeps the 1m/5m/15m table, adds\n  a sparkline of load 1m below it.\n- disk donut: used vs free on /data.\n- services card: per-row sparkline in a new\n  ''last 5m'' column. The sparkline is a client-side\n  ring buffer (100 samples / ~5 min) because the\n  backend only persists the *average* latency. The\n  card also has a global avg-latency LineChart at\n  the top, fed by the new latency_ms history.\n- icecast listeners area + top channels bar\n  (top 8 mounts by listener count, horizontal).\n- db size donut: auth vs chat vs other (other is\n  /data total minus the two DB files).\n- db record counts bar: all 9 tables in one\n  BarChart, each with its own color.\n- deploy timeline ScatterChart: x = time, y = repo,\n  green dot for ok, red for fail. Y axis is\n  categorical via an index map. Companion\n  ok/fail donut.\n\nBackend changes (services/deployd/dashboard_state.py\n+ dashboard_ws.py): snapshot() now appends\nlisteners, latency_ms, and load_1m to the history\nstore every 3 s. The 1h WS backfill includes all\nsix metrics. dashboard-client.ts extends Metric\nand loadRange() accordingly.\n\nCSS: adds .chart-tall (220px) for the overview and\n.chart-mini (120x120) for the donut pairings.\n\nBumps to 0.3.0 so the shell picks up the new ?v=\nquery for cache busting.","tree":{"sha":"d764fef67cf073974c773491f0429deddfbb3e58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/trees/d764fef67cf073974c773491f0429deddfbb3e58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/commits/7384ee0867988dd1807c12a5159db60f761dc9de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/7384ee0867988dd1807c12a5159db60f761dc9de","node_id":"C_kwDOTjCjItoAKDczODRlZTA4Njc5ODhkZDE4MDdjMTJhNTE1OWRiNjBmNzYxZGM5ZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/30a21c176117d583149470000e42ab64d4ea8e23","sha":"30a21c176117d583149470000e42ab64d4ea8e23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/30a21c176117d583149470000e42ab64d4ea8e23"}],"sha":"7384ee0867988dd1807c12a5159db60f761dc9de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/7384ee0867988dd1807c12a5159db60f761dc9de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/30a21c176117d583149470000e42ab64d4ea8e23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:46:03Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:46:03Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"message":"feat(dashboard): DSEG 14 italic + load avg table\n\nTwo refinements after staring at the page:\n\n- Switch the dashboard''s display font from DSEG 7\n  Classic to DSEG 14 Classic Italic. The 14 is\n  bigger and clearer at 24-32 px; the italic face\n  keeps the seven-segment silhouette but adds a\n  subtle slant that reads more like a 1980s\n  industrial VFD than a calculator. Same cyan +\n  text-shadow glow.\n- Replace the single ''load avg'' number with a\n  three-row table: 1m / 5m / 15m, the DSEG value\n  on the right, and a small bar that scales the\n  three values against the largest of the window.\n  Same colour rules as the disk gauge (warn >= 2,\n  mid >= 1, ok below).\n\nBumps to 0.2.0 so the shell rebuild picks up the\nnew ?v= query for cache busting.","tree":{"sha":"fcf7ab17fa6c0ceb9b450188a0144580bd8dc8ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/trees/fcf7ab17fa6c0ceb9b450188a0144580bd8dc8ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/commits/30a21c176117d583149470000e42ab64d4ea8e23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/30a21c176117d583149470000e42ab64d4ea8e23","node_id":"C_kwDOTjCjItoAKDMwYTIxYzE3NjExN2Q1ODMxNDk0NzAwMDBlNDJhYjY0ZDRlYThlMjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/ec73a5fcdf4b5228970c0334140602237b482266","sha":"ec73a5fcdf4b5228970c0334140602237b482266","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/ec73a5fcdf4b5228970c0334140602237b482266"}],"sha":"30a21c176117d583149470000e42ab64d4ea8e23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/30a21c176117d583149470000e42ab64d4ea8e23"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/ec73a5fcdf4b5228970c0334140602237b482266/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:43:03Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:43:03Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"message":"fix(build): shim process.env for recharts via vite define\n\nrecharts (and a handful of other deps) reference process.env.NODE_ENV at module-load time. The browser has no process, so the bundle threw a ReferenceError on first load.\n\nVite''s define option does a static, build-time replacement of any string the bundler sees. Setting process.env to {} (and process.env.NODE_ENV to production explicitly) means every recharts internal that does process.env.NODE_ENV ends up reading a literal value at parse time. No runtime polyfill, no ordering concern, and the bundle shrinks by ~30 KB because the recharts dev-only branches get dead-code-eliminated.","tree":{"sha":"eb2c6d6cec7bb0a31c44e083ef9558b47d99d236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/trees/eb2c6d6cec7bb0a31c44e083ef9558b47d99d236"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/commits/ec73a5fcdf4b5228970c0334140602237b482266","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/ec73a5fcdf4b5228970c0334140602237b482266","node_id":"C_kwDOTjCjItoAKGVjNzNhNWZjZGY0YjUyMjg5NzBjMDMzNDE0MDY