ogin":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/8c8d9e9837543302224c1520c230b0574b7176d8","node_id":"C_kwDOTjCjItoAKDhjOGQ5ZTk4Mzc1NDMzMDIyMjRjMTUyMGMyMzBiMDU3NGI3MTc2ZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commit/22a6a0d9fc301d2a9bce0014645b60c8ca477ce2","sha":"22a6a0d9fc301d2a9bce0014645b60c8ca477ce2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/22a6a0d9fc301d2a9bce0014645b60c8ca477ce2"}],"sha":"8c8d9e9837543302224c1520c230b0574b7176d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/8c8d9e9837543302224c1520c230b0574b7176d8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/333442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/madkoding","id":333442,"login":"madkoding","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzQ0Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/madkoding","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/commits/22a6a0d9fc301d2a9bce0014645b60c8ca477ce2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:33:46Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T08:33:46Z","email":"madkoding@gmail.com","name":"madKoding"},"message":"feat: initial late-micro-dashboard\n\nRecharts + WS dashboard for late.kodingvibes.com.\n\nThe MF consumes the live state stream from late-deployd\n(/api/dashboard/ws, every 3s) and the 1h backfill that\nships on every WS tick. Longer ranges (6h / 24h / 7d /\n30d) hit /api/dashboard/history on demand.\n\nStack:\n- React 18 + TypeScript\n- Vite lib mode (ESM, React externalized via the shell''s\n  import map at /vendor/vendor.js)\n- recharts 2 (Area + Line + custom Tooltip)\n- Tailwind 4 for the layout grid; the page keeps the shell\n  palette (slate ground, indigo/violet/pink) so /dashboard\n  feels like part of late.kodingvibes.com and not a\n  separate product.\n\nTypography: numbers use DSEG7-Classic (SIL OFL) in cyan\nwith a soft text-shadow glow, evoking a seven-segment\ndisplay. Public/fonts/ ships the woff2 + license; the\nbuild copies them into dist/fonts/ and the entry appends\n@font-face rules at runtime pointing at the versioned\npath.\n\nState shape, types, and WS client are in\nsrc/lib/dashboard-client.ts; the page is in\nsrc/pages/Dashboard/Dashboard.tsx; mount glue is in\nmount.tsx.","tree":{"sha":"b591a81146c4b3826ac039760887700fd42f8785","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/trees/b591a81146c4b3826ac039760887700fd42f8785"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kodingvibes/late-micro-dashboard/git/commits/22a6a0d9fc301d2a9bce0014645b60c8ca477ce2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at